window.COURSE = {"slug": "machine-learning", "title": "機器學習完整教學", "shortTitle": "機器學習", "updated": "2026-10-30", "baseline": "scikit-learn 1.9.1", "footerLabel": "MACHINE LEARNING · SCIKIT-LEARN 1.9.1", "exampleBundle": "examples.zip", "searchHint": "試試洩漏、Ridge、SVM、交叉驗證、校準、KMeans 或 PCA。", "groups": [{"id": "foundations", "number": "01", "title": "先把學習問題定義清楚", "description": "問題、環境、數學、損失與資料的第一份契約。"}, {"id": "data", "number": "02", "title": "可信的資料處理流程", "description": "切分、洩漏、缺失、尺度、類別與特徵工程。"}, {"id": "linear", "number": "03", "title": "從線性模型建立直覺", "description": "回歸、正則化、Logistic、分類型態、SGD 與近鄰。"}, {"id": "nonlinear", "number": "04", "title": "非線性與集成模型", "description": "Naive Bayes、SVM、決策樹、森林與 Boosting。"}, {"id": "evaluation", "number": "05", "title": "評估與選模", "description": "基準、指標、交叉驗證、搜尋與巢狀評估。"}, {"id": "reliability", "number": "06", "title": "讓決策與結果可信", "description": "不平衡、校準、門檻、學習曲線與不確定性。"}, {"id": "unsupervised", "number": "07", "title": "沒有標籤時如何學習", "description": "分群、密度、PCA、流形視覺化與異常偵測。"}, {"id": "applications", "number": "08", "title": "特徵、解釋與不同資料", "description": "文字、表格、模型解讀、穩健性與增量學習。"}, {"id": "engineering", "number": "09", "title": "交付與完整專案", "description": "保存、推論、效能、監控、分類與回歸專題。"}, {"id": "next", "number": "10", "title": "整合、練習與持續學習", "description": "分群專題、模型選擇、新版API、跨課程連結與解答。"}], "lessons": [{"id": "01-first-model", "group": "foundations", "title": "機器學習全貌：從資料到可以驗證的預測", "summary": "先跑一個完整模型，再逐步拆開資料、規則、損失與泛化。", "tags": ["machine learning", "workflow", "fit", "predict"], "example": "01_first_pipeline.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">機器學習全貌：從資料到可以驗證的預測</h1>\n<p>先跑一個完整模型，再逐步拆開資料、規則、損失與泛化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">讓規則從資料學出來</h2>\n<p>傳統程式由人明確列規則；機器學習先選一類可調函數，再用樣本調整參數。例如根據使用量、使用年資與客服次數預測某事件是否發生。你仍需定義問題、蒐集標籤與安排評估，模型不會替你決定哪些答案值得相信。</p>\n<p>本課以2026-10-30查核的最新穩定版scikit-learn 1.9.1實作，先從表格資料與經典方法完整學起。它提供一致的fit、predict與transform介面，讓你將重點放在學習流程與方法假設。深度學習架構、PyTorch操作及數理統計完整推導另有獨立課程，本課補足理解演算法所需的數學。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">五個基本角色</h2>\n<p>X是特徵矩陣[N,F]，y是答案[N]，模型f有參數，loss衡量預測誤差，訓練程序尋找較合適的參數。驗證及測試資料用來判斷對未見樣本的表現。訓練分數很高，可能只是記住資料；真正目標是你所關心分布上的可靠預測。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\hat y=f_\\theta(x),\\qquad \\hat\\theta=\\arg\\min_\\theta\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N\\ell(f_\\theta(x_i),y_i)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">第一個可執行流程</h2>\n<p>範例生成固定合成資料，先切分，再將StandardScaler與LogisticRegression包成Pipeline，只在train fit；在保留資料上計算分數，並與DummyClassifier比較。這些數字只描述合成問題，不是任何真實業務的準確率。</p>\n<p>閱讀輸出時先看正例比例與dummy，再看模型的precision、recall及average precision。不要只因accuracy大於0.8就說模型好，因為只猜多數類也可能很高。多個指標各有目的，會在評估篇逐步解釋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">學習方式與路線</h2>\n<p>1–12章建立資料與問題契約；13–24章學主要演算法；25–36章學如何比較與決策；37–48章進入非監督與不同應用；49–60章完成交付、專題與練習。每章先預測結果，再執行與修改一個因素。網站實驗使用JavaScript數學；Python範例才是真正scikit-learn。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>模型只學會train樣本算不算成功？解答：尚不足，需要保留資料、合理切分及任務指標。若模型分數低於dummy，先查資料訊號、標籤時間與前處理，再考慮複雜模型。預測與因果不同：某特徵能預測事件，不代表改變它一定改變事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/01_first_pipeline.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;A complete fixed-model classification workflow; synthetic data.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.dummy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">DummyClassifier</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x_train</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">x_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y_train</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y_test</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l1_ratio</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x_train</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y_train</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">baseline</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">DummyClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">strategy</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;prior&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x_train</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y_train</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;pipeline&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">x_test</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;dummy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y_test</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">baseline</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">x_test</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;fixed settings, synthetic holdout; no production accuracy claim&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_8\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/getting_started.html\">官方入門</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/releases/tag/1.9.1\">最新正式發布</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 機器學習全貌：從資料到可以驗證的預測\n\n先跑一個完整模型，再逐步拆開資料、規則、損失與泛化。\n\n## 讓規則從資料學出來\n\n傳統程式由人明確列規則；機器學習先選一類可調函數，再用樣本調整參數。例如根據使用量、使用年資與客服次數預測某事件是否發生。你仍需定義問題、蒐集標籤與安排評估，模型不會替你決定哪些答案值得相信。\n\n本課以2026-10-30查核的最新穩定版scikit-learn 1.9.1實作，先從表格資料與經典方法完整學起。它提供一致的fit、predict與transform介面，讓你將重點放在學習流程與方法假設。深度學習架構、PyTorch操作及數理統計完整推導另有獨立課程，本課補足理解演算法所需的數學。\n\n## 五個基本角色\n\nX是特徵矩陣[N,F]，y是答案[N]，模型f有參數，loss衡量預測誤差，訓練程序尋找較合適的參數。驗證及測試資料用來判斷對未見樣本的表現。訓練分數很高，可能只是記住資料；真正目標是你所關心分布上的可靠預測。\n\n$$\n\\hat y=f_\\theta(x),\\qquad \\hat\\theta=\\arg\\min_\\theta\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N\\ell(f_\\theta(x_i),y_i)\n$$\n\n## 第一個可執行流程\n\n範例生成固定合成資料，先切分，再將StandardScaler與LogisticRegression包成Pipeline，只在train fit；在保留資料上計算分數，並與DummyClassifier比較。這些數字只描述合成問題，不是任何真實業務的準確率。\n\n閱讀輸出時先看正例比例與dummy，再看模型的precision、recall及average precision。不要只因accuracy大於0.8就說模型好，因為只猜多數類也可能很高。多個指標各有目的，會在評估篇逐步解釋。\n\n## 學習方式與路線\n\n1–12章建立資料與問題契約；13–24章學主要演算法；25–36章學如何比較與決策；37–48章進入非監督與不同應用；49–60章完成交付、專題與練習。每章先預測結果，再執行與修改一個因素。網站實驗使用JavaScript數學；Python範例才是真正scikit-learn。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n模型只學會train樣本算不算成功？解答：尚不足，需要保留資料、合理切分及任務指標。若模型分數低於dummy，先查資料訊號、標籤時間與前處理，再考慮複雜模型。預測與因果不同：某特徵能預測事件，不代表改變它一定改變事件。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/01_first_pipeline.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"A complete fixed-model classification workflow; synthetic data.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom sklearn.dummy import DummyClassifier\nfrom course_core import binary_data, holdout, probability, binary_metrics\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        x_train,x_test,y_train,y_test=holdout(x,y)\n        model=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),LogisticRegression(l1_ratio=0,max_iter=1000))\n        model.fit(x_train,y_train)\n        baseline=DummyClassifier(strategy='prior').fit(x_train,y_train)\n        result={'pipeline':binary_metrics(y_test,probability(model,x_test)),\n                'dummy':binary_metrics(y_test,probability(baseline,x_test)),\n                'scope':'fixed settings, synthetic holdout; no production accuracy claim'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [官方入門](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/getting_started.html)\n- [最新正式發布](https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/releases/tag/1.9.1)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "機器學習全貌：從資料到可以驗證的預測", "html": "機器學習全貌：從資料到可以驗證的預測", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "讓規則從資料學出來", "html": "讓規則從資料學出來", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "五個基本角色", "html": "五個基本角色", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "第一個可執行流程", "html": "第一個可執行流程", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "學習方式與路線", "html": "學習方式與路線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "02-environment", "group": "foundations", "title": "最新版環境與工具：建立可重現的scikit-learn專案", "summary": "確認套件版本、解譯器與範例結構，讓日後升版能重新驗證。", "tags": ["install", "1.9.1", "venv", "NumPy", "SciPy"], "html": "<h1 id=\"scikit-learn\">最新版環境與工具：建立可重現的scikit-learn專案</h1>\n<p>確認套件版本、解譯器與範例結構，讓日後升版能重新驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">最新版要有查核證據</h2>\n<p>scikit-learn 1.9.1已從官方release、1.9文件與PyPI交叉確認為查核日最新穩定版，支援Python&gt;=3.11。本課在Python3.11.6實測，固定scikit-learn1.9.1、NumPy2.4.6、SciPy1.17.1等相依版本。主框架採最新版；數值依賴是這個Python環境的相容組合，不宣稱每一個依賴都是全球最新版本。</p>\n<p>查核時NumPy2.5.4與SciPy1.18.1要求Python&gt;=3.12，因此沒有把它們硬裝到3.11。若選新版Python與新數值套件，另建環境重新驗證即可；不要把安裝限制誤認為機器學習觀念不同。完整需求檔會固定已測組合，未來課程更新重新查核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"windows\">Windows安裝與執行</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">-m</span> <span class=\"n\">venv</span> <span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">venv</span>\n<span class=\"p\">.\\.</span><span class=\"n\">venv</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">Scripts</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">python</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exe</span> <span class=\"n\">-m</span> <span class=\"n\">pip</span> <span class=\"n\">install</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-upgrade</span> <span class=\"n\">pip</span>\n<span class=\"p\">.\\.</span><span class=\"n\">venv</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">Scripts</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">python</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exe</span> <span class=\"n\">-m</span> <span class=\"n\">pip</span> <span class=\"n\">install</span> <span class=\"n\">-r</span> <span class=\"n\">machine-learning</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">requirements</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">txt</span>\n<span class=\"p\">.\\.</span><span class=\"n\">venv</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">Scripts</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">python</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exe</span> <span class=\"n\">machine-learning</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">30_capstone</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>macOS／Linux用<code>.venv/bin/python</code>。若下載ZIP後已進入examples，需求檔改requirements.txt，入口改30_capstone.py。網站閱讀不需要Python，範例訓練才需要這些套件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">確認使用同一解譯器</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sys</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">scipy</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sys</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">executable</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sklearn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">__version__</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">numpy</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">__version__</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">scipy</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">__version__</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>IDE選錯Python時，pip成功仍可能import失敗。<code>python -m pip</code>能降低pip與解譯器不一致的風險。遇到安裝錯誤先檢查Python、64位元與平台wheel，不先修改模型程式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">範例資料與安全範圍</h2>\n<p>30個入口預設CPU、固定合成資料與自寫短文本，不下載外部資料／模型、不呼叫API。沒有pandas也能學完整主線：混合欄位以NumPy陣列與ColumnTransformer示範。真正CSV、資料庫與模型服務需加入你自己的資料契約。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>記錄Python與三個套件版本，再從另一個資料夾執行範例。解答：保留整個examples，檔案資料以__file__定位；將環境與程式一起記錄，才知道未來差異來自版本、資料還是演算法。升版需重跑選模、指標與保存測試，不能只改requirements數字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/install.html\">安裝與版本需求</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/whats_new/v1.9.html\">1.9更新紀錄</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/numpy/\">NumPy套件資訊</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/scipy/\">SciPy套件資訊</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 最新版環境與工具：建立可重現的scikit-learn專案\n\n確認套件版本、解譯器與範例結構，讓日後升版能重新驗證。\n\n## 最新版要有查核證據\n\nscikit-learn 1.9.1已從官方release、1.9文件與PyPI交叉確認為查核日最新穩定版，支援Python>=3.11。本課在Python3.11.6實測，固定scikit-learn1.9.1、NumPy2.4.6、SciPy1.17.1等相依版本。主框架採最新版；數值依賴是這個Python環境的相容組合，不宣稱每一個依賴都是全球最新版本。\n\n查核時NumPy2.5.4與SciPy1.18.1要求Python>=3.12，因此沒有把它們硬裝到3.11。若選新版Python與新數值套件，另建環境重新驗證即可；不要把安裝限制誤認為機器學習觀念不同。完整需求檔會固定已測組合，未來課程更新重新查核。\n\n## Windows安裝與執行\n\n```powershell\npython -m venv .venv\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m pip install --upgrade pip\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m pip install -r machine-learning/examples/requirements.txt\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe machine-learning/examples/30_capstone.py\n```\n\nmacOS／Linux用`.venv/bin/python`。若下載ZIP後已進入examples，需求檔改requirements.txt，入口改30_capstone.py。網站閱讀不需要Python，範例訓練才需要這些套件。\n\n## 確認使用同一解譯器\n\n```python\nimport sys, sklearn, numpy, scipy\nprint(sys.executable)\nprint(sklearn.__version__, numpy.__version__, scipy.__version__)\n```\n\nIDE選錯Python時，pip成功仍可能import失敗。`python -m pip`能降低pip與解譯器不一致的風險。遇到安裝錯誤先檢查Python、64位元與平台wheel，不先修改模型程式。\n\n## 範例資料與安全範圍\n\n30個入口預設CPU、固定合成資料與自寫短文本，不下載外部資料／模型、不呼叫API。沒有pandas也能學完整主線：混合欄位以NumPy陣列與ColumnTransformer示範。真正CSV、資料庫與模型服務需加入你自己的資料契約。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n記錄Python與三個套件版本，再從另一個資料夾執行範例。解答：保留整個examples，檔案資料以__file__定位；將環境與程式一起記錄，才知道未來差異來自版本、資料還是演算法。升版需重跑選模、指標與保存測試，不能只改requirements數字。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [安裝與版本需求](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/install.html)\n- [1.9更新紀錄](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/whats_new/v1.9.html)\n- [NumPy套件資訊](https://pypi.org/project/numpy/)\n- [SciPy套件資訊](https://pypi.org/project/scipy/)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "scikit-learn", "name": "最新版環境與工具：建立可重現的scikit-learn專案", "html": "最新版環境與工具：建立可重現的scikit-learn專案", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "最新版要有查核證據", "html": "最新版要有查核證據", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "windows", "name": "Windows安裝與執行", "html": "Windows安裝與執行", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "確認使用同一解譯器", "html": "確認使用同一解譯器", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "範例資料與安全範圍", "html": "範例資料與安全範圍", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "03-problem-definition", "group": "foundations", "title": "問題定義：分類、回歸、排序與非監督學習", "summary": "把要預測的對象、時間與使用決策寫清楚，再決定方法。", "tags": ["classification", "regression", "ranking", "target"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">問題定義：分類、回歸、排序與非監督學習</h1>\n<p>把要預測的對象、時間與使用決策寫清楚，再決定方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">先寫一句可驗收的問題</h2>\n<p>「用截至週日可得的資料，預測下一週是否發生事件」比「用AI分析客戶」明確。列出單位是一個人、一張單還是一個時間窗，預測時有哪些特徵，答案何時可取得，以及預測會觸發什麼行動。這些定義決定切分、指標與資料合法時間。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">四種常見任務</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任務</th>\n<th>答案</th>\n<th>常見輸出</th>\n<th>評估起點</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>分類</td>\n<td>有限類別</td>\n<td>類別／每類分數</td>\n<td>混淆矩陣、AP、成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回歸</td>\n<td>連續數值</td>\n<td>數量或金額</td>\n<td>MAE、RMSE、單位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序</td>\n<td>候選的相對次序</td>\n<td>排名</td>\n<td>Recall@k、NDCG等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非監督</td>\n<td>沒有指定答案</td>\n<td>分群／表示／異常分數</td>\n<td>穩定性、結構與用途</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>排序若只用分類accuracy，可能忽略前幾名是否有用；聚類若沒有真實標籤，就不能隨便報分類正確率。本課主線為分類、回歸與非監督，排序只說明與檢索領域的橋接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">標籤也是設計出來的</h2>\n<p>「沒有觀察到事件」不一定等於「不會發生」，可能追蹤時間不足。人工分類可能意見不同；未標註不一定是負例。資料工程應保存label定義、標註日期與可用範圍。若正負樣本只因不同管道蒐集，模型可能學到蒐集方式而非你要的現象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">決策限制與成本</h2>\n<p>每天只能處理20筆，任務可能關心top20命中率；漏掉事件的成本很高，就要關心recall及FN；預測金額則需考慮大誤差與系統性偏差。先定義成本，再決定門檻。模型分數與最後行動是兩層，不能以「輸出機率」取代業務決策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">用時間窗檢查問題是否成立</h2>\n<p>例如每週一預測未來30天是否發生事件，觀察特徵只能使用週一以前的紀錄；週三新取得的資訊不能回填成週一的已知特徵。若資料在第10天就截止，這筆尚未完成30天追蹤，不能直接標成負例。明確定義觀察窗、預測時間、結果窗與label成熟日期，才能對齊訓練與部署。</p>\n<p>同一個人每週產生一筆時，樣本不是自動獨立。要評估既有用戶未來，通常重視時間；要評估全新用戶，則需考慮group隔離。這些選擇應先寫進問題規格，再由模型分數驗證方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>題目：「用結帳後資料預測購買前是否成交」有何問題？解答：使用時間不可能取得的特徵，形成洩漏。改寫成預測當下可用欄位，並設定觀察與結果窗。再說明為何高預測能力不證明因果：觀測特徵可能只是共同原因或事件結果，干預需要額外識別假設。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/machine_learning_map.html\">Estimator選擇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/multiclass.html\">目標類型</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 問題定義：分類、回歸、排序與非監督學習\n\n把要預測的對象、時間與使用決策寫清楚，再決定方法。\n\n## 先寫一句可驗收的問題\n\n「用截至週日可得的資料，預測下一週是否發生事件」比「用AI分析客戶」明確。列出單位是一個人、一張單還是一個時間窗，預測時有哪些特徵，答案何時可取得，以及預測會觸發什麼行動。這些定義決定切分、指標與資料合法時間。\n\n## 四種常見任務\n\n| 任務 | 答案 | 常見輸出 | 評估起點 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 分類 | 有限類別 | 類別／每類分數 | 混淆矩陣、AP、成本 |\n| 回歸 | 連續數值 | 數量或金額 | MAE、RMSE、單位 |\n| 排序 | 候選的相對次序 | 排名 | Recall@k、NDCG等 |\n| 非監督 | 沒有指定答案 | 分群／表示／異常分數 | 穩定性、結構與用途 |\n\n排序若只用分類accuracy，可能忽略前幾名是否有用；聚類若沒有真實標籤，就不能隨便報分類正確率。本課主線為分類、回歸與非監督，排序只說明與檢索領域的橋接。\n\n## 標籤也是設計出來的\n\n「沒有觀察到事件」不一定等於「不會發生」，可能追蹤時間不足。人工分類可能意見不同；未標註不一定是負例。資料工程應保存label定義、標註日期與可用範圍。若正負樣本只因不同管道蒐集，模型可能學到蒐集方式而非你要的現象。\n\n## 決策限制與成本\n\n每天只能處理20筆，任務可能關心top20命中率；漏掉事件的成本很高，就要關心recall及FN；預測金額則需考慮大誤差與系統性偏差。先定義成本，再決定門檻。模型分數與最後行動是兩層，不能以「輸出機率」取代業務決策。\n\n## 用時間窗檢查問題是否成立\n\n例如每週一預測未來30天是否發生事件，觀察特徵只能使用週一以前的紀錄；週三新取得的資訊不能回填成週一的已知特徵。若資料在第10天就截止，這筆尚未完成30天追蹤，不能直接標成負例。明確定義觀察窗、預測時間、結果窗與label成熟日期，才能對齊訓練與部署。\n\n同一個人每週產生一筆時，樣本不是自動獨立。要評估既有用戶未來，通常重視時間；要評估全新用戶，則需考慮group隔離。這些選擇應先寫進問題規格，再由模型分數驗證方案。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n題目：「用結帳後資料預測購買前是否成交」有何問題？解答：使用時間不可能取得的特徵，形成洩漏。改寫成預測當下可用欄位，並設定觀察與結果窗。再說明為何高預測能力不證明因果：觀測特徵可能只是共同原因或事件結果，干預需要額外識別假設。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Estimator選擇](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/machine_learning_map.html)\n- [目標類型](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/multiclass.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "問題定義：分類、回歸、排序與非監督學習", "html": "問題定義：分類、回歸、排序與非監督學習", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "先寫一句可驗收的問題", "html": "先寫一句可驗收的問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "四種常見任務", "html": "四種常見任務", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "標籤也是設計出來的", "html": "標籤也是設計出來的", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "決策限制與成本", "html": "決策限制與成本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "用時間窗檢查問題是否成立", "html": "用時間窗檢查問題是否成立", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "04-mathematics", "group": "foundations", "title": "必要數學：向量、矩陣、機率與條件分布", "summary": "用一份特徵矩陣理解運算記號，建立讀懂後續公式的基礎。", "tags": ["linear algebra", "probability", "expectation", "distribution"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">必要數學：向量、矩陣、機率與條件分布</h1>\n<p>用一份特徵矩陣理解運算記號，建立讀懂後續公式的基礎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">用矩陣描述資料</h2>\n<p>X有N列樣本、F欄特徵，單筆x是F維向量。線性模型用w對特徵加權，加上bias。內積是相同軸乘積求和；距離描述差異；矩陣乘法可一次處理多筆。特徵尺度改變會改變距離與係數意義，不能只看數字大小。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\hat{\\boldsymbol y}=X\\boldsymbol w+b\\boldsymbol 1,\\qquad\n\\lVert x-z\\rVert_2=\\sqrt{\\sum_j(x_j-z_j)^2}\n$$</div>\n<p>若X[N,F]，w[F]，則預測[N]；如果target是[N,1]，NumPy減法可能意外廣播成[N,N]。即使不用PyTorch也要驗證shape。後續指標函式會明確拒絕不相同的回歸向量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">機率是對不確定性的描述</h2>\n<p>P(Y=1|X=x)是給定特徵時的條件機率，不是「這個人有幾成屬於某類」的身份比例。模型估計有誤差，也依賴資料分布。若100個預測約.8的樣本中約80個為真，才是校準的直覺；單筆無法直接驗證一個機率是否精確。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">期望、變異與抽樣</h2>\n<p>期望是依機率加權的平均；變異衡量繞平均的波動。資料集分數是有限樣本估計，不等於未來精確值。同樣模型換split會波動，資料少與稀有正例尤其明顯。固定seed協助重現，但不會消除抽樣不確定性。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\mathbb E[Z]=\\sum_z zP(Z=z),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}(Z)=\\mathbb E[(Z-\\mathbb E Z)^2]\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">梯度與最佳化直覺</h2>\n<p>梯度指出函數局部增長方向，沿負方向小步走可下降；步長太大仍可能失敗。線性回歸可用數值線性代數求解，樹模型用離散分裂搜尋，不是所有fit都在跑相同梯度下降。學API時也要知道它背後求的是哪個問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>x=[1,2]、w=[3,-1]、b=.5，預測為1.5。點[1,2]與[4,6]的L2距離為5。事件成本有.2機率損失10、.8機率損失0，期望損失2。這些手算是後續距離、回歸與成本門檻的共同基礎；更完整證明與空間理論由線性代數／機率論獨立課承接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html\">線性模型公式</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/metrics.html\">距離與核</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 必要數學：向量、矩陣、機率與條件分布\n\n用一份特徵矩陣理解運算記號，建立讀懂後續公式的基礎。\n\n## 用矩陣描述資料\n\nX有N列樣本、F欄特徵，單筆x是F維向量。線性模型用w對特徵加權，加上bias。內積是相同軸乘積求和；距離描述差異；矩陣乘法可一次處理多筆。特徵尺度改變會改變距離與係數意義，不能只看數字大小。\n\n$$\n\\hat{\\boldsymbol y}=X\\boldsymbol w+b\\boldsymbol 1,\\qquad\n\\lVert x-z\\rVert_2=\\sqrt{\\sum_j(x_j-z_j)^2}\n$$\n\n若X[N,F]，w[F]，則預測[N]；如果target是[N,1]，NumPy減法可能意外廣播成[N,N]。即使不用PyTorch也要驗證shape。後續指標函式會明確拒絕不相同的回歸向量。\n\n## 機率是對不確定性的描述\n\nP(Y=1|X=x)是給定特徵時的條件機率，不是「這個人有幾成屬於某類」的身份比例。模型估計有誤差，也依賴資料分布。若100個預測約.8的樣本中約80個為真，才是校準的直覺；單筆無法直接驗證一個機率是否精確。\n\n## 期望、變異與抽樣\n\n期望是依機率加權的平均；變異衡量繞平均的波動。資料集分數是有限樣本估計，不等於未來精確值。同樣模型換split會波動，資料少與稀有正例尤其明顯。固定seed協助重現，但不會消除抽樣不確定性。\n\n$$\n\\mathbb E[Z]=\\sum_z zP(Z=z),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}(Z)=\\mathbb E[(Z-\\mathbb E Z)^2]\n$$\n\n## 梯度與最佳化直覺\n\n梯度指出函數局部增長方向，沿負方向小步走可下降；步長太大仍可能失敗。線性回歸可用數值線性代數求解，樹模型用離散分裂搜尋，不是所有fit都在跑相同梯度下降。學API時也要知道它背後求的是哪個問題。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nx=[1,2]、w=[3,-1]、b=.5，預測為1.5。點[1,2]與[4,6]的L2距離為5。事件成本有.2機率損失10、.8機率損失0，期望損失2。這些手算是後續距離、回歸與成本門檻的共同基礎；更完整證明與空間理論由線性代數／機率論獨立課承接。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [線性模型公式](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html)\n- [距離與核](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/metrics.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "必要數學：向量、矩陣、機率與條件分布", "html": "必要數學：向量、矩陣、機率與條件分布", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "用矩陣描述資料", "html": "用矩陣描述資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "機率是對不確定性的描述", "html": "機率是對不確定性的描述", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "期望、變異與抽樣", "html": "期望、變異與抽樣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "梯度與最佳化直覺", "html": "梯度與最佳化直覺", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "05-risk", "group": "foundations", "title": "損失、經驗風險與泛化：模型到底在最小化什麼", "summary": "分清訓練目標、選模指標與真實使用成本。", "tags": ["loss", "empirical risk", "generalization", "regularization"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">損失、經驗風險與泛化：模型到底在最小化什麼</h1>\n<p>分清訓練目標、選模指標與真實使用成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">訓練誤差只是觀察到的一部分</h2>\n<p>經驗風險是對訓練樣本的平均loss；真正風險是對未來資料分布的期望。資料有限、模型空間大，最小化train loss可能記住雜訊。驗證流程的目的就是估計未見資料上的行為，而不是替train分數找一個更漂亮名稱。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\hat R(f)=\\frac1N\\sum_i\\ell(f(x_i),y_i),\\qquad\nR(f)=\\mathbb E_{(X,Y)\\sim P}\\,[\\ell(f(X),Y)]\n$$</div>\n<p>假設未來分布P改變，舊驗證也可能失準；所以泛化保證依賴資料假設，不能只從模型名稱推定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">不同損失有不同偏好</h2>\n<p>MSE平方放大大殘差；MAE對極端值較不敏感但仍需查資料；Log loss評估指定類別的機率並重罰自信錯誤；hinge loss以margin為主。accuracy不可微、忽略機率品質，常用作評估而不是直接訓練Logistic的目標。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">正則化與模型限制</h2>\n<p>可在目標加入參數懲罰，也可限制樹深、leaf最小樣本或特徵數。這些手段限制對訓練細節的追逐。太強會欠擬合，太弱可能過擬合。正則化係數的意義依演算法與loss縮放，不可把Ridge alpha與Logistic C視為同一方向的量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\hat\\theta=\\arg\\min_\\theta\\left[\\hat R(\\theta)+\\lambda\\Omega(\\theta)\\right]\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">評估指標與決策成本</h2>\n<p>訓練用log loss、CV用average precision、最後門檻用5×FN+FP，可以是合理設計，只要每一層有明確目的與獨立資料角色。不要為了使三者相同而忽略業務需求；也不要在看test後才改目標，然後仍把test當完全未使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>殘差[1,1,4]，MAE=2，MSE=6，RMSE約2.449。若把最後值改8，平方型指標增加更大。解答：這反映偏好的錯誤形態，不代表某指標永遠更科學。選指標要連回單位、成本與分布，並與簡單基準比較。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html\">模型評估與損失</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html\">正則化線性模型</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 損失、經驗風險與泛化：模型到底在最小化什麼\n\n分清訓練目標、選模指標與真實使用成本。\n\n## 訓練誤差只是觀察到的一部分\n\n經驗風險是對訓練樣本的平均loss；真正風險是對未來資料分布的期望。資料有限、模型空間大，最小化train loss可能記住雜訊。驗證流程的目的就是估計未見資料上的行為，而不是替train分數找一個更漂亮名稱。\n\n$$\n\\hat R(f)=\\frac1N\\sum_i\\ell(f(x_i),y_i),\\qquad\nR(f)=\\mathbb E_{(X,Y)\\sim P}\\,[\\ell(f(X),Y)]\n$$\n\n假設未來分布P改變，舊驗證也可能失準；所以泛化保證依賴資料假設，不能只從模型名稱推定。\n\n## 不同損失有不同偏好\n\nMSE平方放大大殘差；MAE對極端值較不敏感但仍需查資料；Log loss評估指定類別的機率並重罰自信錯誤；hinge loss以margin為主。accuracy不可微、忽略機率品質，常用作評估而不是直接訓練Logistic的目標。\n\n## 正則化與模型限制\n\n可在目標加入參數懲罰，也可限制樹深、leaf最小樣本或特徵數。這些手段限制對訓練細節的追逐。太強會欠擬合，太弱可能過擬合。正則化係數的意義依演算法與loss縮放，不可把Ridge alpha與Logistic C視為同一方向的量。\n\n$$\n\\hat\\theta=\\arg\\min_\\theta\\left[\\hat R(\\theta)+\\lambda\\Omega(\\theta)\\right]\n$$\n\n## 評估指標與決策成本\n\n訓練用log loss、CV用average precision、最後門檻用5×FN+FP，可以是合理設計，只要每一層有明確目的與獨立資料角色。不要為了使三者相同而忽略業務需求；也不要在看test後才改目標，然後仍把test當完全未使用。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n殘差[1,1,4]，MAE=2，MSE=6，RMSE約2.449。若把最後值改8，平方型指標增加更大。解答：這反映偏好的錯誤形態，不代表某指標永遠更科學。選指標要連回單位、成本與分布，並與簡單基準比較。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [模型評估與損失](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html)\n- [正則化線性模型](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "損失、經驗風險與泛化：模型到底在最小化什麼", "html": "損失、經驗風險與泛化：模型到底在最小化什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "訓練誤差只是觀察到的一部分", "html": "訓練誤差只是觀察到的一部分", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "不同損失有不同偏好", "html": "不同損失有不同偏好", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "正則化與模型限制", "html": "正則化與模型限制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "評估指標與決策成本", "html": "評估指標與決策成本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "06-data-contract", "group": "foundations", "title": "資料探索與schema：一欄數字背後的意義", "summary": "從欄位、時間、單位與缺失率開始，讓模型輸入保持一致。", "tags": ["EDA", "schema", "features", "missing", "data quality"], "html": "<h1 id=\"schema\">資料探索與schema：一欄數字背後的意義</h1>\n<p>從欄位、時間、單位與缺失率開始，讓模型輸入保持一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">資料表不等於已準備好</h2>\n<p>先列出每欄名稱、型態、單位、可用時間、缺失規則與預期範圍。ID通常識別樣本，不一定能當可泛化特徵；日期可能需要轉週期或相對時間；代碼即使長得像整數，也可能只是類別。這些判斷比先挑模型重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"eda\">EDA要回答具體問題</h2>\n<p>筆數與重複、label分布、數值分位數與異常範圍、category頻率、每欄缺失率、隨時間或群組的變化。先用train探索建模規則，對保留資料可做必要品質檢查，但不藉由其答案反覆設計特徵。要區分「驗證格式」與「從test學規則」。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nan</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">5.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">6.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isnan</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">axis</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nanmedian</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">axis</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nanpercentile</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">50</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">axis</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_2\">本課混合表格</h2>\n<p>完整專題包含tenure_months、weekly_usage、support_tickets三個數值欄與plan類別，target是合成事件。部分值設missing，另提供未見類別推論樣本。名稱只用來構造教學資料，不是現實客戶資料；模型成績沒有現實商業意義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">邊界驗證與語意驗證</h2>\n<p>範例records_to_array檢查keys、型態與finite，依固定欄位順序取值，允許null與新category。真實專案還需領域範圍，例如年資不能負、單位需一致、預測日不能早於觀察資料。只檢查shape[N,4]不足以發現欄位互換，必須保存schema。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>兩份檔案都有4欄，能直接互換嗎？解答：先比欄位名稱、順序、型態、單位與時間。若usage一份按週、一份按月，shape相同仍會改變模型意義。若缺失率從5%升80%，即使imputer能產生有限值，也應視為資料品質／分布警訊，不代表系統一切正常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/datasets.html\">資料載入與生成</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/preprocessing.html\">前處理</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 資料探索與schema：一欄數字背後的意義\n\n從欄位、時間、單位與缺失率開始，讓模型輸入保持一致。\n\n## 資料表不等於已準備好\n\n先列出每欄名稱、型態、單位、可用時間、缺失規則與預期範圍。ID通常識別樣本，不一定能當可泛化特徵；日期可能需要轉週期或相對時間；代碼即使長得像整數，也可能只是類別。這些判斷比先挑模型重要。\n\n## EDA要回答具體問題\n\n筆數與重複、label分布、數值分位數與異常範圍、category頻率、每欄缺失率、隨時間或群組的變化。先用train探索建模規則，對保留資料可做必要品質檢查，但不藉由其答案反覆設計特徵。要區分「驗證格式」與「從test學規則」。\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nx=np.array([[1.,2.],[3.,np.nan],[5.,6.]])\nprint(np.isnan(x).mean(axis=0))\nprint(np.nanmedian(x,axis=0))\nprint(np.nanpercentile(x,[0,50,100],axis=0))\n```\n\n## 本課混合表格\n\n完整專題包含tenure_months、weekly_usage、support_tickets三個數值欄與plan類別，target是合成事件。部分值設missing，另提供未見類別推論樣本。名稱只用來構造教學資料，不是現實客戶資料；模型成績沒有現實商業意義。\n\n## 邊界驗證與語意驗證\n\n範例records_to_array檢查keys、型態與finite，依固定欄位順序取值，允許null與新category。真實專案還需領域範圍，例如年資不能負、單位需一致、預測日不能早於觀察資料。只檢查shape[N,4]不足以發現欄位互換，必須保存schema。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n兩份檔案都有4欄，能直接互換嗎？解答：先比欄位名稱、順序、型態、單位與時間。若usage一份按週、一份按月，shape相同仍會改變模型意義。若缺失率從5%升80%，即使imputer能產生有限值，也應視為資料品質／分布警訊，不代表系統一切正常。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [資料載入與生成](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/datasets.html)\n- [前處理](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/preprocessing.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "schema", "name": "資料探索與schema：一欄數字背後的意義", "html": "資料探索與schema：一欄數字背後的意義", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "資料表不等於已準備好", "html": "資料表不等於已準備好", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "eda", "name": "EDA要回答具體問題", "html": "EDA要回答具體問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "本課混合表格", "html": "本課混合表格", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "邊界驗證與語意驗證", "html": "邊界驗證與語意驗證", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "07-splitting", "group": "data", "title": "資料切分：IID、分層、群組與時間", "summary": "讓訓練與評估模擬真實未見資料，而非僅做隨機分割。", "tags": ["split", "stratify", "GroupKFold", "TimeSeriesSplit"], "example": "02_split.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"iid\">資料切分：IID、分層、群組與時間</h1>\n<p>讓訓練與評估模擬真實未見資料，而非僅做隨機分割。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">三份資料的工作</h2>\n<p>train用來fit參數及前處理；validation用來選超參數、門檻或策略；test在方案固定後評估。CV可在train內提供多次驗證，不會讓最終test失去角色。完整專題400筆分240/80/80；這個比例是教學設定，實務還要看資料量、事件稀有程度與使用方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">隨機分層適合什麼</h2>\n<p>當樣本近似獨立同分布，train_test_split配stratify保留類別比例，可減少某個split完全沒有正例。它不會創造不存在的樣本，也不能保證極少數類足夠每折訓練。若每個人有多筆紀錄，單純stratify仍可能讓同一人跨集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">群組切分</h2>\n<p>同用戶、病人、文件或原圖衍生資料要考慮以group分開。GroupKFold確保指定group不跨訓練與該折驗證；若還要保留類別分布，可研究StratifiedGroupKFold及資料可行性。群組標籤是切分metadata，不應默默當成模型特徵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">時間切分</h2>\n<p>用過去預測未來，train應早於test，必要時留gap避免標籤窗重疊。TimeSeriesSplit使用索引順序，所以先按時間排序。一般KFold shuffle可能把未來資料帶回過去。只有按時間切分仍不足：特徵本身也要在當時可得，不能使用月底結算資訊預測月初。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">執行與驗收</h2>\n<p>範例同時列出分層比例、group overlap與時間邊界。驗收應有split索引聯集覆蓋全部樣本、交集為空、group不重疊、時間及gap正確。固定seed保存切分版本；資料新增後同seed不代表相同分割結果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>一人10筆，隨機切分後accuracy很高，部署新用戶卻差，可能是記住人而非學共通規律。解答：依部署情境改group holdout。預測同一批既有用戶的未來則可能需要時間切分，不能永遠只選group。切分方式是一種問題假設，不是所有專案都用同一模板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/02_split.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Stratified, grouped and time-respecting splits.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.model_selection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">GroupKFold</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">TimeSeriesSplit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">split_indices</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">parts</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">split_indices</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">repeat</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">group_folds</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">test</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">GroupKFold</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">split</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"mi\">36</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">group_folds</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">append</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;train_groups&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unique</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test_groups&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unique</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span>\n                                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;overlap&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">set</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">])</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"nb\">set</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">groups</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">test</span><span class=\"p\">]))})</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">time_folds</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;last_train&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">int</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;first_test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">int</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">])}</span>\n                    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">TimeSeriesSplit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">gap</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">split</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">))]</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;sizes&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:{</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">v</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">parts</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">()},</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;positive_rates&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:{</span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">float</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">())</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">v</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">parts</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">()},</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;group_folds&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">group_folds</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;time_folds&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">time_folds</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_8\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/cross_validation.html\">Cross-validation與切分策略</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 資料切分：IID、分層、群組與時間\n\n讓訓練與評估模擬真實未見資料，而非僅做隨機分割。\n\n## 三份資料的工作\n\ntrain用來fit參數及前處理；validation用來選超參數、門檻或策略；test在方案固定後評估。CV可在train內提供多次驗證，不會讓最終test失去角色。完整專題400筆分240/80/80；這個比例是教學設定，實務還要看資料量、事件稀有程度與使用方式。\n\n## 隨機分層適合什麼\n\n當樣本近似獨立同分布，train_test_split配stratify保留類別比例，可減少某個split完全沒有正例。它不會創造不存在的樣本，也不能保證極少數類足夠每折訓練。若每個人有多筆紀錄，單純stratify仍可能讓同一人跨集合。\n\n## 群組切分\n\n同用戶、病人、文件或原圖衍生資料要考慮以group分開。GroupKFold確保指定group不跨訓練與該折驗證；若還要保留類別分布，可研究StratifiedGroupKFold及資料可行性。群組標籤是切分metadata，不應默默當成模型特徵。\n\n## 時間切分\n\n用過去預測未來，train應早於test，必要時留gap避免標籤窗重疊。TimeSeriesSplit使用索引順序，所以先按時間排序。一般KFold shuffle可能把未來資料帶回過去。只有按時間切分仍不足：特徵本身也要在當時可得，不能使用月底結算資訊預測月初。\n\n## 執行與驗收\n\n範例同時列出分層比例、group overlap與時間邊界。驗收應有split索引聯集覆蓋全部樣本、交集為空、group不重疊、時間及gap正確。固定seed保存切分版本；資料新增後同seed不代表相同分割結果。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n一人10筆，隨機切分後accuracy很高，部署新用戶卻差，可能是記住人而非學共通規律。解答：依部署情境改group holdout。預測同一批既有用戶的未來則可能需要時間切分，不能永遠只選group。切分方式是一種問題假設，不是所有專案都用同一模板。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/02_split.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Stratified, grouped and time-respecting splits.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import GroupKFold, TimeSeriesSplit\nfrom course_core import binary_data, split_indices\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        parts=split_indices(y)\n        groups=np.repeat(np.arange(12),3)\n        group_folds=[]\n        for train,test in GroupKFold(3).split(np.zeros((36,1)),groups=groups):\n            group_folds.append({'train_groups':np.unique(groups[train]),'test_groups':np.unique(groups[test]),\n                                'overlap':len(set(groups[train])&set(groups[test]))})\n        time_folds=[{'last_train':int(a[-1]),'first_test':int(b[0])}\n                    for a,b in TimeSeriesSplit(3,gap=1).split(np.arange(20))]\n        result={'sizes':{k:len(v) for k,v in parts.items()},\n                'positive_rates':{k:float(y[v].mean()) for k,v in parts.items()},\n                'group_folds':group_folds,'time_folds':time_folds}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Cross-validation與切分策略](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/cross_validation.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "iid", "name": "資料切分：IID、分層、群組與時間", "html": "資料切分：IID、分層、群組與時間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "三份資料的工作", "html": "三份資料的工作", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "隨機分層適合什麼", "html": "隨機分層適合什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "群組切分", "html": "群組切分", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "時間切分", "html": "時間切分", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "執行與驗收", "html": "執行與驗收", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "08-leakage", "group": "data", "title": "資料洩漏與Pipeline：把fit放在正確的地方", "summary": "從標準化到特徵選擇，所有學習資料統計的步驟都需要切分邊界。", "tags": ["leakage", "Pipeline", "fit_transform", "ColumnTransformer"], "html": "<h1 id=\"pipelinefit\">資料洩漏與Pipeline：把fit放在正確的地方</h1>\n<p>從標準化到特徵選擇，所有學習資料統計的步驟都需要切分邊界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"x\">洩漏不限於把答案放進X</h2>\n<p>先對全資料標準化、先選與全部y最相關的特徵、先訓練詞表／降維再CV，都可能讓驗證資訊回流。無監督轉換也會學統計，因此不是「沒有使用label就一定沒洩漏」。重複樣本跨split與未來欄位則是另一種邊界錯誤，Pipeline不能自動修復所有來源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fittransform\">fit與transform的分工</h2>\n<p>fit從train學median、mean、vocabulary或模型weights；transform對新資料套用已學規則。訓練常用fit_transform；val/test只transform。不能對每份資料各自fit，否則每一份有不同座標系，推論輸入也不再與模型訓練一致。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.impute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">SimpleImputer</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SimpleImputer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">strategy</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;median&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n                    <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l1_ratio</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># model.fit(X_train,y_train)</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># prediction=model.predict(X_test)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"cv\">在CV內重學前處理</h2>\n<p>將整個Pipeline交給cross_validate或GridSearchCV，每折都clone並只用該折train fit。反過來先transform全X，再只CV classifier，已越過邊界。模型參數可用<code>step__parameter</code>搜尋，例如model__C；步驟名稱是你建立pipeline時的鍵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">混合欄位的組合</h2>\n<p>ColumnTransformer對數值與類別走不同子Pipeline，再合併送model。完整產物應保存整條pipeline，推論接收raw欄位，避免另寫一套似是而非的前處理。metadata如groups與sample_weight則需按API傳遞，不能因為包pipeline就假設它們自動到正確步驟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>CV前做SelectKBest(X,y)為何錯？答案：特徵選擇看過驗證y，應放Pipeline內每折重新fit。只看train scaler.mean_還不夠，需對每折比該折train均值；測試套件會做此比對。遇到優於預期的近乎滿分，也應主動查洩漏，而不是只慶祝分數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html\">常見洩漏</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html\">Pipeline</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 資料洩漏與Pipeline：把fit放在正確的地方\n\n從標準化到特徵選擇，所有學習資料統計的步驟都需要切分邊界。\n\n## 洩漏不限於把答案放進X\n\n先對全資料標準化、先選與全部y最相關的特徵、先訓練詞表／降維再CV，都可能讓驗證資訊回流。無監督轉換也會學統計，因此不是「沒有使用label就一定沒洩漏」。重複樣本跨split與未來欄位則是另一種邊界錯誤，Pipeline不能自動修復所有來源。\n\n## fit與transform的分工\n\nfit從train學median、mean、vocabulary或模型weights；transform對新資料套用已學規則。訓練常用fit_transform；val/test只transform。不能對每份資料各自fit，否則每一份有不同座標系，推論輸入也不再與模型訓練一致。\n\n```python\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nmodel=make_pipeline(SimpleImputer(strategy='median'),StandardScaler(),\n                    LogisticRegression(l1_ratio=0,max_iter=1000))\n# model.fit(X_train,y_train)\n# prediction=model.predict(X_test)\n```\n\n## 在CV內重學前處理\n\n將整個Pipeline交給cross_validate或GridSearchCV，每折都clone並只用該折train fit。反過來先transform全X，再只CV classifier，已越過邊界。模型參數可用`step__parameter`搜尋，例如model__C；步驟名稱是你建立pipeline時的鍵。\n\n## 混合欄位的組合\n\nColumnTransformer對數值與類別走不同子Pipeline，再合併送model。完整產物應保存整條pipeline，推論接收raw欄位，避免另寫一套似是而非的前處理。metadata如groups與sample_weight則需按API傳遞，不能因為包pipeline就假設它們自動到正確步驟。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nCV前做SelectKBest(X,y)為何錯？答案：特徵選擇看過驗證y，應放Pipeline內每折重新fit。只看train scaler.mean_還不夠，需對每折比該折train均值；測試套件會做此比對。遇到優於預期的近乎滿分，也應主動查洩漏，而不是只慶祝分數。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [常見洩漏](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html)\n- [Pipeline](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "pipelinefit", "name": "資料洩漏與Pipeline：把fit放在正確的地方", "html": "資料洩漏與Pipeline：把fit放在正確的地方", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "x", "name": "洩漏不限於把答案放進X", "html": "洩漏不限於把答案放進X", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "fittransform", "name": "fit與transform的分工", "html": "fit與transform的分工", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "cv", "name": "在CV內重學前處理", "html": "在CV內重學前處理", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "混合欄位的組合", "html": "混合欄位的組合", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "09-missing", "group": "data", "title": "缺失值：刪除、補值與缺失指標", "summary": "理解missing的來源，讓訓練與推論使用相同的處理規則。", "tags": ["imputation", "missing", "SimpleImputer", "indicator"], "example": "03_preprocessing.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">缺失值：刪除、補值與缺失指標</h1>\n<p>理解missing的來源，讓訓練與推論使用相同的處理規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">空白有不同原因</h2>\n<p>未填寫、感測器失效、不適用、資料串接失敗都可能表現為missing。直接填0會把「不知道」變成真實零，若0有業務意義，模型會混淆。先看缺失與時間、群組或label是否相關；但觀察相關不代表能證明缺失機制或因果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">幾種起點</h2>\n<p>少量且合理可刪列，但會減少資料與改變分布；median常是數值穩健起點；類別可補most_frequent或明確MISSING；add_indicator保留「原先缺失」訊號。較複雜補值仍需在CV內fit，不因方法高級就免除驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fittrain\">fit只看train</h2>\n<p>本章train第一欄[1,3,5]的median為3，第二欄[2,missing,6]為4。validation出現100，也不能讓補值統計變100。範例先fit imputer與scaler，再transform，核對statistics未改。這是可以手算的洩漏檢查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">全空欄與部署時新缺失</h2>\n<p>部分imputer設定可能丟全空欄；keep_empty_features讓尺寸政策明確。add_indicator通常只為fit時已觀察缺失的欄位建立指標；部署時原本完整欄位突然大量缺失，仍需監控，不應假設多一個indicator就涵蓋全部風險。特徵名稱與輸出維度要一起檢查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"missing\">原生支援missing的模型</h2>\n<p>HistGradientBoosting等方法可以直接處理某些missing輸入，但這不等於所有sklearn模型都能，也不代表資料失效可忽略。先確認API的支援與型態，再比較包含補值的baseline。推論仍要拒絕Inf等不合法數字，NaN政策與無窮大不是同一件事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若把分類代碼缺失補平均1.7，通常沒有類別意義；解答：先確認它是名目類別，再用類別補值／編碼。另一題：所有test缺失都用test median是否更準？這使你用測試分布學規則，偏離固定推論流程，應沿用train統計並報告分布改變。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/03_preprocessing.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Fit imputation and scaling only on training rows.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.impute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">SimpleImputer</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nan</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">5.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">6.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">validation</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">100.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nan</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">preprocess</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">SimpleImputer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">strategy</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;median&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">keep_empty_features</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">transformed</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">preprocess</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit_transform</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">preprocess</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">statistics_</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">copy</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">heldout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">preprocess</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">transform</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">validation</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;imputation_statistics&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;training_means&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">preprocess</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;transformed_train_mean&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">transformed</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;transformed_validation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">heldout</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;statistics_unchanged&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">bool</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array_equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">preprocess</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">statistics_</span><span class=\"p\">))}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/impute.html\">Missing value imputation</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 缺失值：刪除、補值與缺失指標\n\n理解missing的來源，讓訓練與推論使用相同的處理規則。\n\n## 空白有不同原因\n\n未填寫、感測器失效、不適用、資料串接失敗都可能表現為missing。直接填0會把「不知道」變成真實零，若0有業務意義，模型會混淆。先看缺失與時間、群組或label是否相關；但觀察相關不代表能證明缺失機制或因果。\n\n## 幾種起點\n\n少量且合理可刪列，但會減少資料與改變分布；median常是數值穩健起點；類別可補most_frequent或明確MISSING；add_indicator保留「原先缺失」訊號。較複雜補值仍需在CV內fit，不因方法高級就免除驗證。\n\n## fit只看train\n\n本章train第一欄[1,3,5]的median為3，第二欄[2,missing,6]為4。validation出現100，也不能讓補值統計變100。範例先fit imputer與scaler，再transform，核對statistics未改。這是可以手算的洩漏檢查。\n\n## 全空欄與部署時新缺失\n\n部分imputer設定可能丟全空欄；keep_empty_features讓尺寸政策明確。add_indicator通常只為fit時已觀察缺失的欄位建立指標；部署時原本完整欄位突然大量缺失，仍需監控，不應假設多一個indicator就涵蓋全部風險。特徵名稱與輸出維度要一起檢查。\n\n## 原生支援missing的模型\n\nHistGradientBoosting等方法可以直接處理某些missing輸入，但這不等於所有sklearn模型都能，也不代表資料失效可忽略。先確認API的支援與型態，再比較包含補值的baseline。推論仍要拒絕Inf等不合法數字，NaN政策與無窮大不是同一件事。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若把分類代碼缺失補平均1.7，通常沒有類別意義；解答：先確認它是名目類別，再用類別補值／編碼。另一題：所有test缺失都用test median是否更準？這使你用測試分布學規則，偏離固定推論流程，應沿用train統計並報告分布改變。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/03_preprocessing.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Fit imputation and scaling only on training rows.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        train=np.array([[1.,2.],[3.,np.nan],[5.,6.]])\n        validation=np.array([[100.,np.nan]])\n        preprocess=make_pipeline(SimpleImputer(strategy='median',keep_empty_features=True),StandardScaler())\n        transformed=preprocess.fit_transform(train)\n        before=preprocess[0].statistics_.copy()\n        heldout=preprocess.transform(validation)\n        result={'imputation_statistics':before,'training_means':preprocess[1].mean_,\n                'transformed_train_mean':transformed.mean(0),'transformed_validation':heldout,\n                'statistics_unchanged':bool(np.array_equal(before,preprocess[0].statistics_))}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Missing value imputation](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/impute.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "缺失值：刪除、補值與缺失指標", "html": "缺失值：刪除、補值與缺失指標", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "空白有不同原因", "html": "空白有不同原因", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "幾種起點", "html": "幾種起點", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "fittrain", "name": "fit只看train", "html": "fit只看train", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "全空欄與部署時新缺失", "html": "全空欄與部署時新缺失", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "missing", "name": "原生支援missing的模型", "html": "原生支援missing的模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "10-scaling", "group": "data", "title": "尺度與分布轉換：StandardScaler、RobustScaler與單位", "summary": "知道哪些模型依賴距離與係數懲罰，哪些轉換會改變資料意義。", "tags": ["StandardScaler", "RobustScaler", "normalization", "units"], "html": "<h1 id=\"standardscalerrobustscaler\">尺度與分布轉換：StandardScaler、RobustScaler與單位</h1>\n<p>知道哪些模型依賴距離與係數懲罰，哪些轉換會改變資料意義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">一個單位改變排名的例子</h2>\n<p>某特徵以公尺記錄，另一份改毫米，數值差1000倍。kNN的L2距離會被它主導；SVM與正則化線性模型也會受尺度影響。樹以閾值分裂，對單欄單調尺度轉換通常較不敏感，但缺失、數值精度與其他前處理仍有差異。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nz_{i,j}=\\frac{x_{i,j}-\\mu_j}{\\sigma_j},\\qquad\n\\mu_j=\\frac1{N_{train}}\\sum_{i\\in train}x_{i,j}\n$$</div>\n<p>StandardScaler以train平均與變異數轉換。常態化到均值0與尺度1，不代表資料變成常態分布，也不會消除離群點。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">選擇轉換方式</h2>\n<p>MinMaxScaler依train範圍縮放，新資料可超出0..1；RobustScaler用median／分位距，較不被極端值主導；log變換適合某些偏態正數但需處理零與負值；每列L2 normalize改的是向量長度，與每欄StandardScaler不同。先問你要保留大小還是方向。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">RobustScaler</span>\n<span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">100.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit_transform</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ravel</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">RobustScaler</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit_transform</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ravel</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_3\">稀疏資料與可解釋係數</h2>\n<p>對大稀疏矩陣中心化可能變成dense，記憶體暴增；需考慮with_mean=False或其他策略。標準化後係數是以轉換單位衡量，不能直接說「原特徵增加1會改變多少」。要回到原單位需結合scale與intercept，並注意相關特徵與因果限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>train=[1,3,5]均值3，population標準差sqrt(8/3)，新值7的z約2.449。解答：只用train統計，即使val均值很不一樣也不重新fit。若每列normalize讓總消費大小消失，對依金額決策可能傷害訊號；縮放不是越多越好，應在完整Pipeline與CV比較。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/preprocessing.html\">Preprocessing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html\">Pipeline與轉換</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 尺度與分布轉換：StandardScaler、RobustScaler與單位\n\n知道哪些模型依賴距離與係數懲罰，哪些轉換會改變資料意義。\n\n## 一個單位改變排名的例子\n\n某特徵以公尺記錄，另一份改毫米，數值差1000倍。kNN的L2距離會被它主導；SVM與正則化線性模型也會受尺度影響。樹以閾值分裂，對單欄單調尺度轉換通常較不敏感，但缺失、數值精度與其他前處理仍有差異。\n\n$$\nz_{i,j}=\\frac{x_{i,j}-\\mu_j}{\\sigma_j},\\qquad\n\\mu_j=\\frac1{N_{train}}\\sum_{i\\in train}x_{i,j}\n$$\n\nStandardScaler以train平均與變異數轉換。常態化到均值0與尺度1，不代表資料變成常態分布，也不會消除離群點。\n\n## 選擇轉換方式\n\nMinMaxScaler依train範圍縮放，新資料可超出0..1；RobustScaler用median／分位距，較不被極端值主導；log變換適合某些偏態正數但需處理零與負值；每列L2 normalize改的是向量長度，與每欄StandardScaler不同。先問你要保留大小還是方向。\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler,RobustScaler\ntrain=np.array([[1.],[2.],[3.],[100.]])\nprint(StandardScaler().fit_transform(train).ravel())\nprint(RobustScaler().fit_transform(train).ravel())\n```\n\n## 稀疏資料與可解釋係數\n\n對大稀疏矩陣中心化可能變成dense，記憶體暴增；需考慮with_mean=False或其他策略。標準化後係數是以轉換單位衡量，不能直接說「原特徵增加1會改變多少」。要回到原單位需結合scale與intercept，並注意相關特徵與因果限制。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\ntrain=[1,3,5]均值3，population標準差sqrt(8/3)，新值7的z約2.449。解答：只用train統計，即使val均值很不一樣也不重新fit。若每列normalize讓總消費大小消失，對依金額決策可能傷害訊號；縮放不是越多越好，應在完整Pipeline與CV比較。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Preprocessing](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/preprocessing.html)\n- [Pipeline與轉換](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "standardscalerrobustscaler", "name": "尺度與分布轉換：StandardScaler、RobustScaler與單位", "html": "尺度與分布轉換：StandardScaler、RobustScaler與單位", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "一個單位改變排名的例子", "html": "一個單位改變排名的例子", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "選擇轉換方式", "html": "選擇轉換方式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "稀疏資料與可解釋係數", "html": "稀疏資料與可解釋係數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "11-categories", "group": "data", "title": "類別編碼：One-Hot、未知值與高基數", "summary": "區分類別代碼與數值大小，處理訓練沒見過的新類別。", "tags": ["OneHotEncoder", "unknown", "cardinality", "encoding"], "example": "04_categories.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"one-hot\">類別編碼：One-Hot、未知值與高基數</h1>\n<p>區分類別代碼與數值大小，處理訓練沒見過的新類別。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">名稱沒有天然距離</h2>\n<p>basic、plus、team是名目類別，若編成0、1、2再讓線性或距離模型使用，等於引入大小與等距假設。One-Hot每類一個欄位，將這個假設拿掉。真正有序的等級可以考慮OrdinalEncoder，但需明確定義順序與未知值政策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fittransform\">fit詞表，再transform新資料</h2>\n<p>只在train fit encoder。範例看過basic與team，輸出兩欄；new_plan透過handle_unknown='ignore'得到全0，不擴張欄位，也不假裝與新模型相同。這個政策讓流程可執行，但模型對未知類別沒有學到專屬效果，需要監控出現率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sparse\">sparse與欄位數</h2>\n<p>OneHotEncoder使用sparse_output參數；本課小例設False便於觀察。高基數ID可能產生巨大特徵空間，先判斷是否應排除、合併稀有類別、用hash或其他表示。min_frequency／max_categories可限制類別細分，仍需在train fit並檢查輸出名稱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">參照類別與線性模型</h2>\n<p>全部one-hot加intercept會有線性依賴；特定無正則回歸推論可能選擇drop一欄。正則化模型及預測任務也要看完整設計，不把drop='first'當所有問題的固定答案。若unknown與被drop的參照類別都映成全0，解讀時需格外清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"target-encoding\">Target encoding的邊界</h2>\n<p>以類別的平均target當特徵時，最容易直接洩漏答案。應使用訓練內cross-fitting與平滑，外層CV也要保持邊界。即使某套件有TargetEncoder，也要讀fit_transform與transform的差異，不自行對全部y求均值後做CV。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>train看到A、B，test新增C，應否在test重新fit三欄？解答：否，維度與含義會不同；沿用encoder並執行預先定義unknown政策。若一欄幾乎每筆唯一，one-hot高train分數可能只是記憶ID，先查它在部署的新樣本是否有可泛化意義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/04_categories.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Unknown categories use the already fitted vocabulary.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">OneHotEncoder</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">encoder</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">OneHotEncoder</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">handle_unknown</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;ignore&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">sparse_output</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">encoder</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;basic&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;team&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;basic&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]]))</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;categories&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">encoder</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">categories_</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;feature_names&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">encoder</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_feature_names_out</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;known_and_unknown&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">encoder</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">transform</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;team&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;new_plan&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]]),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;unknown is all zeros, not a newly fitted feature&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/preprocessing.html#encoding-categorical-features\">Categorical preprocessing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html\">ColumnTransformer</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 類別編碼：One-Hot、未知值與高基數\n\n區分類別代碼與數值大小，處理訓練沒見過的新類別。\n\n## 名稱沒有天然距離\n\nbasic、plus、team是名目類別，若編成0、1、2再讓線性或距離模型使用，等於引入大小與等距假設。One-Hot每類一個欄位，將這個假設拿掉。真正有序的等級可以考慮OrdinalEncoder，但需明確定義順序與未知值政策。\n\n## fit詞表，再transform新資料\n\n只在train fit encoder。範例看過basic與team，輸出兩欄；new_plan透過handle_unknown='ignore'得到全0，不擴張欄位，也不假裝與新模型相同。這個政策讓流程可執行，但模型對未知類別沒有學到專屬效果，需要監控出現率。\n\n## sparse與欄位數\n\nOneHotEncoder使用sparse_output參數；本課小例設False便於觀察。高基數ID可能產生巨大特徵空間，先判斷是否應排除、合併稀有類別、用hash或其他表示。min_frequency／max_categories可限制類別細分，仍需在train fit並檢查輸出名稱。\n\n## 參照類別與線性模型\n\n全部one-hot加intercept會有線性依賴；特定無正則回歸推論可能選擇drop一欄。正則化模型及預測任務也要看完整設計，不把drop='first'當所有問題的固定答案。若unknown與被drop的參照類別都映成全0，解讀時需格外清楚。\n\n## Target encoding的邊界\n\n以類別的平均target當特徵時，最容易直接洩漏答案。應使用訓練內cross-fitting與平滑，外層CV也要保持邊界。即使某套件有TargetEncoder，也要讀fit_transform與transform的差異，不自行對全部y求均值後做CV。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\ntrain看到A、B，test新增C，應否在test重新fit三欄？解答：否，維度與含義會不同；沿用encoder並執行預先定義unknown政策。若一欄幾乎每筆唯一，one-hot高train分數可能只是記憶ID，先查它在部署的新樣本是否有可泛化意義。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/04_categories.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Unknown categories use the already fitted vocabulary.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import OneHotEncoder\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        encoder=OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown='ignore',sparse_output=False)\n        encoder.fit(np.array([['basic'],['team'],['basic']]))\n        result={'categories':encoder.categories_[0],\n                'feature_names':encoder.get_feature_names_out(),\n                'known_and_unknown':encoder.transform([['team'],['new_plan']]),\n                'note':'unknown is all zeros, not a newly fitted feature'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Categorical preprocessing](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/preprocessing.html#encoding-categorical-features)\n- [ColumnTransformer](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "one-hot", "name": "類別編碼：One-Hot、未知值與高基數", "html": "類別編碼：One-Hot、未知值與高基數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "名稱沒有天然距離", "html": "名稱沒有天然距離", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "fittransform", "name": "fit詞表，再transform新資料", "html": "fit詞表，再transform新資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "sparse", "name": "sparse與欄位數", "html": "sparse與欄位數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "參照類別與線性模型", "html": "參照類別與線性模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "target-encoding", "name": "Target encoding的邊界", "html": "Target encoding的邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "12-features", "group": "data", "title": "特徵工程與選擇：讓訊號可用，讓洩漏可見", "summary": "結合領域定義、交互作用與選擇方法，避免只靠自動搜尋。", "tags": ["feature engineering", "feature selection", "interaction", "leakage"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">特徵工程與選擇：讓訊號可用，讓洩漏可見</h1>\n<p>結合領域定義、交互作用與選擇方法，避免只靠自動搜尋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">特徵是對問題的假設</h2>\n<p>原始日期可轉星期、月份或距離事件天數；金額可轉比例、成長或log；累計次數要有明確觀察窗。每種轉換都假設某種關係對預測有用。只要使用預測時不可知的未來總量，就算公式簡單也會洩漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">非線性與交互作用</h2>\n<p>線性模型加入x²或x1×x2後，對原始輸入可表達非線性，但對展開後係數仍線性。PolynomialFeatures會增加維度與相關性，需要縮放、正則化與CV。樹能學一些分段交互，但不代表不需領域特徵或資料品質。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">PolynomialFeatures</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Ridge</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">PolynomialFeatures</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">include_bias</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">Ridge</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">alpha</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># model.fit(X_train,y_train)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">三種選擇方法</h2>\n<p>filter依統計關係選欄，例如SelectKBest；embedded依模型內部稀疏或重要性選；wrapper反覆訓練比較子集，例如RFE。全部都需放在訓練／CV邊界內，尤其使用y的方法。選擇結果依資料與模型，不是找到宇宙唯一的「真正重要」變數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">相關特徵與穩定性</h2>\n<p>高度相關欄位可分攤訊號，某次Lasso留A、另一次留B不一定互相矛盾。Permutation importance也可能因替代特徵存在而低估單欄作用。應記錄跨fold／seed的選擇穩定性、效能與成本，而非只貼一張重要性排名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>用全部y挑前10個特徵再CV為何不行？答案：每折驗證答案已參與選擇，應將selector放Pipeline。增加100個隨機欄位後train分數升高，能否說訊號更好？不能；比較獨立驗證與複雜度，隨機欄也可能讓模型記住雜訊。最終產物保留原欄位及轉換規則，才可一致推論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/feature_selection.html\">Feature selection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/preprocessing.html#polynomial-features\">Polynomial features</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html\">洩漏</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 特徵工程與選擇：讓訊號可用，讓洩漏可見\n\n結合領域定義、交互作用與選擇方法，避免只靠自動搜尋。\n\n## 特徵是對問題的假設\n\n原始日期可轉星期、月份或距離事件天數；金額可轉比例、成長或log；累計次數要有明確觀察窗。每種轉換都假設某種關係對預測有用。只要使用預測時不可知的未來總量，就算公式簡單也會洩漏。\n\n## 非線性與交互作用\n\n線性模型加入x²或x1×x2後，對原始輸入可表達非線性，但對展開後係數仍線性。PolynomialFeatures會增加維度與相關性，需要縮放、正則化與CV。樹能學一些分段交互，但不代表不需領域特徵或資料品質。\n\n```python\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import PolynomialFeatures,StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge\nmodel=make_pipeline(PolynomialFeatures(2,include_bias=False),StandardScaler(),Ridge(alpha=1.))\n# model.fit(X_train,y_train)\n```\n\n## 三種選擇方法\n\nfilter依統計關係選欄，例如SelectKBest；embedded依模型內部稀疏或重要性選；wrapper反覆訓練比較子集，例如RFE。全部都需放在訓練／CV邊界內，尤其使用y的方法。選擇結果依資料與模型，不是找到宇宙唯一的「真正重要」變數。\n\n## 相關特徵與穩定性\n\n高度相關欄位可分攤訊號，某次Lasso留A、另一次留B不一定互相矛盾。Permutation importance也可能因替代特徵存在而低估單欄作用。應記錄跨fold／seed的選擇穩定性、效能與成本，而非只貼一張重要性排名。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n用全部y挑前10個特徵再CV為何不行？答案：每折驗證答案已參與選擇，應將selector放Pipeline。增加100個隨機欄位後train分數升高，能否說訊號更好？不能；比較獨立驗證與複雜度，隨機欄也可能讓模型記住雜訊。最終產物保留原欄位及轉換規則，才可一致推論。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Feature selection](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/feature_selection.html)\n- [Polynomial features](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/preprocessing.html#polynomial-features)\n- [洩漏](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "特徵工程與選擇：讓訊號可用，讓洩漏可見", "html": "特徵工程與選擇：讓訊號可用，讓洩漏可見", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "特徵是對問題的假設", "html": "特徵是對問題的假設", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "非線性與交互作用", "html": "非線性與交互作用", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "三種選擇方法", "html": "三種選擇方法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "相關特徵與穩定性", "html": "相關特徵與穩定性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "13-linear-regression", "group": "linear", "title": "線性回歸：從最小平方法到係數與殘差", "summary": "手算一條直線，理解最小化平方誤差的解與其限制。", "tags": ["LinearRegression", "OLS", "least squares", "residual"], "example": "05_linear_regression.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">線性回歸：從最小平方法到係數與殘差</h1>\n<p>手算一條直線，理解最小化平方誤差的解與其限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">模型對特徵線性</h2>\n<p>單特徵為ŷ=wx+b，多特徵為內積加intercept。線性不是只能畫直線：加入x²等特徵後可表達曲線，但對係數仍是線性組合。模型假設的是這組特徵如何組成預測，不是直接證明真實世界有線性因果。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\min_{w,b}\\sum_i(y_i-x_i^Tw-b)^2\n$$</div>\n<p>平方誤差會重罰大殘差。scikit-learn的LinearRegression使用數值線性代數求解，不需要你設定learning rate。不要把每個fit都解釋為跑固定次數梯度下降。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">單變數解的直覺</h2>\n<p>對中心化後資料，斜率等於x與y共變動程度除x變異，intercept把平均位置補回來。x完全不變時斜率無法由此辨認；高度共線多特徵也讓係數對雜訊敏感。數值求解能產生預測，不表示每個係數都有穩定科學解釋。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nw=\\frac{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)(y_i-\\bar y)}{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)^2},\\qquad b=\\bar y-w\\bar x\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">已知答案的實驗</h2>\n<p>範例生成y=3x+.5，學得coef接近3、intercept接近.5，對新x=6預測18.5。這是可學性sanity check，沒有將train誤差冒充測試。真實回歸需要split、baseline與殘差檢查，後續專題會補齊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">殘差看什麼</h2>\n<p>殘差隨x呈曲線，可能特徵不足；誤差隨預測值放大，可能異質變異；某群組持續偏高，可能分布或缺少特徵。高R²也不能排除這些問題。統計顯著性、信賴區間與因果識別需要額外假設，本課的predict不是完整統計推論報告。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>x=[0,1,2]、y=[1,3,5]，斜率2、偏移1。將兩個完全相同的x欄一起放入，預測可能一樣但係數如何分攤不唯一。解答：先辨認共線與需求，再考慮Ridge等穩定化；不能因coef印出一個值就說每欄獨立影響已被辨認。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/05_linear_regression.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Recover a known linear rule; not a generalization benchmark.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LinearRegression</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">regression_metrics</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">5.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">6.</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">reshape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[:,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">LinearRegression</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;coefficient&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">coef_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;intercept&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intercept_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;training_sanity_check&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">regression_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;new_x_prediction&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">6.</span><span class=\"p\">]])}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_8\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#ordinary-least-squares\">Ordinary Least Squares</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 線性回歸：從最小平方法到係數與殘差\n\n手算一條直線，理解最小化平方誤差的解與其限制。\n\n## 模型對特徵線性\n\n單特徵為ŷ=wx+b，多特徵為內積加intercept。線性不是只能畫直線：加入x²等特徵後可表達曲線，但對係數仍是線性組合。模型假設的是這組特徵如何組成預測，不是直接證明真實世界有線性因果。\n\n$$\n\\min_{w,b}\\sum_i(y_i-x_i^Tw-b)^2\n$$\n\n平方誤差會重罰大殘差。scikit-learn的LinearRegression使用數值線性代數求解，不需要你設定learning rate。不要把每個fit都解釋為跑固定次數梯度下降。\n\n## 單變數解的直覺\n\n對中心化後資料，斜率等於x與y共變動程度除x變異，intercept把平均位置補回來。x完全不變時斜率無法由此辨認；高度共線多特徵也讓係數對雜訊敏感。數值求解能產生預測，不表示每個係數都有穩定科學解釋。\n\n$$\nw=\\frac{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)(y_i-\\bar y)}{\\sum_i(x_i-\\bar x)^2},\\qquad b=\\bar y-w\\bar x\n$$\n\n## 已知答案的實驗\n\n範例生成y=3x+.5，學得coef接近3、intercept接近.5，對新x=6預測18.5。這是可學性sanity check，沒有將train誤差冒充測試。真實回歸需要split、baseline與殘差檢查，後續專題會補齊。\n\n## 殘差看什麼\n\n殘差隨x呈曲線，可能特徵不足；誤差隨預測值放大，可能異質變異；某群組持續偏高，可能分布或缺少特徵。高R²也不能排除這些問題。統計顯著性、信賴區間與因果識別需要額外假設，本課的predict不是完整統計推論報告。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nx=[0,1,2]、y=[1,3,5]，斜率2、偏移1。將兩個完全相同的x欄一起放入，預測可能一樣但係數如何分攤不唯一。解答：先辨認共線與需求，再考慮Ridge等穩定化；不能因coef印出一個值就說每欄獨立影響已被辨認。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/05_linear_regression.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Recover a known linear rule; not a generalization benchmark.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression\nfrom course_core import regression_metrics\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x=np.arange(-5.,6.).reshape(-1,1)\n        y=3*x[:,0]+.5\n        model=LinearRegression().fit(x,y)\n        result={'coefficient':model.coef_,'intercept':model.intercept_,\n                'training_sanity_check':regression_metrics(y,model.predict(x)),\n                'new_x_prediction':model.predict([[6.]])}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Ordinary Least Squares](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#ordinary-least-squares)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "線性回歸：從最小平方法到係數與殘差", "html": "線性回歸：從最小平方法到係數與殘差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "模型對特徵線性", "html": "模型對特徵線性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "單變數解的直覺", "html": "單變數解的直覺", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "已知答案的實驗", "html": "已知答案的實驗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "殘差看什麼", "html": "殘差看什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "14-regularization", "group": "linear", "title": "Ridge、Lasso與Elastic Net：用限制換取穩定性", "summary": "比較L2收縮、L1稀疏與混合懲罰，理解尺度與超參數方向。", "tags": ["Ridge", "Lasso", "ElasticNet", "alpha", "L1", "L2"], "example": "06_regularization.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"ridgelassoelastic-net\">Ridge、Lasso與Elastic Net：用限制換取穩定性</h1>\n<p>比較L2收縮、L1稀疏與混合懲罰，理解尺度與超參數方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">為什麼懲罰係數</h2>\n<p>特徵多、樣本少或欄位高度相關時，普通最小平方可能對小擾動很敏感。Ridge將係數往零收縮；Lasso可產生精確零；Elastic Net混合兩者。它們改變最佳化目標，可能增加train誤差卻減少未見資料誤差，是否有益由合理驗證判斷。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL_{Ridge}=\\lVert y-Xw\\rVert_2^2+\\alpha\\lVert w\\rVert_2^2\n$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL_{Lasso}=\\frac{1}{2N}\\lVert y-Xw\\rVert_2^2+\\alpha\\lVert w\\rVert_1\n$$</div>\n<p>不同API的loss縮放未必相同，不能把相同alpha直接解讀為相同懲罰強度。兩者一般alpha越大限制越強；Logistic的C則是反方向，下一章再分清。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">縮放與係數解讀</h2>\n<p>一欄用公尺、一欄用毫米，同樣coef大小代表不同效果。正則化前通常在Pipeline做StandardScaler，使懲罰的比較更合理。標準化後coef單位是每個train尺度，不是原始一單位。稀疏文字資料另需避免中心化成dense。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">稀疏不是因果選擇</h2>\n<p>Lasso在相關欄位中可能挑其中一個；換split可能改選另一個。零係數表示此模型與此懲罰下未保留，不證明真實關係不存在。Elastic Net以l1_ratio控制L1/L2比例，可能在相關群中較穩定，仍需比較效能與選擇穩定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">實作比較的界線</h2>\n<p>範例對同一固定split展示Ridge及Lasso的係數與holdout指標。這是機制比較，不應反覆看holdout調alpha；正式選擇放train CV，最後再評估。若CV前先fit scaler或selector，全流程仍可能洩漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>調高Ridge alpha，係數norm通常下降；train error可能上升，val不必單調。若過大，預測可能接近只猜常數。解答：在對數尺度搜尋多個alpha，與dummy和未正則baseline比較，不以某次最大alpha分數較高就宣稱越大越好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/06_regularization.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Compare ridge and lasso on the same fixed split.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Ridge</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">Lasso</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">regression_metrics</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">regression_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">reports</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">estimator</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;ridge&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">Ridge</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">alpha</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">10.</span><span class=\"p\">)),(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;lasso&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">Lasso</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">alpha</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">5000</span><span class=\"p\">))]:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">estimator</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">reports</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;coefficients_in_scaled_units&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">coef_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                           <span class=\"s1\">&#39;holdout&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">regression_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">))}</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;fixed_settings_demonstration&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">reports</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;selection&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;do not choose hyperparameters on these holdout scores&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#ridge-regression-and-classification\">Ridge與Lasso</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#elastic-net\">ElasticNet</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Ridge、Lasso與Elastic Net：用限制換取穩定性\n\n比較L2收縮、L1稀疏與混合懲罰，理解尺度與超參數方向。\n\n## 為什麼懲罰係數\n\n特徵多、樣本少或欄位高度相關時，普通最小平方可能對小擾動很敏感。Ridge將係數往零收縮；Lasso可產生精確零；Elastic Net混合兩者。它們改變最佳化目標，可能增加train誤差卻減少未見資料誤差，是否有益由合理驗證判斷。\n\n$$\nL_{Ridge}=\\lVert y-Xw\\rVert_2^2+\\alpha\\lVert w\\rVert_2^2\n$$\n\n$$\nL_{Lasso}=\\frac{1}{2N}\\lVert y-Xw\\rVert_2^2+\\alpha\\lVert w\\rVert_1\n$$\n\n不同API的loss縮放未必相同，不能把相同alpha直接解讀為相同懲罰強度。兩者一般alpha越大限制越強；Logistic的C則是反方向，下一章再分清。\n\n## 縮放與係數解讀\n\n一欄用公尺、一欄用毫米，同樣coef大小代表不同效果。正則化前通常在Pipeline做StandardScaler，使懲罰的比較更合理。標準化後coef單位是每個train尺度，不是原始一單位。稀疏文字資料另需避免中心化成dense。\n\n## 稀疏不是因果選擇\n\nLasso在相關欄位中可能挑其中一個；換split可能改選另一個。零係數表示此模型與此懲罰下未保留，不證明真實關係不存在。Elastic Net以l1_ratio控制L1/L2比例，可能在相關群中較穩定，仍需比較效能與選擇穩定性。\n\n## 實作比較的界線\n\n範例對同一固定split展示Ridge及Lasso的係數與holdout指標。這是機制比較，不應反覆看holdout調alpha；正式選擇放train CV，最後再評估。若CV前先fit scaler或selector，全流程仍可能洩漏。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n調高Ridge alpha，係數norm通常下降；train error可能上升，val不必單調。若過大，預測可能接近只猜常數。解答：在對數尺度搜尋多個alpha，與dummy和未正則baseline比較，不以某次最大alpha分數較高就宣稱越大越好。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/06_regularization.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Compare ridge and lasso on the same fixed split.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge,Lasso\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom course_core import regression_data, holdout, regression_metrics\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=regression_data()\n        a,b,c,d=holdout(x,y)\n        reports={}\n        for name,estimator in [('ridge',Ridge(alpha=10.)),('lasso',Lasso(alpha=1.,max_iter=5000))]:\n            model=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),estimator).fit(a,c)\n            reports[name]={'coefficients_in_scaled_units':model[-1].coef_,\n                           'holdout':regression_metrics(d,model.predict(b))}\n        result={'fixed_settings_demonstration':reports,'selection':'do not choose hyperparameters on these holdout scores'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Ridge與Lasso](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#ridge-regression-and-classification)\n- [ElasticNet](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#elastic-net)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "ridgelassoelastic-net", "name": "Ridge、Lasso與Elastic Net：用限制換取穩定性", "html": "Ridge、Lasso與Elastic Net：用限制換取穩定性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "為什麼懲罰係數", "html": "為什麼懲罰係數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "縮放與係數解讀", "html": "縮放與係數解讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "稀疏不是因果選擇", "html": "稀疏不是因果選擇", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "實作比較的界線", "html": "實作比較的界線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "15-logistic", "group": "linear", "title": "Logistic Regression：機率、Log loss與決策邊界", "summary": "從線性分數到二元機率，使用1.9版的正則化介面。", "tags": ["LogisticRegression", "sigmoid", "log loss", "C", "l1_ratio"], "example": "07_logistic.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"logistic-regressionlog-loss\">Logistic Regression：機率、Log loss與決策邊界</h1>\n<p>從線性分數到二元機率，使用1.9版的正則化介面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"regression\">名稱有Regression，任務是分類</h2>\n<p>模型先計算z=wᵀx+b，再用sigmoid轉成正例機率。當門檻為.5時，決策邊界z=0是線性超平面。模型估計機率並不保證校準完美，尤其資料偏差、class weight與分布改變都會影響解讀。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\np=\\sigma(z)=\\frac1{1+e^{-z}},\\qquad\nL=-\\frac1N\\sum_i[y_i\\log p_i+(1-y_i)\\log(1-p_i)]\n$$</div>\n<p>若z=0，p=.5；z約2.197時p=.9。真實label=0但模型p=.99會受很大Log loss，與只看分類對錯的accuracy不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"api\">使用目前API</h2>\n<p>本課1.9使用C及l1_ratio描述正則化，不以舊penalty參數作主線。l1_ratio=0為L2，1為L1，介於其間為Elastic Net；solver需支援所選形式，L1／混合常使用saga。C越大限制越弱，與Ridge alpha方向不同；C=np.inf表示不施加該正則化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">標準化與收斂</h2>\n<p>特徵經StandardScaler再fit，max_iter是迭代上限，不是必須剛好執行的次數。遇到ConvergenceWarning應看尺度、solver、tol與資料，再決定增加預算；不要只遮掉警告。決策門檻用validation調，不用調C代替所有成本決策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"classes_\">classes_與機率欄</h2>\n<p>predict_proba回傳[N,C]，每欄依classes_排序，正例未必永遠在你猜的欄。core的probability會查positive class位置。decision_function是分數，不可對所有模型直接當[0,1]機率；SVM章會特別示範。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>同一模型將threshold由.5降.2，weights改了嗎？答案：沒有，改的是決策；分類混淆矩陣會變，但原機率與排序不變。若將class_weight改balanced則會重新fit，目標已不同，機率也可能變；這兩項操作不能混稱為同一種「提高recall」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/07_logistic.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Current LogisticRegression API with raw classes and probabilities.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">l1_ratio</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">scores</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;classes&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">classes_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;first_five_probabilities&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">scores</span><span class=\"p\">[:</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;probability_row_sums&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict_proba</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)[:</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;holdout&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">scores</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#logistic-regression\">Logistic regression</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LogisticRegression.html\">1.9 LogisticRegression API</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Logistic Regression：機率、Log loss與決策邊界\n\n從線性分數到二元機率，使用1.9版的正則化介面。\n\n## 名稱有Regression，任務是分類\n\n模型先計算z=wᵀx+b，再用sigmoid轉成正例機率。當門檻為.5時，決策邊界z=0是線性超平面。模型估計機率並不保證校準完美，尤其資料偏差、class weight與分布改變都會影響解讀。\n\n$$\np=\\sigma(z)=\\frac1{1+e^{-z}},\\qquad\nL=-\\frac1N\\sum_i[y_i\\log p_i+(1-y_i)\\log(1-p_i)]\n$$\n\n若z=0，p=.5；z約2.197時p=.9。真實label=0但模型p=.99會受很大Log loss，與只看分類對錯的accuracy不同。\n\n## 使用目前API\n\n本課1.9使用C及l1_ratio描述正則化，不以舊penalty參數作主線。l1_ratio=0為L2，1為L1，介於其間為Elastic Net；solver需支援所選形式，L1／混合常使用saga。C越大限制越弱，與Ridge alpha方向不同；C=np.inf表示不施加該正則化。\n\n## 標準化與收斂\n\n特徵經StandardScaler再fit，max_iter是迭代上限，不是必須剛好執行的次數。遇到ConvergenceWarning應看尺度、solver、tol與資料，再決定增加預算；不要只遮掉警告。決策門檻用validation調，不用調C代替所有成本決策。\n\n## classes_與機率欄\n\npredict_proba回傳[N,C]，每欄依classes_排序，正例未必永遠在你猜的欄。core的probability會查positive class位置。decision_function是分數，不可對所有模型直接當[0,1]機率；SVM章會特別示範。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n同一模型將threshold由.5降.2，weights改了嗎？答案：沒有，改的是決策；分類混淆矩陣會變，但原機率與排序不變。若將class_weight改balanced則會重新fit，目標已不同，機率也可能變；這兩項操作不能混稱為同一種「提高recall」。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/07_logistic.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Current LogisticRegression API with raw classes and probabilities.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom course_core import binary_data,holdout,probability,binary_metrics\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        a,b,c,d=holdout(x,y)\n        model=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),LogisticRegression(C=1.,l1_ratio=0,max_iter=1000)).fit(a,c)\n        scores=probability(model,b)\n        result={'classes':model.classes_,'first_five_probabilities':scores[:5],\n                'probability_row_sums':model.predict_proba(b)[:5].sum(1),\n                'holdout':binary_metrics(d,scores)}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Logistic regression](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#logistic-regression)\n- [1.9 LogisticRegression API](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LogisticRegression.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "logistic-regressionlog-loss", "name": "Logistic Regression：機率、Log loss與決策邊界", "html": "Logistic Regression：機率、Log loss與決策邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "regression", "name": "名稱有Regression，任務是分類", "html": "名稱有Regression，任務是分類", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "api", "name": "使用目前API", "html": "使用目前API", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "標準化與收斂", "html": "標準化與收斂", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "classes_", "name": "classes_與機率欄", "html": "classes_與機率欄", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "16-target-types", "group": "linear", "title": "二元、多類與多標籤：不要讓答案格式決定錯任務", "summary": "分清互斥類別、可同時成立的標籤與不同平均方式。", "tags": ["multiclass", "multilabel", "OneVsRestClassifier", "softmax"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">二元、多類與多標籤：不要讓答案格式決定錯任務</h1>\n<p>分清互斥類別、可同時成立的標籤與不同平均方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"y\">三種不同的y</h2>\n<p>二元y[N]只有兩類；多類單選y[N]每筆只能一類；多標籤y[N,C]每一欄獨立是否成立。文章可同時屬於科技與商業是多標籤，水果只能選蘋果／香蕉／梨是單選。不要因為label是三欄one-hot就自動把任務當多標籤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"logisticsoftmax\">多類Logistic與softmax</h2>\n<p>多類模型可將每類線性分數用softmax正規化，機率加總1。支援multinomial的solver依目前API處理；不沿用已棄用的multi_class參數教學。One-vs-Rest則拆成各類與其餘的二元問題，與共同多類目標不同。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nP(Y=c\\mid x)=\\frac{\\exp(z_c)}{\\sum_k\\exp(z_k)}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">多標籤的決策</h2>\n<p>每欄可有自己的機率與threshold，同一筆可以全部不選或選多個；classes與欄位順序必須保存。OneVsRestClassifier等wrapper可把支援的基礎分類器套用到多標籤，但還是要檢查訓練中每欄是否有正負例。非常稀有標籤可能無法在每fold形成可學問題。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.multiclass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">OneVsRestClassifier</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">OneVsRestClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l1_ratio</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># y_multilabel.shape == (N,C)</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># model.fit(X_train,y_multilabel)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_3\">評估方式不可混用</h2>\n<p>macro每類同權，micro先合計計數，weighted依支持數，subset accuracy要求一筆所有標籤完全正確。多標籤只漏一個就subset錯，與每標籤正確率是不同難度。報告應列每類support，否則macro分數可能由幾個樣本極少類主導。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>兩筆真值[[1,0],[1,1]]、預測[[1,0],[1,0]]，subset accuracy=.5；四個位置有三個正確，逐標籤accuracy=.75。解答：兩者回答不同問題，不能只挑較大者。當任務從單選改多標籤，資料標註、loss、決策與指標都需一起重設，而不是只把模型輸出欄數改大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/multiclass.html\">Multiclass與multilabel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#classification-metrics\">Classification metrics</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 二元、多類與多標籤：不要讓答案格式決定錯任務\n\n分清互斥類別、可同時成立的標籤與不同平均方式。\n\n## 三種不同的y\n\n二元y[N]只有兩類；多類單選y[N]每筆只能一類；多標籤y[N,C]每一欄獨立是否成立。文章可同時屬於科技與商業是多標籤，水果只能選蘋果／香蕉／梨是單選。不要因為label是三欄one-hot就自動把任務當多標籤。\n\n## 多類Logistic與softmax\n\n多類模型可將每類線性分數用softmax正規化，機率加總1。支援multinomial的solver依目前API處理；不沿用已棄用的multi_class參數教學。One-vs-Rest則拆成各類與其餘的二元問題，與共同多類目標不同。\n\n$$\nP(Y=c\\mid x)=\\frac{\\exp(z_c)}{\\sum_k\\exp(z_k)}\n$$\n\n## 多標籤的決策\n\n每欄可有自己的機率與threshold，同一筆可以全部不選或選多個；classes與欄位順序必須保存。OneVsRestClassifier等wrapper可把支援的基礎分類器套用到多標籤，但還是要檢查訓練中每欄是否有正負例。非常稀有標籤可能無法在每fold形成可學問題。\n\n```python\nfrom sklearn.multiclass import OneVsRestClassifier\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nmodel=OneVsRestClassifier(LogisticRegression(l1_ratio=0,max_iter=1000))\n# y_multilabel.shape == (N,C)\n# model.fit(X_train,y_multilabel)\n```\n\n## 評估方式不可混用\n\nmacro每類同權，micro先合計計數，weighted依支持數，subset accuracy要求一筆所有標籤完全正確。多標籤只漏一個就subset錯，與每標籤正確率是不同難度。報告應列每類support，否則macro分數可能由幾個樣本極少類主導。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n兩筆真值[[1,0],[1,1]]、預測[[1,0],[1,0]]，subset accuracy=.5；四個位置有三個正確，逐標籤accuracy=.75。解答：兩者回答不同問題，不能只挑較大者。當任務從單選改多標籤，資料標註、loss、決策與指標都需一起重設，而不是只把模型輸出欄數改大。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Multiclass與multilabel](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/multiclass.html)\n- [Classification metrics](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#classification-metrics)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "二元、多類與多標籤：不要讓答案格式決定錯任務", "html": "二元、多類與多標籤：不要讓答案格式決定錯任務", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "y", "name": "三種不同的y", "html": "三種不同的y", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "logisticsoftmax", "name": "多類Logistic與softmax", "html": "多類Logistic與softmax", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "多標籤的決策", "html": "多標籤的決策", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "評估方式不可混用", "html": "評估方式不可混用", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "17-sgd", "group": "linear", "title": "梯度下降與SGD：步長、mini-batch與正則化", "summary": "理解迭代模型如何更新，以及收斂、資料順序和尺度的關係。", "tags": ["SGD", "gradient descent", "learning rate", "SGDClassifier"], "html": "<h1 id=\"sgdmini-batch\">梯度下降與SGD：步長、mini-batch與正則化</h1>\n<p>理解迭代模型如何更新，以及收斂、資料順序和尺度的關係。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">一次更新做什麼</h2>\n<p>對某個loss計算當下參數梯度，再往負方向更新。full-batch使用整份train，SGD使用單筆或小批近似；梯度含抽樣波動，但每次較便宜。它是求解方法，不是與Logistic、線性模型互斥的資料任務。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\theta_{t+1}=\\theta_t-\\eta_t\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_B(\\theta_t)\n$$</div>\n<p>步長η太小慢，太大震盪／發散；schedule隨時間減小是常見設計。不同loss縮放、batch與特徵尺度會改變適合步長，不能把別人的lr當普遍常數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"scikit-learnsgd\">scikit-learn的SGD入口</h2>\n<p>SGDClassifier可用loss='log_loss'學線性機率分類，hinge學線性margin分類。SGDRegressor用於回歸。max_iter與tol控制停止，alpha控制正則化；對資料尺度敏感，先用train統計縮放。partial_fit可增量更新，但不是所有estimator都有這個方法。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">SGDClassifier</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">SGDClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;log_loss&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">alpha</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.0001</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                  <span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">tol</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.001</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># model.fit(X_train,y_train)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_2\">收斂不等於泛化</h2>\n<p>optimizer足夠收斂只是接近此訓練目標的解；過擬合仍可能發生。更多iter可降低train loss，也可能讓val沒有進步。反過來train都很差，先確認資料、特徵與最佳化，不直接認定需更深模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">資料順序與重現</h2>\n<p>shuffle、random_state、部分更新次序與特徵轉換都影響路徑。相同seed不保證跨版本／數值平台完全逐值一致。增量時若scaler統計持續改變而模型沿用舊座標，就會產生額外問題，第47章會說明固定前處理與串流設計。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>L=(w-3)²，w=0、lr=.1，導數-6，下一步w=.6；lr=2則跳到12，loss反而更大。解答：正確導數不保證任意步長下降。實作時先用可手算小目標，再用固定資料與學習曲線診斷，而不是只把max_iter一直加大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/sgd.html\">Stochastic Gradient Descent</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html\">線性模型</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 梯度下降與SGD：步長、mini-batch與正則化\n\n理解迭代模型如何更新，以及收斂、資料順序和尺度的關係。\n\n## 一次更新做什麼\n\n對某個loss計算當下參數梯度，再往負方向更新。full-batch使用整份train，SGD使用單筆或小批近似；梯度含抽樣波動，但每次較便宜。它是求解方法，不是與Logistic、線性模型互斥的資料任務。\n\n$$\n\\theta_{t+1}=\\theta_t-\\eta_t\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_B(\\theta_t)\n$$\n\n步長η太小慢，太大震盪／發散；schedule隨時間減小是常見設計。不同loss縮放、batch與特徵尺度會改變適合步長，不能把別人的lr當普遍常數。\n\n## scikit-learn的SGD入口\n\nSGDClassifier可用loss='log_loss'學線性機率分類，hinge學線性margin分類。SGDRegressor用於回歸。max_iter與tol控制停止，alpha控制正則化；對資料尺度敏感，先用train統計縮放。partial_fit可增量更新，但不是所有estimator都有這個方法。\n\n```python\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import SGDClassifier\nmodel=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),SGDClassifier(loss='log_loss',alpha=.0001,\n                  max_iter=1000,tol=.001,random_state=7))\n# model.fit(X_train,y_train)\n```\n\n## 收斂不等於泛化\n\noptimizer足夠收斂只是接近此訓練目標的解；過擬合仍可能發生。更多iter可降低train loss，也可能讓val沒有進步。反過來train都很差，先確認資料、特徵與最佳化，不直接認定需更深模型。\n\n## 資料順序與重現\n\nshuffle、random_state、部分更新次序與特徵轉換都影響路徑。相同seed不保證跨版本／數值平台完全逐值一致。增量時若scaler統計持續改變而模型沿用舊座標，就會產生額外問題，第47章會說明固定前處理與串流設計。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nL=(w-3)²，w=0、lr=.1，導數-6，下一步w=.6；lr=2則跳到12，loss反而更大。解答：正確導數不保證任意步長下降。實作時先用可手算小目標，再用固定資料與學習曲線診斷，而不是只把max_iter一直加大。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Stochastic Gradient Descent](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/sgd.html)\n- [線性模型](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "sgdmini-batch", "name": "梯度下降與SGD：步長、mini-batch與正則化", "html": "梯度下降與SGD：步長、mini-batch與正則化", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "一次更新做什麼", "html": "一次更新做什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "scikit-learnsgd", "name": "scikit-learn的SGD入口", "html": "scikit-learn的SGD入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "收斂不等於泛化", "html": "收斂不等於泛化", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "資料順序與重現", "html": "資料順序與重現", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "18-knn", "group": "linear", "title": "k近鄰：距離、投票與維度的代價", "summary": "用最直接的相似樣本方法，理解尺度與局部平滑。", "tags": ["kNN", "KNeighborsClassifier", "distance", "curse of dimensionality"], "example": "08_knn.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"k\">k近鄰：距離、投票與維度的代價</h1>\n<p>用最直接的相似樣本方法，理解尺度與局部平滑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">不先壓縮成一組係數</h2>\n<p>kNN保存訓練樣本，預測時找最近k筆，分類投票或距離加權；回歸則平均答案。訓練可能便宜，查詢則需要距離計算與儲存。資料量大、維度高時，不能只看fit時間就說模型效率高。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nd(x,z)=\\sqrt{\\sum_j(x_j-z_j)^2},\\qquad\n\\hat p_c=\\frac{\\sum_{i\\in N_k(x)}a_i\\,1[y_i=c]}{\\sum_{i\\in N_k(x)}a_i}\n$$</div>\n<p>uniform時a_i=1；distance權重依距離。輸出比例是鄰域估計，不自動等於已校準的機率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"k_1\">k控制局部細節</h2>\n<p>k=1可記住train細節，對雜訊敏感；較大k更平滑，但可能跨越類別邊界而欠擬合。搜尋k時必須小於每折train筆數。用CV比較並保留前處理在Pipeline，不只看訓練accuracy幾乎滿分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">尺度決定什麼叫近</h2>\n<p>若一欄金額上萬、一欄比例0..1，原始L2通常被金額主導。StandardScaler用train統計轉換；如果任務重視不同方向，距離或特徵權重也應反映問題。名目類別編成整數的距離往往沒有意義，需要適當編碼。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">高維與資料稀疏</h2>\n<p>維度提高後，要有足夠樣本填滿局部空間更困難，距離區分可能變弱。降維與特徵選擇有時有益，卻要在CV內fit。KDTree／BallTree不是所有高維資料都比brute force快，需依資料量、維度與metric量測。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>查詢x=2，train位置[0,1,4]、標籤[0,1,1]，k=1預測1，k=3多數仍1；但uniform與distance估計比例不同。解答：把距離與每個鄰居標籤一起列出，比只看最後類別更能解釋。範例輸出第一筆查詢的scaled_distances與indices，沿著索引回看樣本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/08_knn.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Scaled distance and k-neighbor classification.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.neighbors</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">KNeighborsClassifier</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">KNeighborsClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_neighbors</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">weights</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;distance&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">distance</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">index</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">kneighbors</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">transform</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">[:</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]))</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;first_query_neighbors&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">index</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;scaled_distances&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">distance</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;holdout&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">))}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/neighbors.html\">Nearest Neighbors</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# k近鄰：距離、投票與維度的代價\n\n用最直接的相似樣本方法，理解尺度與局部平滑。\n\n## 不先壓縮成一組係數\n\nkNN保存訓練樣本，預測時找最近k筆，分類投票或距離加權；回歸則平均答案。訓練可能便宜，查詢則需要距離計算與儲存。資料量大、維度高時，不能只看fit時間就說模型效率高。\n\n$$\nd(x,z)=\\sqrt{\\sum_j(x_j-z_j)^2},\\qquad\n\\hat p_c=\\frac{\\sum_{i\\in N_k(x)}a_i\\,1[y_i=c]}{\\sum_{i\\in N_k(x)}a_i}\n$$\n\nuniform時a_i=1；distance權重依距離。輸出比例是鄰域估計，不自動等於已校準的機率。\n\n## k控制局部細節\n\nk=1可記住train細節，對雜訊敏感；較大k更平滑，但可能跨越類別邊界而欠擬合。搜尋k時必須小於每折train筆數。用CV比較並保留前處理在Pipeline，不只看訓練accuracy幾乎滿分。\n\n## 尺度決定什麼叫近\n\n若一欄金額上萬、一欄比例0..1，原始L2通常被金額主導。StandardScaler用train統計轉換；如果任務重視不同方向，距離或特徵權重也應反映問題。名目類別編成整數的距離往往沒有意義，需要適當編碼。\n\n## 高維與資料稀疏\n\n維度提高後，要有足夠樣本填滿局部空間更困難，距離區分可能變弱。降維與特徵選擇有時有益，卻要在CV內fit。KDTree／BallTree不是所有高維資料都比brute force快，需依資料量、維度與metric量測。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n查詢x=2，train位置[0,1,4]、標籤[0,1,1]，k=1預測1，k=3多數仍1；但uniform與distance估計比例不同。解答：把距離與每個鄰居標籤一起列出，比只看最後類別更能解釋。範例輸出第一筆查詢的scaled_distances與indices，沿著索引回看樣本。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/08_knn.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Scaled distance and k-neighbor classification.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.neighbors import KNeighborsClassifier\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom course_core import binary_data,holdout,probability,binary_metrics\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        a,b,c,d=holdout(x,y)\n        model=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),KNeighborsClassifier(n_neighbors=7,weights='distance')).fit(a,c)\n        distance,index=model[-1].kneighbors(model[0].transform(b[:1]))\n        result={'first_query_neighbors':index,'scaled_distances':distance,\n                'holdout':binary_metrics(d,probability(model,b))}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Nearest Neighbors](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/neighbors.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "k", "name": "k近鄰：距離、投票與維度的代價", "html": "k近鄰：距離、投票與維度的代價", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "不先壓縮成一組係數", "html": "不先壓縮成一組係數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "k_1", "name": "k控制局部細節", "html": "k控制局部細節", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "尺度決定什麼叫近", "html": "尺度決定什麼叫近", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "高維與資料稀疏", "html": "高維與資料稀疏", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "19-naive-bayes", "group": "nonlinear", "title": "Naive Bayes：條件獨立、平滑與文字分類", "summary": "從Bayes公式理解高效基準，也看見機率假設的限制。", "tags": ["Naive Bayes", "MultinomialNB", "GaussianNB", "smoothing"], "example": "09_naive_bayes.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"naive-bayes\">Naive Bayes：條件獨立、平滑與文字分類</h1>\n<p>從Bayes公式理解高效基準，也看見機率假設的限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">在每個類別內分開估特徵</h2>\n<p>由Bayes公式，P(c|x)與P(c)P(x|c)成正比。Naive假設給定類別後特徵條件獨立，將聯合分布拆乘積。文字單字並不真的獨立，但簡化模型仍常是有效基準；預測可用不代表假設成為真理。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\hat c=\\arg\\max_c\\left[\\log P(c)+\\sum_j\\log P(x_j\\mid c)\\right]\n$$</div>\n<p>用log避免許多小機率相乘underflow。類別先驗與訓練樣本分布有關，資料抽樣比例改變時解讀要小心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">選對分布</h2>\n<p>MultinomialNB對非負計數／權重常見於文字；BernoulliNB用二元出現；GaussianNB以每類各特徵高斯分布處理連續值。不能把包含負值的StandardScaler輸出直接塞MultinomialNB，再用取絕對值掩蓋問題。TF-IDF常搭MultinomialNB作實用基準，但它不再是單純整數詞頻生成故事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">平滑避免零機率</h2>\n<p>某字在某類沒出現，若直接估0，乘積就全部為0。加α平滑給未見事件保留質量；α越大越向平滑分布靠近。搜尋α仍要在train內CV，詞表與IDF也放同一Pipeline，不先看全語料建立特徵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">本章文字示範</h2>\n<p>六段自寫英文短句分sport／software，TF-IDF加NB對兩段新句推論。這是小詞表機制，不是大語料準確率。中文需要斷詞或char n-gram策略，會在第43章補充；不要把英文預設token規則當中文萬用處理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>如果同義特徵高度相關，獨立假設可能重複計入證據，使機率過度自信。解答：以獨立保留資料檢查log loss／校準，不能只因accuracy不錯就相信每個.99。對負數特徵錯誤，先回到分布假設，選合適NB或改特徵，而非亂改dtype。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/09_naive_bayes.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Tiny original English text fixture; no corpus download.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.feature_extraction.text</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">TfidfVectorizer</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.naive_bayes</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">MultinomialNB</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">texts</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;team wins football match&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;football goal and team&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;match player scores goal&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n               <span class=\"s1\">&#39;python code and data&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;software code fixes bug&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;python software data tools&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;sport&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;sport&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;sport&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;software&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;software&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;software&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">TfidfVectorizer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ngram_range</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span><span class=\"n\">MultinomialNB</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">alpha</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">texts</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">query</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;python code tools&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;team scores goal&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;queries&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">query</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;predictions&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">query</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;classes&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">classes_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;vocabulary_size&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">vocabulary_</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;scope&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;tiny mechanism example, not text accuracy evaluation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/naive_bayes.html\">Naive Bayes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/feature_extraction.html#text-feature-extraction\">文字特徵</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Naive Bayes：條件獨立、平滑與文字分類\n\n從Bayes公式理解高效基準，也看見機率假設的限制。\n\n## 在每個類別內分開估特徵\n\n由Bayes公式，P(c|x)與P(c)P(x|c)成正比。Naive假設給定類別後特徵條件獨立，將聯合分布拆乘積。文字單字並不真的獨立，但簡化模型仍常是有效基準；預測可用不代表假設成為真理。\n\n$$\n\\hat c=\\arg\\max_c\\left[\\log P(c)+\\sum_j\\log P(x_j\\mid c)\\right]\n$$\n\n用log避免許多小機率相乘underflow。類別先驗與訓練樣本分布有關，資料抽樣比例改變時解讀要小心。\n\n## 選對分布\n\nMultinomialNB對非負計數／權重常見於文字；BernoulliNB用二元出現；GaussianNB以每類各特徵高斯分布處理連續值。不能把包含負值的StandardScaler輸出直接塞MultinomialNB，再用取絕對值掩蓋問題。TF-IDF常搭MultinomialNB作實用基準，但它不再是單純整數詞頻生成故事。\n\n## 平滑避免零機率\n\n某字在某類沒出現，若直接估0，乘積就全部為0。加α平滑給未見事件保留質量；α越大越向平滑分布靠近。搜尋α仍要在train內CV，詞表與IDF也放同一Pipeline，不先看全語料建立特徵。\n\n## 本章文字示範\n\n六段自寫英文短句分sport／software，TF-IDF加NB對兩段新句推論。這是小詞表機制，不是大語料準確率。中文需要斷詞或char n-gram策略，會在第43章補充；不要把英文預設token規則當中文萬用處理。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n如果同義特徵高度相關，獨立假設可能重複計入證據，使機率過度自信。解答：以獨立保留資料檢查log loss／校準，不能只因accuracy不錯就相信每個.99。對負數特徵錯誤，先回到分布假設，選合適NB或改特徵，而非亂改dtype。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/09_naive_bayes.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Tiny original English text fixture; no corpus download.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.feature_extraction.text import TfidfVectorizer\nfrom sklearn.naive_bayes import MultinomialNB\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        texts=['team wins football match','football goal and team','match player scores goal',\n               'python code and data','software code fixes bug','python software data tools']\n        labels=['sport','sport','sport','software','software','software']\n        model=make_pipeline(TfidfVectorizer(ngram_range=(1,2)),MultinomialNB(alpha=1.)).fit(texts,labels)\n        query=['python code tools','team scores goal']\n        result={'queries':query,'predictions':model.predict(query),'classes':model.classes_,\n                'vocabulary_size':len(model[0].vocabulary_),\n                'scope':'tiny mechanism example, not text accuracy evaluation'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Naive Bayes](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/naive_bayes.html)\n- [文字特徵](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/feature_extraction.html#text-feature-extraction)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "naive-bayes", "name": "Naive Bayes：條件獨立、平滑與文字分類", "html": "Naive Bayes：條件獨立、平滑與文字分類", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "在每個類別內分開估特徵", "html": "在每個類別內分開估特徵", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "選對分布", "html": "選對分布", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "平滑避免零機率", "html": "平滑避免零機率", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "本章文字示範", "html": "本章文字示範", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "20-svm", "group": "nonlinear", "title": "SVM與Kernel：margin、C與非線性邊界", "summary": "理解最大間隔的偏好，以及RBF核和尺度之間的關係。", "tags": ["SVM", "SVC", "margin", "kernel", "RBF", "gamma"], "example": "10_svm.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"svmkernelmarginc\">SVM與Kernel：margin、C與非線性邊界</h1>\n<p>理解最大間隔的偏好，以及RBF核和尺度之間的關係。</p>\n<h2 id=\"margin\">margin為什麼重要</h2>\n<p>線性SVM尋找分隔超平面，偏好較大margin，同時允許部分樣本違反間隔。C控制錯誤／違反懲罰與權重大小的取捨，較大C通常較努力貼合train。支援向量是對邊界有影響的樣本，不是全部資料中唯一有意義的點。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\min_{w,b}\\frac12\\lVert w\\rVert^2+C\\sum_i\\max(0,1-y_i(w^Tx_i+b))\n$$</div>\n<p>此式使用y∈{-1,+1}表達hinge loss，sklearn的類別標籤仍可由API處理，不需要為了公式亂改原始label mapping。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kernel\">Kernel隱含相似度</h2>\n<p>RBF依平方距離產生相似度，gamma大時影響更局部，可能形成複雜邊界；gamma小更平滑。C與gamma要一起驗證。核技巧避免明確寫出某些高維映射，但不表示距離、尺度與計算量消失。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nK(x,z)=\\exp(-\\gamma\\lVert x-z\\rVert^2)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">實作與資源</h2>\n<p>StandardScaler→SVC(kernel='rbf')是本章基準，gamma='scale'依資料尺度計算預設。大型樣本kernel矩陣可能很昂貴，線性SVM或近似kernel可作替代。比較時同時看推論延遲與support vector數，不只accuracy。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">分數不是機率</h2>\n<p>預設SVC有decision_function，可用作ROC AUC等排序指標，但不能直接叫機率。probability選項／校準有額外fit成本與資料流程；本章明確回報decision score的AUC，第32章再做獨立的機率校準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>把某特徵放大1000倍再用原gamma，邊界可能大幅改變；解答：先fit train scaler，並把它放CV裡。若train幾乎全對、val很差，檢查C／gamma與資料量，不只增加max_iter。模型沒輸出predict_proba時，不應用任意min-max分數假裝已校準概率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/10_svm.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Scaled RBF SVM uses decision scores, not fake probabilities.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.svm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">SVC</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.metrics</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">accuracy_score</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">roc_auc_score</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">SVC</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">gamma</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;scale&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;rbf&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;accuracy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">accuracy_score</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;roc_auc_from_decision_scores&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">roc_auc_score</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">decision_function</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;support_vectors&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">n_support_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;decision_function values are not calibrated probabilities&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/svm.html\">Support Vector Machines</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/calibration.html\">概率校準</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# SVM與Kernel：margin、C與非線性邊界\n\n理解最大間隔的偏好，以及RBF核和尺度之間的關係。\n\n## margin為什麼重要\n\n線性SVM尋找分隔超平面，偏好較大margin，同時允許部分樣本違反間隔。C控制錯誤／違反懲罰與權重大小的取捨，較大C通常較努力貼合train。支援向量是對邊界有影響的樣本，不是全部資料中唯一有意義的點。\n\n$$\n\\min_{w,b}\\frac12\\lVert w\\rVert^2+C\\sum_i\\max(0,1-y_i(w^Tx_i+b))\n$$\n\n此式使用y∈{-1,+1}表達hinge loss，sklearn的類別標籤仍可由API處理，不需要為了公式亂改原始label mapping。\n\n## Kernel隱含相似度\n\nRBF依平方距離產生相似度，gamma大時影響更局部，可能形成複雜邊界；gamma小更平滑。C與gamma要一起驗證。核技巧避免明確寫出某些高維映射，但不表示距離、尺度與計算量消失。\n\n$$\nK(x,z)=\\exp(-\\gamma\\lVert x-z\\rVert^2)\n$$\n\n## 實作與資源\n\nStandardScaler→SVC(kernel='rbf')是本章基準，gamma='scale'依資料尺度計算預設。大型樣本kernel矩陣可能很昂貴，線性SVM或近似kernel可作替代。比較時同時看推論延遲與support vector數，不只accuracy。\n\n## 分數不是機率\n\n預設SVC有decision_function，可用作ROC AUC等排序指標，但不能直接叫機率。probability選項／校準有額外fit成本與資料流程；本章明確回報decision score的AUC，第32章再做獨立的機率校準。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n把某特徵放大1000倍再用原gamma，邊界可能大幅改變；解答：先fit train scaler，並把它放CV裡。若train幾乎全對、val很差，檢查C／gamma與資料量，不只增加max_iter。模型沒輸出predict_proba時，不應用任意min-max分數假裝已校準概率。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/10_svm.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Scaled RBF SVM uses decision scores, not fake probabilities.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.svm import SVC\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.metrics import accuracy_score,roc_auc_score\nfrom course_core import binary_data,holdout\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        a,b,c,d=holdout(x,y)\n        model=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),SVC(C=1.,gamma='scale',kernel='rbf')).fit(a,c)\n        result={'accuracy':accuracy_score(d,model.predict(b)),\n                'roc_auc_from_decision_scores':roc_auc_score(d,model.decision_function(b)),\n                'support_vectors':model[-1].n_support_,\n                'note':'decision_function values are not calibrated probabilities'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Support Vector Machines](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/svm.html)\n- [概率校準](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/calibration.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "svmkernelmarginc", "name": "SVM與Kernel：margin、C與非線性邊界", "html": "SVM與Kernel：margin、C與非線性邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "margin", "name": "margin為什麼重要", "html": "margin為什麼重要", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "kernel", "name": "Kernel隱含相似度", "html": "Kernel隱含相似度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "實作與資源", "html": "實作與資源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "分數不是機率", "html": "分數不是機率", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "21-trees", "group": "nonlinear", "title": "決策樹：分裂、Gini、Entropy與可讀規則", "summary": "用四筆樣本手算資訊改善，理解貪婪分段模型。", "tags": ["DecisionTreeClassifier", "Gini", "entropy", "split"], "example": "11_tree.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"ginientropy\">決策樹：分裂、Gini、Entropy與可讀規則</h1>\n<p>用四筆樣本手算資訊改善，理解貪婪分段模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">用一串問題切分空間</h2>\n<p>一個節點選某特徵與threshold，將資料分左右；葉節點保存類別分布或回歸預測。訓練每一步在可考慮分裂中尋找較大改善，是貪婪搜尋，不保證整棵樹是全域最佳。樹可表達非線性與交互，不需要先造所有多項式特徵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">純度與加權改善</h2>\n<p>Gini是1減去各類比例平方和，Entropy是負的機率對數和。純節點Gini=0；二元各半Gini=.5。分裂必須按左右樣本比例加權，不能只挑某一邊最純就說整體好。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nG(S)=1-\\sum_c p_c^2,\\qquad\n\\Delta=G(S)-\\frac{n_L}{n}G(L)-\\frac{n_R}{n}G(R)\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">手算一個分裂</h2>\n<p>x=[1,2,3,4]，y=[0,0,1,1]，父Gini=.5；threshold2.5分兩個純節點，改善.5。若threshold1.5，左純、右比例1/3與2/3，右Gini4/9，整體剩1/3，改善1/6。首頁樹實驗可調threshold核對。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">葉子機率與泛化</h2>\n<p>葉中3筆都正例就可能輸出1，但資料極少不代表現實確定。太深樹可記住train，max_depth、min_samples_leaf等限制很重要。解釋樹路徑是描述此模型的規則，仍不是因果證明；切分也可能對小資料變動敏感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">執行範例</h2>\n<p>範例限制depth3、leaf至少5，輸出實際第一個分裂特徵與threshold，並在固定保留資料計分。拿同樣train資料改random_state或少量擾動，可觀察結構不穩定。若需要圖，先追蹤一筆到葉，比一開始畫滿數百節點更有用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若左1筆純、右99筆混雜，不能說左右平均Gini只有一半；解答是以1/100與99/100加權。分類樹的leaf可回傳比例，回歸樹通常以平均值最小化平方誤差；不同criterion對預測與分裂定義都要明確。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/11_tree.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Inspect a bounded decision tree and its actual first split.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.tree</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">DecisionTreeClassifier</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">DecisionTreeClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">max_depth</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">min_samples_leaf</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;depth&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_depth</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;leaves&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_n_leaves</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;first_split_feature&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tree_</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">feature</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;first_split_threshold&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tree_</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">threshold</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;holdout&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">))}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_8\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/tree.html\">Decision Trees</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 決策樹：分裂、Gini、Entropy與可讀規則\n\n用四筆樣本手算資訊改善，理解貪婪分段模型。\n\n## 用一串問題切分空間\n\n一個節點選某特徵與threshold，將資料分左右；葉節點保存類別分布或回歸預測。訓練每一步在可考慮分裂中尋找較大改善，是貪婪搜尋，不保證整棵樹是全域最佳。樹可表達非線性與交互，不需要先造所有多項式特徵。\n\n## 純度與加權改善\n\nGini是1減去各類比例平方和，Entropy是負的機率對數和。純節點Gini=0；二元各半Gini=.5。分裂必須按左右樣本比例加權，不能只挑某一邊最純就說整體好。\n\n$$\nG(S)=1-\\sum_c p_c^2,\\qquad\n\\Delta=G(S)-\\frac{n_L}{n}G(L)-\\frac{n_R}{n}G(R)\n$$\n\n## 手算一個分裂\n\nx=[1,2,3,4]，y=[0,0,1,1]，父Gini=.5；threshold2.5分兩個純節點，改善.5。若threshold1.5，左純、右比例1/3與2/3，右Gini4/9，整體剩1/3，改善1/6。首頁樹實驗可調threshold核對。\n\n## 葉子機率與泛化\n\n葉中3筆都正例就可能輸出1，但資料極少不代表現實確定。太深樹可記住train，max_depth、min_samples_leaf等限制很重要。解釋樹路徑是描述此模型的規則，仍不是因果證明；切分也可能對小資料變動敏感。\n\n## 執行範例\n\n範例限制depth3、leaf至少5，輸出實際第一個分裂特徵與threshold，並在固定保留資料計分。拿同樣train資料改random_state或少量擾動，可觀察結構不穩定。若需要圖，先追蹤一筆到葉，比一開始畫滿數百節點更有用。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若左1筆純、右99筆混雜，不能說左右平均Gini只有一半；解答是以1/100與99/100加權。分類樹的leaf可回傳比例，回歸樹通常以平均值最小化平方誤差；不同criterion對預測與分裂定義都要明確。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/11_tree.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Inspect a bounded decision tree and its actual first split.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.tree import DecisionTreeClassifier\nfrom course_core import binary_data,holdout,probability,binary_metrics\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        a,b,c,d=holdout(x,y)\n        model=DecisionTreeClassifier(max_depth=3,min_samples_leaf=5,random_state=7).fit(a,c)\n        result={'depth':model.get_depth(),'leaves':model.get_n_leaves(),\n                'first_split_feature':model.tree_.feature[0],'first_split_threshold':model.tree_.threshold[0],\n                'holdout':binary_metrics(d,probability(model,b))}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Decision Trees](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/tree.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "ginientropy", "name": "決策樹：分裂、Gini、Entropy與可讀規則", "html": "決策樹：分裂、Gini、Entropy與可讀規則", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "用一串問題切分空間", "html": "用一串問題切分空間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "純度與加權改善", "html": "純度與加權改善", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "手算一個分裂", "html": "手算一個分裂", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "葉子機率與泛化", "html": "葉子機率與泛化", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "執行範例", "html": "執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "22-tree-control", "group": "nonlinear", "title": "控制樹的複雜度：深度、葉大小與剪枝", "summary": "將規則數量、穩定性與未見資料表現一起納入選擇。", "tags": ["max_depth", "min_samples_leaf", "ccp_alpha", "pruning"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">控制樹的複雜度：深度、葉大小與剪枝</h1>\n<p>將規則數量、穩定性與未見資料表現一起納入選擇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">先長滿不一定最好</h2>\n<p>深樹可以把每筆分到自己的葉，train分數很高，卻對雜訊與微小變動敏感。max_depth限制層數，min_samples_split限制能否分裂，min_samples_leaf限制每個子葉至少多少樣本，max_leaf_nodes限制葉數。每個選項控制不同結構，不是換名字的同一參數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">預剪枝與後剪枝</h2>\n<p>前述限制在建樹時阻止過度細分；cost-complexity pruning則以誤差加葉數懲罰來比較子樹，ccp_alpha越大通常偏好較小樹。剪枝路徑提供候選值，但選哪個仍需訓練內驗證，不能看test挑一棵最漂亮的樹。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nR_\\alpha(T)=R(T)+\\alpha\\,|\\mathrm{leaves}(T)|\n$$</div>\n<p>這是權衡結構複雜度的概念。實際R的定義與加權依API，別把任務accuracy直接代入後宣稱完全相同最佳化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">可以執行的比較</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.tree</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">DecisionTreeClassifier</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.model_selection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">GridSearchCV</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span>\n<span class=\"n\">search</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">GridSearchCV</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">DecisionTreeClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;max_depth&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;min_samples_leaf&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">15</span><span class=\"p\">]},</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">cv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">shuffle</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">scoring</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;balanced_accuracy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># search.fit(X_train,y_train)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>同時控制候選數與預算，記錄best_params、fold變異及樹大小。不要只因CV平均差.001就忽略兩倍規則數與穩定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">實務限制</h2>\n<p>樹通常對軸方向切分，斜邊界可能需要很多節點。連續特徵有許多候選切點，impurity-based importance可能偏好這類欄位。若重要性排名用於真實決策，另看heldout permutation與相關特徵，不能當作客觀因果排序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>N=100且min_samples_leaf=20，一次分裂若產生10與90筆是否允許？答案：不符合leaf下限。若depth變小val改善，可能減少過擬合，但仍要檢查切分變異；單次結果不足以證明所有資料都適合同樣depth。將模型大小與規則可讀性寫入選擇理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/tree.html#minimal-cost-complexity-pruning\">Tree複雜度與剪枝</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/grid_search.html\">超參數搜尋</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 控制樹的複雜度：深度、葉大小與剪枝\n\n將規則數量、穩定性與未見資料表現一起納入選擇。\n\n## 先長滿不一定最好\n\n深樹可以把每筆分到自己的葉，train分數很高，卻對雜訊與微小變動敏感。max_depth限制層數，min_samples_split限制能否分裂，min_samples_leaf限制每個子葉至少多少樣本，max_leaf_nodes限制葉數。每個選項控制不同結構，不是換名字的同一參數。\n\n## 預剪枝與後剪枝\n\n前述限制在建樹時阻止過度細分；cost-complexity pruning則以誤差加葉數懲罰來比較子樹，ccp_alpha越大通常偏好較小樹。剪枝路徑提供候選值，但選哪個仍需訓練內驗證，不能看test挑一棵最漂亮的樹。\n\n$$\nR_\\alpha(T)=R(T)+\\alpha\\,|\\mathrm{leaves}(T)|\n$$\n\n這是權衡結構複雜度的概念。實際R的定義與加權依API，別把任務accuracy直接代入後宣稱完全相同最佳化。\n\n## 可以執行的比較\n\n```python\nfrom sklearn.tree import DecisionTreeClassifier\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import GridSearchCV,StratifiedKFold\nsearch=GridSearchCV(DecisionTreeClassifier(random_state=7),\n    {'max_depth':[2,4,None],'min_samples_leaf':[1,5,15]},\n    cv=StratifiedKFold(3,shuffle=True,random_state=7),scoring='balanced_accuracy')\n# search.fit(X_train,y_train)\n```\n\n同時控制候選數與預算，記錄best_params、fold變異及樹大小。不要只因CV平均差.001就忽略兩倍規則數與穩定性。\n\n## 實務限制\n\n樹通常對軸方向切分，斜邊界可能需要很多節點。連續特徵有許多候選切點，impurity-based importance可能偏好這類欄位。若重要性排名用於真實決策，另看heldout permutation與相關特徵，不能當作客觀因果排序。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nN=100且min_samples_leaf=20，一次分裂若產生10與90筆是否允許？答案：不符合leaf下限。若depth變小val改善，可能減少過擬合，但仍要檢查切分變異；單次結果不足以證明所有資料都適合同樣depth。將模型大小與規則可讀性寫入選擇理由。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Tree複雜度與剪枝](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/tree.html#minimal-cost-complexity-pruning)\n- [超參數搜尋](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/grid_search.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "控制樹的複雜度：深度、葉大小與剪枝", "html": "控制樹的複雜度：深度、葉大小與剪枝", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "先長滿不一定最好", "html": "先長滿不一定最好", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "預剪枝與後剪枝", "html": "預剪枝與後剪枝", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "可以執行的比較", "html": "可以執行的比較", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "實務限制", "html": "實務限制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "23-forests", "group": "nonlinear", "title": "Bagging與Random Forest：多棵樹如何降低變異", "summary": "理解bootstrap、特徵隨機性與集成相關性，而非只增加樹數。", "tags": ["bagging", "RandomForestClassifier", "bootstrap", "OOB"], "example": "12_random_forest.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"baggingrandom-forest\">Bagging與Random Forest：多棵樹如何降低變異</h1>\n<p>理解bootstrap、特徵隨機性與集成相關性，而非只增加樹數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">為什麼平均多個模型</h2>\n<p>單棵深樹對資料擾動敏感。Bagging在bootstrap重抽樣上各自fit，再平均／投票；Random Forest還在分裂時只看部分特徵，降低樹之間過度相似。若所有樹完全相同，多加100棵也不會帶來相同的降變異收益。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\mathrm{Var}\\left(\\frac1B\\sum_b f_b\\right)\n=\\rho\\sigma^2+\\frac{1-\\rho}{B}\\sigma^2\n$$</div>\n<p>此式用各樹同變異、共同兩兩相關ρ的簡化假設，說明相關部分不會隨B無限消失；不是所有森林精確的性能公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">核心參數</h2>\n<p>n_estimators控制樹數與時間／儲存；max_features控制候選特徵；min_samples_leaf與depth控制單樹；bootstrap控制重抽樣。樹數增加通常減少集成隨機波動，但不能修好標籤錯誤、洩漏或缺少訊號。先固定random_state並看合理CV。</p>\n<h2 id=\"oob\">OOB的範圍</h2>\n<p>bootstrap某棵樹未抽到的樣本可做out-of-bag估計。它提供方便的內部檢查，不自動解決group／time依賴，也不代表你可以反覆調參後省略最終評估。若前處理先看全資料，OOB同樣可能承受洩漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">重要性與成本</h2>\n<p>feature_importances_是impurity改善累積，對高基數與相關特徵有偏好。回報其定義，另用heldout permutation驗證。森林可處理複雜邊界，但模型大、推論多樹可能比線性慢；n_jobs過大與外層CV平行一起用，可能造成資源競爭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>ρ=.5、σ²=1、B=100，簡化平均變異=.505，不是.01。解答：降低樹相關性與合理單樹品質同樣重要。將max_features改小可增加差異，但也可能削弱每棵樹，需要驗證。範例使用60棵與單執行緒確保小型離線測試，不宣稱是最佳生產設定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/12_random_forest.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Bagged randomized trees on a fixed synthetic holdout.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.ensemble</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">RandomForestClassifier</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">RandomForestClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_estimators</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">min_samples_leaf</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_features</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;sqrt&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                                     <span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_jobs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;trees&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">estimators_</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;holdout&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;impurity_importance&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">feature_importances_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;impurity importance is not causal importance&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/ensemble.html#forest\">Random forests與Bagging</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Bagging與Random Forest：多棵樹如何降低變異\n\n理解bootstrap、特徵隨機性與集成相關性，而非只增加樹數。\n\n## 為什麼平均多個模型\n\n單棵深樹對資料擾動敏感。Bagging在bootstrap重抽樣上各自fit，再平均／投票；Random Forest還在分裂時只看部分特徵，降低樹之間過度相似。若所有樹完全相同，多加100棵也不會帶來相同的降變異收益。\n\n$$\n\\mathrm{Var}\\left(\\frac1B\\sum_b f_b\\right)\n=\\rho\\sigma^2+\\frac{1-\\rho}{B}\\sigma^2\n$$\n\n此式用各樹同變異、共同兩兩相關ρ的簡化假設，說明相關部分不會隨B無限消失；不是所有森林精確的性能公式。\n\n## 核心參數\n\nn_estimators控制樹數與時間／儲存；max_features控制候選特徵；min_samples_leaf與depth控制單樹；bootstrap控制重抽樣。樹數增加通常減少集成隨機波動，但不能修好標籤錯誤、洩漏或缺少訊號。先固定random_state並看合理CV。\n\n## OOB的範圍\n\nbootstrap某棵樹未抽到的樣本可做out-of-bag估計。它提供方便的內部檢查，不自動解決group／time依賴，也不代表你可以反覆調參後省略最終評估。若前處理先看全資料，OOB同樣可能承受洩漏。\n\n## 重要性與成本\n\nfeature_importances_是impurity改善累積，對高基數與相關特徵有偏好。回報其定義，另用heldout permutation驗證。森林可處理複雜邊界，但模型大、推論多樹可能比線性慢；n_jobs過大與外層CV平行一起用，可能造成資源競爭。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nρ=.5、σ²=1、B=100，簡化平均變異=.505，不是.01。解答：降低樹相關性與合理單樹品質同樣重要。將max_features改小可增加差異，但也可能削弱每棵樹，需要驗證。範例使用60棵與單執行緒確保小型離線測試，不宣稱是最佳生產設定。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/12_random_forest.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Bagged randomized trees on a fixed synthetic holdout.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier\nfrom course_core import binary_data,holdout,probability,binary_metrics\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        a,b,c,d=holdout(x,y)\n        model=RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=60,min_samples_leaf=3,max_features='sqrt',\n                                     random_state=7,n_jobs=1).fit(a,c)\n        result={'trees':len(model.estimators_),'holdout':binary_metrics(d,probability(model,b)),\n                'impurity_importance':model.feature_importances_,\n                'note':'impurity importance is not causal importance'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Random forests與Bagging](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/ensemble.html#forest)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "baggingrandom-forest", "name": "Bagging與Random Forest：多棵樹如何降低變異", "html": "Bagging與Random Forest：多棵樹如何降低變異", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "為什麼平均多個模型", "html": "為什麼平均多個模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "核心參數", "html": "核心參數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "oob", "name": "OOB的範圍", "html": "OOB的範圍", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "重要性與成本", "html": "重要性與成本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "24-boosting", "group": "nonlinear", "title": "Boosting：逐步修正錯誤與Histogram Gradient Boosting", "summary": "比較加法模型、learning rate與樹數，建立強表格基準。", "tags": ["boosting", "HistGradientBoosting", "learning_rate", "AdaBoost"], "example": "13_boosting.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"boostinghistogram-gradient-boosting\">Boosting：逐步修正錯誤與Histogram Gradient Boosting</h1>\n<p>比較加法模型、learning rate與樹數，建立強表格基準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bagging\">與Bagging的差別</h2>\n<p>Bagging傾向平行訓練不同抽樣模型；Boosting逐步加入新模型修正目前誤差。加法形式累積許多小樹；每一步的修正目標依loss而定。平方誤差時可理解為擬合殘差，分類log loss則是對應負梯度，不能把所有boosting都說成直接預測y-ŷ。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nF_m(x)=F_{m-1}(x)+\\eta h_m(x)\n$$</div>\n<p>learning_rate η縮小每步影響，通常需與迭代數共同考慮。較小步長不保證相同樹數下更好，也不意味一定免於過擬合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"histogram\">Histogram與缺失</h2>\n<p>HistGradientBoosting先以bin整理連續特徵，減少切點搜尋成本，並支援特定missing處理。小例使用max_iter50、leaf7、early_stopping=False明確控制預算。真實問題可使用驗證式early stopping，但驗證資料仍有角色，不能再拿同一份當最終test。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">重要參數與診斷</h2>\n<p>learning_rate、max_iter、max_leaf_nodes、min_samples_leaf與l2_regularization共同控制容量。train太差可能步數不足或模型受限；train很好val差可能過擬合或分布問題。先比較強線性與森林基準，再用受控搜尋，而不是一次把所有上限拉大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"boosting\">其他Boosting家族</h2>\n<p>AdaBoost以樣本權重重視先前錯誤，有自己的演算法與估計器介面。XGBoost、LightGBM、CatBoost是常見外部生態，需各自最新版本與平台測試；本課不為了列名字而加入未驗證依賴。先以已安裝sklearn方法掌握共同邏輯，日後再做專門課程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>把learning_rate從.1降.01但max_iter仍50，成績降低不表示理論錯；解答：有效更新預算改變，需要同時比較足夠輪數與early stopping。高missing比例讓模型仍能predict，不等於資料正常，仍檢查缺失來源、時間與部署品質。分類機率還需校準評估，強模型不自動等於可靠概率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/13_boosting.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Histogram gradient boosting; bounded rounds, no external boosting package.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.ensemble</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">HistGradientBoostingClassifier</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">copy</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">[::</span><span class=\"mi\">13</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nan</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">HistGradientBoostingClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">50</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">learning_rate</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_leaf_nodes</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                                            <span class=\"n\">early_stopping</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;rounds&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">n_iter_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;training_missing_rows&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">int</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isnan</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">any</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;holdout&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">))}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/ensemble.html#histogram-based-gradient-boosting\">Gradient boosting與HistGradientBoosting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/ensemble.html#adaboost\">AdaBoost</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Boosting：逐步修正錯誤與Histogram Gradient Boosting\n\n比較加法模型、learning rate與樹數，建立強表格基準。\n\n## 與Bagging的差別\n\nBagging傾向平行訓練不同抽樣模型；Boosting逐步加入新模型修正目前誤差。加法形式累積許多小樹；每一步的修正目標依loss而定。平方誤差時可理解為擬合殘差，分類log loss則是對應負梯度，不能把所有boosting都說成直接預測y-ŷ。\n\n$$\nF_m(x)=F_{m-1}(x)+\\eta h_m(x)\n$$\n\nlearning_rate η縮小每步影響，通常需與迭代數共同考慮。較小步長不保證相同樹數下更好，也不意味一定免於過擬合。\n\n## Histogram與缺失\n\nHistGradientBoosting先以bin整理連續特徵，減少切點搜尋成本，並支援特定missing處理。小例使用max_iter50、leaf7、early_stopping=False明確控制預算。真實問題可使用驗證式early stopping，但驗證資料仍有角色，不能再拿同一份當最終test。\n\n## 重要參數與診斷\n\nlearning_rate、max_iter、max_leaf_nodes、min_samples_leaf與l2_regularization共同控制容量。train太差可能步數不足或模型受限；train很好val差可能過擬合或分布問題。先比較強線性與森林基準，再用受控搜尋，而不是一次把所有上限拉大。\n\n## 其他Boosting家族\n\nAdaBoost以樣本權重重視先前錯誤，有自己的演算法與估計器介面。XGBoost、LightGBM、CatBoost是常見外部生態，需各自最新版本與平台測試；本課不為了列名字而加入未驗證依賴。先以已安裝sklearn方法掌握共同邏輯，日後再做專門課程。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n把learning_rate從.1降.01但max_iter仍50，成績降低不表示理論錯；解答：有效更新預算改變，需要同時比較足夠輪數與early stopping。高missing比例讓模型仍能predict，不等於資料正常，仍檢查缺失來源、時間與部署品質。分類機率還需校準評估，強模型不自動等於可靠概率。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/13_boosting.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Histogram gradient boosting; bounded rounds, no external boosting package.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import HistGradientBoostingClassifier\nfrom course_core import binary_data,holdout,probability,binary_metrics\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        a,b,c,d=holdout(x,y)\n        a=a.copy();a[::13,0]=np.nan\n        model=HistGradientBoostingClassifier(max_iter=50,learning_rate=.1,max_leaf_nodes=7,\n                                            early_stopping=False,random_state=7).fit(a,c)\n        result={'rounds':model.n_iter_,'training_missing_rows':int(np.isnan(a).any(1).sum()),\n                'holdout':binary_metrics(d,probability(model,b))}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Gradient boosting與HistGradientBoosting](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/ensemble.html#histogram-based-gradient-boosting)\n- [AdaBoost](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/ensemble.html#adaboost)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "boostinghistogram-gradient-boosting", "name": "Boosting：逐步修正錯誤與Histogram Gradient Boosting", "html": "Boosting：逐步修正錯誤與Histogram Gradient Boosting", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "bagging", "name": "與Bagging的差別", "html": "與Bagging的差別", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "histogram", "name": "Histogram與缺失", "html": "Histogram與缺失", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "重要參數與診斷", "html": "重要參數與診斷", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "boosting", "name": "其他Boosting家族", "html": "其他Boosting家族", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "25-baselines", "group": "evaluation", "title": "建立基準與公平比較：先知道複雜度換來什麼", "summary": "用相同資料、切分與指標比較dummy、線性與非線性模型。", "tags": ["baseline", "DummyClassifier", "comparison", "selection"], "example": "14_compare.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">建立基準與公平比較：先知道複雜度換來什麼</h1>\n<p>用相同資料、切分與指標比較dummy、線性與非線性模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">基準模型提供參照</h2>\n<p>分類可用多數類或先驗機率，回歸可用train mean／median，時間預測可用前一期等合理規則。dummy不是隨便設一個差模型，而是代表不依賴複雜特徵的最低參照。若你的模型只多一點分數卻多100倍延遲，選擇理由必須包含實際用途。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">比較條件要固定</h2>\n<p>同一資料版本、split、前處理邊界、選模指標與合理訓練預算。比較kNN需縮放，樹未必要縮放，但都以同一fold評估；公平不等於每個方法強迫相同前處理。不同超參數搜尋量也會影響選擇偏差，應記錄候選數與花費。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">本章的實驗</h2>\n<p>對固定train索引建立3折清單，dummy、StandardScaler+Logistic、森林共用此清單，回報每折average precision。程式不使用保留test，不把對test的多次挑選當公平選模。比較結果只是這份合成資料的訓練CV，需要最終holdout檢驗整個選擇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">分數之外的維度</h2>\n<p>列出延遲、batch吞吐、模型大小、所需欄位、可處理缺失／新類別、維護與解釋需求。機率決策需要校準，排序任務需要top-k指標。最好的模型是符合條件與成本的方案，不一定是單一小數最高者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">反覆試驗的代價</h2>\n<p>一直看同一val挑新方案，等於逐步對它適應，最佳分數會樂觀。控制搜尋、記錄所有嘗試、使用nested CV或最後獨立test來估計選擇後表現。不要只保留成功run，讓別人不知道你試過多少次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>A的CV AP=.81、B=.82，B大10倍，能否直接選B？解答：先看配對fold差異與變異、任務成本、推論需求，必要時選較簡單且可驗證的方案。若A在不同split比較，這.01甚至不能直接歸因於模型。最後描述選擇準則，再開test，不在看到test後改規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/14_compare.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Compare candidates using identical training CV folds, not final test.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.dummy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">DummyClassifier</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.ensemble</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">RandomForestClassifier</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.model_selection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">cross_val_score</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">split_indices</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">split_indices</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;train&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">folds</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">shuffle</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">split</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">]))</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">models</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;dummy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">DummyClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">strategy</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;prior&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;logistic&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l1_ratio</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;forest&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">RandomForestClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_estimators</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_depth</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_jobs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">reports</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">cross_val_score</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">cv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">folds</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">scoring</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;average_precision&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_jobs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n                 <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">models</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">()}</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;training_cv_average_precision&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">reports</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test_used&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;same folds; repeated selection still requires final evaluation&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_9\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#dummy-estimators\">Dummy estimators與評估</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/model_selection.html\">模型選擇</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 建立基準與公平比較：先知道複雜度換來什麼\n\n用相同資料、切分與指標比較dummy、線性與非線性模型。\n\n## 基準模型提供參照\n\n分類可用多數類或先驗機率，回歸可用train mean／median，時間預測可用前一期等合理規則。dummy不是隨便設一個差模型，而是代表不依賴複雜特徵的最低參照。若你的模型只多一點分數卻多100倍延遲，選擇理由必須包含實際用途。\n\n## 比較條件要固定\n\n同一資料版本、split、前處理邊界、選模指標與合理訓練預算。比較kNN需縮放，樹未必要縮放，但都以同一fold評估；公平不等於每個方法強迫相同前處理。不同超參數搜尋量也會影響選擇偏差，應記錄候選數與花費。\n\n## 本章的實驗\n\n對固定train索引建立3折清單，dummy、StandardScaler+Logistic、森林共用此清單，回報每折average precision。程式不使用保留test，不把對test的多次挑選當公平選模。比較結果只是這份合成資料的訓練CV，需要最終holdout檢驗整個選擇。\n\n## 分數之外的維度\n\n列出延遲、batch吞吐、模型大小、所需欄位、可處理缺失／新類別、維護與解釋需求。機率決策需要校準，排序任務需要top-k指標。最好的模型是符合條件與成本的方案，不一定是單一小數最高者。\n\n## 反覆試驗的代價\n\n一直看同一val挑新方案，等於逐步對它適應，最佳分數會樂觀。控制搜尋、記錄所有嘗試、使用nested CV或最後獨立test來估計選擇後表現。不要只保留成功run，讓別人不知道你試過多少次。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nA的CV AP=.81、B=.82，B大10倍，能否直接選B？解答：先看配對fold差異與變異、任務成本、推論需求，必要時選較簡單且可驗證的方案。若A在不同split比較，這.01甚至不能直接歸因於模型。最後描述選擇準則，再開test，不在看到test後改規則。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/14_compare.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Compare candidates using identical training CV folds, not final test.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.dummy import DummyClassifier\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import StratifiedKFold,cross_val_score\nfrom course_core import binary_data,split_indices\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        train=split_indices(y)['train']\n        folds=list(StratifiedKFold(3,shuffle=True,random_state=7).split(x[train],y[train]))\n        models={'dummy':DummyClassifier(strategy='prior'),\n                'logistic':make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),LogisticRegression(l1_ratio=0,max_iter=1000)),\n                'forest':RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=30,max_depth=4,random_state=7,n_jobs=1)}\n        reports={name:cross_val_score(model,x[train],y[train],cv=folds,scoring='average_precision',n_jobs=1)\n                 for name,model in models.items()}\n        result={'training_cv_average_precision':reports,'test_used':False,\n                'note':'same folds; repeated selection still requires final evaluation'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Dummy estimators與評估](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#dummy-estimators)\n- [模型選擇](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/model_selection.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "建立基準與公平比較：先知道複雜度換來什麼", "html": "建立基準與公平比較：先知道複雜度換來什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "基準模型提供參照", "html": "基準模型提供參照", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "比較條件要固定", "html": "比較條件要固定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "本章的實驗", "html": "本章的實驗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "分數之外的維度", "html": "分數之外的維度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "反覆試驗的代價", "html": "反覆試驗的代價", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_9", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "26-classification-metrics", "group": "evaluation", "title": "分類評估：混淆矩陣、ROC、PR與不平衡", "summary": "用四筆手工分數算清楚precision、recall、F1及排序評估。", "tags": ["confusion matrix", "precision", "recall", "F1", "ROC", "AP", "PR"], "example": "15_classification_metrics.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"rocpr\">分類評估：混淆矩陣、ROC、PR與不平衡</h1>\n<p>用四筆手工分數算清楚precision、recall、F1及排序評估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">先把四種情況列出來</h2>\n<p>真正例且預測正為TP，真負例誤報正為FP，真正例漏掉為FN，兩者負為TN。sklearn confusion_matrix預設列是真值、欄是預測；類別順序要固定。accuracy=(TP+TN)/N對稀有事件可能被大量TN掩蓋。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\mathrm{Precision}=\\frac{TP}{TP+FP},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Recall}=\\frac{TP}{TP+FN},\\quad\nF_1=\\frac{2TP}{2TP+FP+FN}\n$$</div>\n<p>分母零時採明確政策，課程precision／recall記0；AUC在只有一類時沒有通常定義，core回None，避免造出一個看似有效分數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">手算範例</h2>\n<p>y=[1,1,0,0]，scores=[.9,.4,.8,.1]，threshold=.5，TP=FP=FN=TN=1，precision=recall=F1=.5。threshold=.85只接受第一筆，precision=1、recall=.5。這些是固定分數的決策變化，不是重新訓練。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rocpr_1\">ROC與PR</h2>\n<p>ROC看TPR與FPR的門檻軌跡，AUC衡量正負排序關係；PR看precision與recall，稀有正例時更直接反映誤報負擔。average precision依recall增量加權precision，與任意梯形插值PR面積不完全相同。本課以AP明確命名，不把所有指標都叫AUC。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">機率品質是另一件事</h2>\n<p>排序完全相同的兩組分數可有相同ROC AUC，但一組過度自信，log loss／Brier很差。分類閾值指標、排序指標與校準要分別看。macro/micro/weighted也要隨多類與多標籤情境說明，不能只比較字串名稱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>1000筆只有10正例，全猜負accuracy=.99但recall=0。解答：以支持數、PR與決策成本判斷，別把.99當成功。預測分數整體做嚴格單調轉換，排序指標可維持，固定.5門檻與機率品質卻可能不同。真實threshold在validation選，第33章會實作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/15_classification_metrics.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Hand-verifiable binary metrics and thresholds.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">scores</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">.9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;at_0_5&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">scores</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;at_0_85&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">scores</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.85</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;fixed handmade scores, not model accuracy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#classification-metrics\">Classification metrics</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 分類評估：混淆矩陣、ROC、PR與不平衡\n\n用四筆手工分數算清楚precision、recall、F1及排序評估。\n\n## 先把四種情況列出來\n\n真正例且預測正為TP，真負例誤報正為FP，真正例漏掉為FN，兩者負為TN。sklearn confusion_matrix預設列是真值、欄是預測；類別順序要固定。accuracy=(TP+TN)/N對稀有事件可能被大量TN掩蓋。\n\n$$\n\\mathrm{Precision}=\\frac{TP}{TP+FP},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Recall}=\\frac{TP}{TP+FN},\\quad\nF_1=\\frac{2TP}{2TP+FP+FN}\n$$\n\n分母零時採明確政策，課程precision／recall記0；AUC在只有一類時沒有通常定義，core回None，避免造出一個看似有效分數。\n\n## 手算範例\n\ny=[1,1,0,0]，scores=[.9,.4,.8,.1]，threshold=.5，TP=FP=FN=TN=1，precision=recall=F1=.5。threshold=.85只接受第一筆，precision=1、recall=.5。這些是固定分數的決策變化，不是重新訓練。\n\n## ROC與PR\n\nROC看TPR與FPR的門檻軌跡，AUC衡量正負排序關係；PR看precision與recall，稀有正例時更直接反映誤報負擔。average precision依recall增量加權precision，與任意梯形插值PR面積不完全相同。本課以AP明確命名，不把所有指標都叫AUC。\n\n## 機率品質是另一件事\n\n排序完全相同的兩組分數可有相同ROC AUC，但一組過度自信，log loss／Brier很差。分類閾值指標、排序指標與校準要分別看。macro/micro/weighted也要隨多類與多標籤情境說明，不能只比較字串名稱。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n1000筆只有10正例，全猜負accuracy=.99但recall=0。解答：以支持數、PR與決策成本判斷，別把.99當成功。預測分數整體做嚴格單調轉換，排序指標可維持，固定.5門檻與機率品質卻可能不同。真實threshold在validation選，第33章會實作。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/15_classification_metrics.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Hand-verifiable binary metrics and thresholds.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom course_core import binary_metrics\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        y=np.array([1,1,0,0])\n        scores=np.array([.9,.4,.8,.1])\n        result={'at_0_5':binary_metrics(y,scores,.5),'at_0_85':binary_metrics(y,scores,.85),\n                'note':'fixed handmade scores, not model accuracy'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Classification metrics](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#classification-metrics)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "rocpr", "name": "分類評估：混淆矩陣、ROC、PR與不平衡", "html": "分類評估：混淆矩陣、ROC、PR與不平衡", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "先把四種情況列出來", "html": "先把四種情況列出來", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "手算範例", "html": "手算範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "rocpr_1", "name": "ROC與PR", "html": "ROC與PR", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "機率品質是另一件事", "html": "機率品質是另一件事", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "27-regression-metrics", "group": "evaluation", "title": "回歸評估：MAE、RMSE、R²與殘差單位", "summary": "理解指標的分母、尺度與負分數，避免只報一個數字。", "tags": ["MAE", "RMSE", "R2", "residual", "regression metrics"], "example": "16_regression_metrics.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"maermser2\">回歸評估：MAE、RMSE、R²與殘差單位</h1>\n<p>理解指標的分母、尺度與負分數，避免只報一個數字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">誤差必須有單位</h2>\n<p>若y是分鐘，MAE與RMSE也以分鐘解讀；MSE單位是分鐘平方。不同target尺度的MSE不能直接比較。多目標回歸需說明每個輸出的權重與單位，不能隨便平均金額與比例而假裝同一代價。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nMAE=\\frac1N\\sum_i|y_i-\\hat y_i|,\\qquad\nRMSE=\\sqrt{\\frac1N\\sum_i(y_i-\\hat y_i)^2}\n$$</div>\n<p>RMSE對大誤差更敏感；MAE也不是對所有離群資料無影響，只是懲罰增長方式不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"r2\">R²可以是負數</h2>\n<p>R²以平方誤差相對常數均值基準描述解釋程度。模型比該評估集的均值預測還差時可以負，不需要強行clip到0。y完全常數時有特殊邊界，API可能依force_finite政策處理，報告需知道這不是一般變異情境。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nR^2=1-\\frac{\\sum_i(y_i-\\hat y_i)^2}{\\sum_i(y_i-\\bar y)^2}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"api\">手算與目前API</h2>\n<p>y=[1,2,3]、pred=[1,2,5]，MAE=2/3、MSE=4/3、RMSE=sqrt(4/3)，R²=1-4/2=-1。本課使用root_mean_squared_error，不以舊版MSE squared=False介面作主線。指標函式先驗證同shape，避免[N,1]與[N]的隱含廣播。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">殘差分布與百分比陷阱</h2>\n<p>看誤差分位數、最大錯誤、signed bias與子群，不只全體平均。MAPE遇到y接近0會極大，且相對誤差對高低值權重不同；log target需檢查零／負值與轉回原單位後偏差。挑選指標要依任務，不因漂亮百分比就使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>把目標從公尺改公分，MAE與RMSE乘100，MSE乘10000，R²若預測同步換單位則不變。解答：模型改善必須在同單位與同資料比較。再以DummyRegressor的train mean作真正可部署基準，不能偷用test mean生成你的正式預測。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/16_regression_metrics.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;MAE, RMSE and negative R2 for a poor predictor.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">regression_metrics</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">5.</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;worked_example&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">regression_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;poor_constant&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">regression_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">full</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">10.</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;RMSE uses target units; R2 may be negative&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#regression-metrics\">Regression metrics</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 回歸評估：MAE、RMSE、R²與殘差單位\n\n理解指標的分母、尺度與負分數，避免只報一個數字。\n\n## 誤差必須有單位\n\n若y是分鐘，MAE與RMSE也以分鐘解讀；MSE單位是分鐘平方。不同target尺度的MSE不能直接比較。多目標回歸需說明每個輸出的權重與單位，不能隨便平均金額與比例而假裝同一代價。\n\n$$\nMAE=\\frac1N\\sum_i|y_i-\\hat y_i|,\\qquad\nRMSE=\\sqrt{\\frac1N\\sum_i(y_i-\\hat y_i)^2}\n$$\n\nRMSE對大誤差更敏感；MAE也不是對所有離群資料無影響，只是懲罰增長方式不同。\n\n## R²可以是負數\n\nR²以平方誤差相對常數均值基準描述解釋程度。模型比該評估集的均值預測還差時可以負，不需要強行clip到0。y完全常數時有特殊邊界，API可能依force_finite政策處理，報告需知道這不是一般變異情境。\n\n$$\nR^2=1-\\frac{\\sum_i(y_i-\\hat y_i)^2}{\\sum_i(y_i-\\bar y)^2}\n$$\n\n## 手算與目前API\n\ny=[1,2,3]、pred=[1,2,5]，MAE=2/3、MSE=4/3、RMSE=sqrt(4/3)，R²=1-4/2=-1。本課使用root_mean_squared_error，不以舊版MSE squared=False介面作主線。指標函式先驗證同shape，避免[N,1]與[N]的隱含廣播。\n\n## 殘差分布與百分比陷阱\n\n看誤差分位數、最大錯誤、signed bias與子群，不只全體平均。MAPE遇到y接近0會極大，且相對誤差對高低值權重不同；log target需檢查零／負值與轉回原單位後偏差。挑選指標要依任務，不因漂亮百分比就使用。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n把目標從公尺改公分，MAE與RMSE乘100，MSE乘10000，R²若預測同步換單位則不變。解答：模型改善必須在同單位與同資料比較。再以DummyRegressor的train mean作真正可部署基準，不能偷用test mean生成你的正式預測。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/16_regression_metrics.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"MAE, RMSE and negative R2 for a poor predictor.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom course_core import regression_metrics\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        y=np.array([1.,2.,3.])\n        prediction=np.array([1.,2.,5.])\n        result={'worked_example':regression_metrics(y,prediction),\n                'poor_constant':regression_metrics(y,np.full(3,10.)),\n                'note':'RMSE uses target units; R2 may be negative'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Regression metrics](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#regression-metrics)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "maermser2", "name": "回歸評估：MAE、RMSE、R²與殘差單位", "html": "回歸評估：MAE、RMSE、R²與殘差單位", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "誤差必須有單位", "html": "誤差必須有單位", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "r2", "name": "R²可以是負數", "html": "R²可以是負數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "api", "name": "手算與目前API", "html": "手算與目前API", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "殘差分布與百分比陷阱", "html": "殘差分布與百分比陷阱", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "28-cross-validation", "group": "evaluation", "title": "交叉驗證：每折重學、分數變異與scoring方向", "summary": "知道CV估計什麼，並追蹤每一折的前處理與模型。", "tags": ["cross_validate", "KFold", "StratifiedKFold", "scoring"], "example": "17_cross_validation.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"scoring\">交叉驗證：每折重學、分數變異與scoring方向</h1>\n<p>知道CV估計什麼，並追蹤每一折的前處理與模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">一折是一個完整實驗</h2>\n<p>K折將train資料分K份，每次留一份驗證，其餘fit整個pipeline。不是先fit一次模型再輪流predict同一份train；也不是用K份資料依次partial_fit。每折應有獨立的前處理統計與模型參數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"splitter\">選擇與問題一致的splitter</h2>\n<p>分類常用StratifiedKFold，回歸常用KFold，group／time依第7章選。分層不能替代獨立性；K越大train佔比越高，fit成本也增加。少數類不夠每折時需調整K與資料策略，不把警告遮掉後照報平均。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">平均與變異怎麼讀</h2>\n<p>報每折score與mean/std，幫助看切分敏感度。fold的train集合大量重疊，因此fold score不是完全獨立樣本，不能隨意用std/sqrt(K)做嚴格信賴區間。CV平均與最後用全部train重fit的模型，也不是完全同一個訓練大小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sklearn-scoring\">sklearn scoring方向</h2>\n<p>選模介面通常越大越好，誤差型scoring用neg_mean_absolute_error等負號。若mean score=-5，MAE為5；比較-3優於-5。不要把負號去掉後仍拿max挑最大誤差。cross_validate輸出test_score裡的test，通常指此折驗證，不自動代表你另外保留的final test。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">本章驗證</h2>\n<p>範例return_estimator=True，輸出每fold StandardScaler.mean_。測試逐一比對該fold train均值，確保pipeline真的在折內fit。這比只檢查程式有寫Pipeline更具體。平行n_jobs先1，避免小例資源競爭與難以追蹤錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>先全資料PCA再CV是否可稱完全隔離？答案：PCA看過驗證分布，應放Pipeline。CV平均.8與std.1代表什麼？表示這組折的分數波動大，需要查資料、切分與稀有類，但不直接保證未來有95%落某區間。重複試驗後最佳CV也會樂觀，下一章處理搜尋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/17_cross_validation.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Leakage-safe preprocessing is fitted inside each fold.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.model_selection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">cross_validate</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l1_ratio</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">report</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">cross_validate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">cv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">shuffle</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">scoring</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;ap&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;average_precision&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;accuracy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;accuracy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"n\">return_estimator</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_jobs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;fold_ap&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">report</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test_ap&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;fold_accuracy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">report</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test_accuracy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;fold_specific_scaler_means&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean_</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">m</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">report</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;estimator&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]],</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;fold test scores mean validation folds, not a separately reserved final test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/cross_validation.html\">Cross-validation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#scoring-parameter\">Scoring</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 交叉驗證：每折重學、分數變異與scoring方向\n\n知道CV估計什麼，並追蹤每一折的前處理與模型。\n\n## 一折是一個完整實驗\n\nK折將train資料分K份，每次留一份驗證，其餘fit整個pipeline。不是先fit一次模型再輪流predict同一份train；也不是用K份資料依次partial_fit。每折應有獨立的前處理統計與模型參數。\n\n## 選擇與問題一致的splitter\n\n分類常用StratifiedKFold，回歸常用KFold，group／time依第7章選。分層不能替代獨立性；K越大train佔比越高，fit成本也增加。少數類不夠每折時需調整K與資料策略，不把警告遮掉後照報平均。\n\n## 平均與變異怎麼讀\n\n報每折score與mean/std，幫助看切分敏感度。fold的train集合大量重疊，因此fold score不是完全獨立樣本，不能隨意用std/sqrt(K)做嚴格信賴區間。CV平均與最後用全部train重fit的模型，也不是完全同一個訓練大小。\n\n## sklearn scoring方向\n\n選模介面通常越大越好，誤差型scoring用neg_mean_absolute_error等負號。若mean score=-5，MAE為5；比較-3優於-5。不要把負號去掉後仍拿max挑最大誤差。cross_validate輸出test_score裡的test，通常指此折驗證，不自動代表你另外保留的final test。\n\n## 本章驗證\n\n範例return_estimator=True，輸出每fold StandardScaler.mean_。測試逐一比對該fold train均值，確保pipeline真的在折內fit。這比只檢查程式有寫Pipeline更具體。平行n_jobs先1，避免小例資源競爭與難以追蹤錯誤。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n先全資料PCA再CV是否可稱完全隔離？答案：PCA看過驗證分布，應放Pipeline。CV平均.8與std.1代表什麼？表示這組折的分數波動大，需要查資料、切分與稀有類，但不直接保證未來有95%落某區間。重複試驗後最佳CV也會樂觀，下一章處理搜尋。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/17_cross_validation.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Leakage-safe preprocessing is fitted inside each fold.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import StratifiedKFold,cross_validate\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom course_core import binary_data\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        model=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),LogisticRegression(l1_ratio=0,max_iter=1000))\n        report=cross_validate(model,x,y,cv=StratifiedKFold(3,shuffle=True,random_state=7),\n            scoring={'ap':'average_precision','accuracy':'accuracy'},return_estimator=True,n_jobs=1)\n        result={'fold_ap':report['test_ap'],'fold_accuracy':report['test_accuracy'],\n                'fold_specific_scaler_means':[m[0].mean_ for m in report['estimator']],\n                'note':'fold test scores mean validation folds, not a separately reserved final test'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Cross-validation](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/cross_validation.html)\n- [Scoring](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#scoring-parameter)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "scoring", "name": "交叉驗證：每折重學、分數變異與scoring方向", "html": "交叉驗證：每折重學、分數變異與scoring方向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "一折是一個完整實驗", "html": "一折是一個完整實驗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "splitter", "name": "選擇與問題一致的splitter", "html": "選擇與問題一致的splitter", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "平均與變異怎麼讀", "html": "平均與變異怎麼讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "sklearn-scoring", "name": "sklearn scoring方向", "html": "sklearn scoring方向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "本章驗證", "html": "本章驗證", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "29-search", "group": "evaluation", "title": "超參數搜尋：Grid、Random與完整Pipeline", "summary": "以明確預算搜尋合理空間，保存候選結果而非只看best_score。", "tags": ["GridSearchCV", "RandomizedSearchCV", "hyperparameter", "CV"], "example": "18_search.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"gridrandompipeline\">超參數搜尋：Grid、Random與完整Pipeline</h1>\n<p>以明確預算搜尋合理空間，保存候選結果而非只看best_score。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">參數與超參數</h2>\n<p>fit學到的coef／tree splits是參數；C、alpha、depth、k等事先設定是超參數。選擇它們也在從資料學習，因此必須使用validation／train CV，最後以未參與選擇的資料評估。把搜尋叫自動化，不會消除選擇偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">搜尋空間與尺度</h2>\n<p>C或alpha跨數量級時，選對數尺度比等差0到100常更合理。depth、leaf與模型類別有條件關係，不是所有組合都有效。Grid列出全部笛卡兒積；RandomizedSearch在固定次數下抽樣，有機會以較低成本探索較大空間。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pipeline\">Pipeline參數名稱</h2>\n<p>命名步驟model時用model__C；make_pipeline會自動用logisticregression等名稱。search會clone候選，每折fit整條pipeline，最佳者通常再用搜尋傳入的全部train重fit。它不是保留其中一個fold模型直接作最終模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">成本與輸出</h2>\n<p>候選數M、K折，大約M×K次fit，加上refit；嵌套搜尋再乘外折。閱讀cv_results_的每折score、mean/std、fit時間與參數，不只best_params。對於失敗候選，開發時error_score='raise'可直接定位，正式搜尋則需記錄失敗政策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">保留資料的角色</h2>\n<p>本章只在train索引搜C=[.01,.1,1,10]，test_used=False。下一步可以用獨立val調threshold；若繼續用val挑更多模型，也要記錄它參與的決策。若要評估整套搜尋而沒有充足holdout，使用nested CV。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>3個depth×4個leaf×5個樹數，5折約300次fit，加refit約301。解答：先估預算並縮小有意義空間，別等一整天才發現大多候選無效。若最佳參數落搜尋邊界，可有理由擴充train CV，但不能根據test表現擴範圍後仍報原test未碰過。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/18_search.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;GridSearchCV searches pipeline parameters using training folds only.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.model_selection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">GridSearchCV</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">split_indices</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">split_indices</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;train&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">pipeline</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l1_ratio</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">search</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">GridSearchCV</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;logisticregression__C&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"mf\">.01</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">10.</span><span class=\"p\">]},</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">cv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">shuffle</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">scoring</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;average_precision&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_jobs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;best_parameters&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">search</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">best_params_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;best_training_cv_score&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">search</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">best_score_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;candidates&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">search</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cv_results_</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;params&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test_used&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/grid_search.html\">Grid與Random search</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 超參數搜尋：Grid、Random與完整Pipeline\n\n以明確預算搜尋合理空間，保存候選結果而非只看best_score。\n\n## 參數與超參數\n\nfit學到的coef／tree splits是參數；C、alpha、depth、k等事先設定是超參數。選擇它們也在從資料學習，因此必須使用validation／train CV，最後以未參與選擇的資料評估。把搜尋叫自動化，不會消除選擇偏差。\n\n## 搜尋空間與尺度\n\nC或alpha跨數量級時，選對數尺度比等差0到100常更合理。depth、leaf與模型類別有條件關係，不是所有組合都有效。Grid列出全部笛卡兒積；RandomizedSearch在固定次數下抽樣，有機會以較低成本探索較大空間。\n\n## Pipeline參數名稱\n\n命名步驟model時用model__C；make_pipeline會自動用logisticregression等名稱。search會clone候選，每折fit整條pipeline，最佳者通常再用搜尋傳入的全部train重fit。它不是保留其中一個fold模型直接作最終模型。\n\n## 成本與輸出\n\n候選數M、K折，大約M×K次fit，加上refit；嵌套搜尋再乘外折。閱讀cv_results_的每折score、mean/std、fit時間與參數，不只best_params。對於失敗候選，開發時error_score='raise'可直接定位，正式搜尋則需記錄失敗政策。\n\n## 保留資料的角色\n\n本章只在train索引搜C=[.01,.1,1,10]，test_used=False。下一步可以用獨立val調threshold；若繼續用val挑更多模型，也要記錄它參與的決策。若要評估整套搜尋而沒有充足holdout，使用nested CV。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n3個depth×4個leaf×5個樹數，5折約300次fit，加refit約301。解答：先估預算並縮小有意義空間，別等一整天才發現大多候選無效。若最佳參數落搜尋邊界，可有理由擴充train CV，但不能根據test表現擴範圍後仍報原test未碰過。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/18_search.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"GridSearchCV searches pipeline parameters using training folds only.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import GridSearchCV,StratifiedKFold\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom course_core import binary_data,split_indices\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        train=split_indices(y)['train']\n        pipeline=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),LogisticRegression(l1_ratio=0,max_iter=1000))\n        search=GridSearchCV(pipeline,{'logisticregression__C':[.01,.1,1.,10.]},\n            cv=StratifiedKFold(3,shuffle=True,random_state=7),scoring='average_precision',n_jobs=1).fit(x[train],y[train])\n        result={'best_parameters':search.best_params_,'best_training_cv_score':search.best_score_,\n                'candidates':len(search.cv_results_['params']),'test_used':False}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Grid與Random search](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/grid_search.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "gridrandompipeline", "name": "超參數搜尋：Grid、Random與完整Pipeline", "html": "超參數搜尋：Grid、Random與完整Pipeline", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "參數與超參數", "html": "參數與超參數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "搜尋空間與尺度", "html": "搜尋空間與尺度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "pipeline", "name": "Pipeline參數名稱", "html": "Pipeline參數名稱", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "成本與輸出", "html": "成本與輸出", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "保留資料的角色", "html": "保留資料的角色", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "30-nested-cv", "group": "evaluation", "title": "Nested CV：評估整個選模程序", "summary": "外層保留評估，內層搜尋，避免把最佳內層分數當最終成績。", "tags": ["nested CV", "selection bias", "outer fold", "inner fold"], "example": "19_nested_cv.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"nested-cv\">Nested CV：評估整個選模程序</h1>\n<p>外層保留評估，內層搜尋，避免把最佳內層分數當最終成績。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">最佳分數有挑選偏差</h2>\n<p>試很多候選後最高的CV分數，除了模型能力也包含剛好適合這組fold的運氣。若直接把best_score_當未來性能，通常樂觀。Nested CV把「選超參數」當作一個完整程序，對每個外層train重新執行內層搜尋。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">資料如何流動</h2>\n<p>外折留出一部分暫時完全不看；內層只用外train的資料fit前處理、搜尋與refit最佳模型；最後用外test評估這一次選擇。各外折可能選不同C，這是程序對資料變化的反應，不是nested CV失敗。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"text\"><pre><span></span><code>外層 fold 1\n  外 train → 內層 CV 搜尋 → 以外 train refit\n  外 test  → 只評估，不參與搜尋\n外層 fold 2、3 重複完整程序\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_3\">估計的是什麼</h2>\n<p>外層score描述指定搜尋空間、資料策略與訓練預算的選模程序。它不是你事後另外挑某個參數的單一模型精確成績。最後交付可在全部可用train上重做既定搜尋，但不能用外層結果反覆改策略而不承認額外選擇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">成本與依賴</h2>\n<p>本章2個C、內3折、外3折，大約3×(2×3+1)=21次fit。group／time資料的內外split都需符合獨立性；只改外層而內層仍隨機，也可能在選擇中洩漏。若資源有限且資料充足，保留train/val/test亦是合理起點。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>外層某折選C=.1，另一折C=1，最後應平均C嗎？答案：不是直接平均，先按事先規定的程序在最終train重新搜尋。CV分數用於估計程序，超參數不是可以任意平均的模型參數。若你只想比較兩個固定模型，配對外層fold可提供較一致的比較條件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/19_nested_cv.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Outer folds evaluate the full inner hyperparameter search procedure.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.model_selection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">GridSearchCV</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">cross_val_score</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">180</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">pipeline</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l1_ratio</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">search</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">GridSearchCV</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">,{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;logisticregression__C&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">]},</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">cv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">shuffle</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">11</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">scoring</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;average_precision&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_jobs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">outer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">cross_val_score</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">search</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">cv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">shuffle</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">13</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                               <span class=\"n\">scoring</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;average_precision&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_jobs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;outer_ap&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">outer</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;mean_outer_ap&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">outer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;fits_roughly&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;outer scores evaluate selection; not the optimistic best inner score&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/auto_examples/model_selection/plot_nested_cross_validation_iris.html\">Nested CV官方例子</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/cross_validation.html\">模型選擇</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Nested CV：評估整個選模程序\n\n外層保留評估，內層搜尋，避免把最佳內層分數當最終成績。\n\n## 最佳分數有挑選偏差\n\n試很多候選後最高的CV分數，除了模型能力也包含剛好適合這組fold的運氣。若直接把best_score_當未來性能，通常樂觀。Nested CV把「選超參數」當作一個完整程序，對每個外層train重新執行內層搜尋。\n\n## 資料如何流動\n\n外折留出一部分暫時完全不看；內層只用外train的資料fit前處理、搜尋與refit最佳模型；最後用外test評估這一次選擇。各外折可能選不同C，這是程序對資料變化的反應，不是nested CV失敗。\n\n```text\n外層 fold 1\n  外 train → 內層 CV 搜尋 → 以外 train refit\n  外 test  → 只評估，不參與搜尋\n外層 fold 2、3 重複完整程序\n```\n\n## 估計的是什麼\n\n外層score描述指定搜尋空間、資料策略與訓練預算的選模程序。它不是你事後另外挑某個參數的單一模型精確成績。最後交付可在全部可用train上重做既定搜尋，但不能用外層結果反覆改策略而不承認額外選擇。\n\n## 成本與依賴\n\n本章2個C、內3折、外3折，大約3×(2×3+1)=21次fit。group／time資料的內外split都需符合獨立性；只改外層而內層仍隨機，也可能在選擇中洩漏。若資源有限且資料充足，保留train/val/test亦是合理起點。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n外層某折選C=.1，另一折C=1，最後應平均C嗎？答案：不是直接平均，先按事先規定的程序在最終train重新搜尋。CV分數用於估計程序，超參數不是可以任意平均的模型參數。若你只想比較兩個固定模型，配對外層fold可提供較一致的比較條件。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/19_nested_cv.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Outer folds evaluate the full inner hyperparameter search procedure.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import GridSearchCV,StratifiedKFold,cross_val_score\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom course_core import binary_data\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data(n=180)\n        pipeline=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),LogisticRegression(l1_ratio=0,max_iter=1000))\n        search=GridSearchCV(pipeline,{'logisticregression__C':[.1,1.]},\n            cv=StratifiedKFold(3,shuffle=True,random_state=11),scoring='average_precision',n_jobs=1)\n        outer=cross_val_score(search,x,y,cv=StratifiedKFold(3,shuffle=True,random_state=13),\n                               scoring='average_precision',n_jobs=1)\n        result={'outer_ap':outer,'mean_outer_ap':outer.mean(),'fits_roughly':3*(2*3+1),\n                'note':'outer scores evaluate selection; not the optimistic best inner score'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Nested CV官方例子](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/auto_examples/model_selection/plot_nested_cross_validation_iris.html)\n- [模型選擇](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/cross_validation.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "nested-cv", "name": "Nested CV：評估整個選模程序", "html": "Nested CV：評估整個選模程序", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "最佳分數有挑選偏差", "html": "最佳分數有挑選偏差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "資料如何流動", "html": "資料如何流動", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "估計的是什麼", "html": "估計的是什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "成本與依賴", "html": "成本與依賴", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "31-imbalance", "group": "reliability", "title": "不平衡學習：class weight、抽樣與成本", "summary": "在稀有事件下保留真實分布，分清訓練調整與決策調整。", "tags": ["imbalance", "class_weight", "resampling", "balanced accuracy"], "example": "20_imbalance.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"class-weight\">不平衡學習：class weight、抽樣與成本</h1>\n<p>在稀有事件下保留真實分布，分清訓練調整與決策調整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">多數類很容易掩蓋問題</h2>\n<p>1%正例的資料全猜負就99%accuracy。先報support、precision/recall、AP與實際處理成本，再決定是否需改訓練。小正例數使split與估計變異很大，分層能幫助但不會增加資訊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">類別權重</h2>\n<p>class_weight讓某類錯誤在訓練loss更重。balanced常依類別頻率反比設定，但最適權重不必剛好反比，還要看成本與模型。改權重會改fit目標與分數分布，不只是切換最後threshold；機率是否仍代表部署發生率需校準驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">抽樣策略與邊界</h2>\n<p>undersampling可減少多數類資料，可能丟訊號；oversampling重複或生成少數樣本，不能憑空創造真正新獨立事件。若在切分前重抽樣，重複／相似樣本可跨train/val，形成洩漏。應只在每fold train進行，保留評估分布。外部抽樣套件需另行相容性驗證，本課不默默加依賴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">決策成本</h2>\n<p>同一固定模型可降低threshold提高接受範圍，改變FP/FN；它不需要重新fit。若成本FN=5、FP=1，可在validation評估5FN+FP，或在合適校準與假設下推導理論閾值；實際容量與資料偏移可能還要限制處理量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">執行本章實驗</h2>\n<p>生成90/10合成資料，固定class_weight='balanced'，對同一holdout展示threshold .5與.25的指標。這些事先指定門檻是示範，不能看過holdout後反覆選最好。完整專題會以獨立val明確選成本門檻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>提高recall後FP從10變100是否一定值得？解答：看FN減少多少、單筆成本與處理能力。若training被重抽成50/50、部署仍1%正例，predict_proba可能需重新校準或調整先驗假設；不能直接稱.8就是現實80%發生率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/20_imbalance.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Class weights and thresholds address different decisions.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.datasets</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_classification</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_classification</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_samples</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">400</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_features</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_informative</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_redundant</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                                <span class=\"n\">weights</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">.9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">class_weight</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;balanced&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">l1_ratio</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">scores</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test_prevalence&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">float</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;threshold_0_5&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">scores</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;fixed_lower_threshold&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">scores</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.25</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;these settings are demonstrations; tune decisions on validation, not this holdout&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_8\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#logistic-regression\">類別權重與Logistic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/classification_threshold.html\">Threshold tuning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#classification-metrics\">分類指標</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 不平衡學習：class weight、抽樣與成本\n\n在稀有事件下保留真實分布，分清訓練調整與決策調整。\n\n## 多數類很容易掩蓋問題\n\n1%正例的資料全猜負就99%accuracy。先報support、precision/recall、AP與實際處理成本，再決定是否需改訓練。小正例數使split與估計變異很大，分層能幫助但不會增加資訊。\n\n## 類別權重\n\nclass_weight讓某類錯誤在訓練loss更重。balanced常依類別頻率反比設定，但最適權重不必剛好反比，還要看成本與模型。改權重會改fit目標與分數分布，不只是切換最後threshold；機率是否仍代表部署發生率需校準驗證。\n\n## 抽樣策略與邊界\n\nundersampling可減少多數類資料，可能丟訊號；oversampling重複或生成少數樣本，不能憑空創造真正新獨立事件。若在切分前重抽樣，重複／相似樣本可跨train/val，形成洩漏。應只在每fold train進行，保留評估分布。外部抽樣套件需另行相容性驗證，本課不默默加依賴。\n\n## 決策成本\n\n同一固定模型可降低threshold提高接受範圍，改變FP/FN；它不需要重新fit。若成本FN=5、FP=1，可在validation評估5FN+FP，或在合適校準與假設下推導理論閾值；實際容量與資料偏移可能還要限制處理量。\n\n## 執行本章實驗\n\n生成90/10合成資料，固定class_weight='balanced'，對同一holdout展示threshold .5與.25的指標。這些事先指定門檻是示範，不能看過holdout後反覆選最好。完整專題會以獨立val明確選成本門檻。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n提高recall後FP從10變100是否一定值得？解答：看FN減少多少、單筆成本與處理能力。若training被重抽成50/50、部署仍1%正例，predict_proba可能需重新校準或調整先驗假設；不能直接稱.8就是現實80%發生率。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/20_imbalance.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Class weights and thresholds address different decisions.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_classification\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom course_core import holdout,probability,binary_metrics\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=make_classification(n_samples=400,n_features=6,n_informative=4,n_redundant=0,\n                                weights=[.9,.1],random_state=7)\n        a,b,c,d=holdout(x,y)\n        model=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),LogisticRegression(class_weight='balanced',l1_ratio=0,max_iter=1000)).fit(a,c)\n        scores=probability(model,b)\n        result={'test_prevalence':float(d.mean()),'threshold_0_5':binary_metrics(d,scores,.5),\n                'fixed_lower_threshold':binary_metrics(d,scores,.25),\n                'note':'these settings are demonstrations; tune decisions on validation, not this holdout'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [類別權重與Logistic](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#logistic-regression)\n- [Threshold tuning](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/classification_threshold.html)\n- [分類指標](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#classification-metrics)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "class-weight", "name": "不平衡學習：class weight、抽樣與成本", "html": "不平衡學習：class weight、抽樣與成本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "多數類很容易掩蓋問題", "html": "多數類很容易掩蓋問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "類別權重", "html": "類別權重", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "抽樣策略與邊界", "html": "抽樣策略與邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "決策成本", "html": "決策成本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "執行本章實驗", "html": "執行本章實驗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "32-calibration", "group": "reliability", "title": "機率校準：可靠度圖、Brier與Sigmoid／Isotonic", "summary": "評估模型的信心是否有對應頻率，避免把排序能力當機率品質。", "tags": ["calibration", "CalibratedClassifierCV", "Brier", "isotonic"], "example": "21_calibration.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"briersigmoidisotonic\">機率校準：可靠度圖、Brier與Sigmoid／Isotonic</h1>\n<p>評估模型的信心是否有對應頻率，避免把排序能力當機率品質。</p>\n<h2 id=\"08\">0.8應該代表什麼</h2>\n<p>一批分數接近.8的樣本，若長期約80%為正，這是校準直覺。它與分類accuracy不同：每筆都給.99與.51可能分類一樣，confidence品質不同。只有單筆事件結果，無法判斷該筆.8估計是否正確，需要跨樣本與資料分布檢查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">可靠度分箱與評分</h2>\n<p>reliability diagram把分數分箱，對照平均預測與實際正例率，並列每箱筆數。箱數太多在小資料會很不穩；空箱也要處理。Brier是機率平方誤差，Log loss重罰自信錯誤；它們受多種品質影響，不能把單一分數改善全歸因於校準。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\mathrm{Brier}=\\frac1N\\sum_i(p_i-y_i)^2\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">校準器也會學習</h2>\n<p>Sigmoid學平滑映射，Isotonic學單調分段映射，需要足夠資料。校準若用原模型已fit同樣資料的分數，可能樂觀。CalibratedClassifierCV用內部CV，讓校準看到未被相應base estimator訓練過的分數；前處理也要包在base Pipeline內。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">本章真實執行</h2>\n<p>以StandardScaler+LinearSVC當base，method='sigmoid'、cv=3，實際fit校準ensemble，再在獨立holdout報Brier／log loss等。它不是mock，也不保證此資料上每個指標都進步。SVC原decision score可排序，經校準才進入明確機率輸出介面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fit\">已fit模型與版本遷移</h2>\n<p>若使用已fit模型校準，要依目前API的FrozenEstimator等方式與獨立校準資料處理；不要照搬舊cv='prefit'模式並餵同一train。完整流程要預留校準與選threshold的資訊使用界線，不能把同一test反覆當校準、選模與驗收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>y=[1,0]、p=[.8,.3]，Brier=(.04+.09)/2=.065。若嚴格單調映射保留排名，AUC可能不變但Brier變。解答：排序與校準是不同維度。資料分布與正例比例改變後重新檢查，不因一次可靠度圖好看就永遠沿用相同信心解讀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/21_calibration.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Sigmoid calibration uses out-of-fold base-estimator scores.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.calibration</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">CalibratedClassifierCV</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.svm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LinearSVC</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">base</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">LinearSVC</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">CalibratedClassifierCV</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">base</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">method</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;sigmoid&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">cv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;holdout&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">binary_metrics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">probability</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;calibrated_members&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">calibrated_classifiers_</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;calibration quality must be evaluated; not guaranteed to improve every dataset&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/calibration.html\">Probability calibration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.calibration.CalibratedClassifierCV.html\">CalibratedClassifierCV</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 機率校準：可靠度圖、Brier與Sigmoid／Isotonic\n\n評估模型的信心是否有對應頻率，避免把排序能力當機率品質。\n\n## 0.8應該代表什麼\n\n一批分數接近.8的樣本，若長期約80%為正，這是校準直覺。它與分類accuracy不同：每筆都給.99與.51可能分類一樣，confidence品質不同。只有單筆事件結果，無法判斷該筆.8估計是否正確，需要跨樣本與資料分布檢查。\n\n## 可靠度分箱與評分\n\nreliability diagram把分數分箱，對照平均預測與實際正例率，並列每箱筆數。箱數太多在小資料會很不穩；空箱也要處理。Brier是機率平方誤差，Log loss重罰自信錯誤；它們受多種品質影響，不能把單一分數改善全歸因於校準。\n\n$$\n\\mathrm{Brier}=\\frac1N\\sum_i(p_i-y_i)^2\n$$\n\n## 校準器也會學習\n\nSigmoid學平滑映射，Isotonic學單調分段映射，需要足夠資料。校準若用原模型已fit同樣資料的分數，可能樂觀。CalibratedClassifierCV用內部CV，讓校準看到未被相應base estimator訓練過的分數；前處理也要包在base Pipeline內。\n\n## 本章真實執行\n\n以StandardScaler+LinearSVC當base，method='sigmoid'、cv=3，實際fit校準ensemble，再在獨立holdout報Brier／log loss等。它不是mock，也不保證此資料上每個指標都進步。SVC原decision score可排序，經校準才進入明確機率輸出介面。\n\n## 已fit模型與版本遷移\n\n若使用已fit模型校準，要依目前API的FrozenEstimator等方式與獨立校準資料處理；不要照搬舊cv='prefit'模式並餵同一train。完整流程要預留校準與選threshold的資訊使用界線，不能把同一test反覆當校準、選模與驗收。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\ny=[1,0]、p=[.8,.3]，Brier=(.04+.09)/2=.065。若嚴格單調映射保留排名，AUC可能不變但Brier變。解答：排序與校準是不同維度。資料分布與正例比例改變後重新檢查，不因一次可靠度圖好看就永遠沿用相同信心解讀。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/21_calibration.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Sigmoid calibration uses out-of-fold base-estimator scores.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.calibration import CalibratedClassifierCV\nfrom sklearn.svm import LinearSVC\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom course_core import binary_data,holdout,probability,binary_metrics\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        a,b,c,d=holdout(x,y)\n        base=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),LinearSVC(C=.5,random_state=7))\n        model=CalibratedClassifierCV(base,method='sigmoid',cv=3).fit(a,c)\n        result={'holdout':binary_metrics(d,probability(model,b)),\n                'calibrated_members':len(model.calibrated_classifiers_),\n                'note':'calibration quality must be evaluated; not guaranteed to improve every dataset'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Probability calibration](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/calibration.html)\n- [CalibratedClassifierCV](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.calibration.CalibratedClassifierCV.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "briersigmoidisotonic", "name": "機率校準：可靠度圖、Brier與Sigmoid／Isotonic", "html": "機率校準：可靠度圖、Brier與Sigmoid／Isotonic", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "08", "name": "0.8應該代表什麼", "html": "0.8應該代表什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "可靠度分箱與評分", "html": "可靠度分箱與評分", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "校準器也會學習", "html": "校準器也會學習", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "本章真實執行", "html": "本章真實執行", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "fit", "name": "已fit模型與版本遷移", "html": "已fit模型與版本遷移", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "33-thresholds", "group": "reliability", "title": "決策門檻：成本、容量與TunedThresholdClassifierCV", "summary": "讓接受／拒絕規則在適當資料上選擇，並隨模型一起保存。", "tags": ["threshold", "TunedThresholdClassifierCV", "cost", "FP", "FN"], "example": "22_threshold.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"tunedthresholdclassifiercv\">決策門檻：成本、容量與TunedThresholdClassifierCV</h1>\n<p>讓接受／拒絕規則在適當資料上選擇，並隨模型一起保存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">預測機率不等於最後行動</h2>\n<p>模型給P(Y=1|x)，決策規則才決定是否處理。threshold .5是一個常見預設，不代表任何成本、稀有比例或容量下都最佳。把門檻當超參數：可以在獨立val或內部CV選，不能直接看最終test挑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">手算成本曲線</h2>\n<p>y=[1,1,0,0]、scores=[.9,.4,.8,.1]。FN成本5、FP成本1：threshold .5時FN1+FP1，成本6；threshold .4時TP2、FP1、FN0，成本1。因此更低threshold在這份validation更合適。相同成本時本課選較低門檻作固定tie-break，並明確記錄。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nC(t)=c_{FN}\\,FN(t)+c_{FP}\\,FP(t)\n$$</div>\n<p>若機率正確校準、每筆成本固定且只有兩個錯誤成本，理論閾值為c_FP/(c_FP+c_FN)；資料有限、校準有誤或有容量約束時，需再驗證，不機械套公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"api\">目前API的實作</h2>\n<p>第22例真的fit TunedThresholdClassifierCV，用train內3折選balanced_accuracy的threshold，之後一次holdout評估。完整專題則手寫成本候選搜尋，以獨立80筆val選擇，兩種方式都清楚標示資料角色。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">邊界與部署</h2>\n<p>threshold相等時本課採score&gt;=threshold。候選包括0、實際分數與略大於1的值，以涵蓋全接受／全拒絕；不把極端決策漏掉。門檻要和正例class、機率欄位、模型版本一起保存。重訓後分數分布改變，舊threshold不必繼續最佳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>每天只處理20筆，可以固定threshold或top20；兩者在每日分布改變時有不同處理量與品質。解答：先定容量，再在時間一致的validation比較，必要時加入最低信心與人工處理規則。資料只剩單一類時AUC不可用，仍可計成本但應揭露樣本支持不足。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/22_threshold.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Real TunedThresholdClassifierCV tunes only within training data.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.model_selection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">TunedThresholdClassifierCV</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.metrics</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">balanced_accuracy_score</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">holdout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">base</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l1_ratio</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">TunedThresholdClassifierCV</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">base</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">scoring</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;balanced_accuracy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">cv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">thresholds</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;selected_threshold&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">best_threshold_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;training_cv_balanced_accuracy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">best_score_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;holdout_balanced_accuracy&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">balanced_accuracy_score</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;holdout was not used for threshold selection&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/classification_threshold.html\">Threshold tuning與資料使用警告</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 決策門檻：成本、容量與TunedThresholdClassifierCV\n\n讓接受／拒絕規則在適當資料上選擇，並隨模型一起保存。\n\n## 預測機率不等於最後行動\n\n模型給P(Y=1|x)，決策規則才決定是否處理。threshold .5是一個常見預設，不代表任何成本、稀有比例或容量下都最佳。把門檻當超參數：可以在獨立val或內部CV選，不能直接看最終test挑。\n\n## 手算成本曲線\n\ny=[1,1,0,0]、scores=[.9,.4,.8,.1]。FN成本5、FP成本1：threshold .5時FN1+FP1，成本6；threshold .4時TP2、FP1、FN0，成本1。因此更低threshold在這份validation更合適。相同成本時本課選較低門檻作固定tie-break，並明確記錄。\n\n$$\nC(t)=c_{FN}\\,FN(t)+c_{FP}\\,FP(t)\n$$\n\n若機率正確校準、每筆成本固定且只有兩個錯誤成本，理論閾值為c_FP/(c_FP+c_FN)；資料有限、校準有誤或有容量約束時，需再驗證，不機械套公式。\n\n## 目前API的實作\n\n第22例真的fit TunedThresholdClassifierCV，用train內3折選balanced_accuracy的threshold，之後一次holdout評估。完整專題則手寫成本候選搜尋，以獨立80筆val選擇，兩種方式都清楚標示資料角色。\n\n## 邊界與部署\n\nthreshold相等時本課採score>=threshold。候選包括0、實際分數與略大於1的值，以涵蓋全接受／全拒絕；不把極端決策漏掉。門檻要和正例class、機率欄位、模型版本一起保存。重訓後分數分布改變，舊threshold不必繼續最佳。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n每天只處理20筆，可以固定threshold或top20；兩者在每日分布改變時有不同處理量與品質。解答：先定容量，再在時間一致的validation比較，必要時加入最低信心與人工處理規則。資料只剩單一類時AUC不可用，仍可計成本但應揭露樣本支持不足。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/22_threshold.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Real TunedThresholdClassifierCV tunes only within training data.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import TunedThresholdClassifierCV\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.metrics import balanced_accuracy_score\nfrom course_core import binary_data,holdout\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        a,b,c,d=holdout(x,y)\n        base=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),LogisticRegression(l1_ratio=0,max_iter=1000))\n        model=TunedThresholdClassifierCV(base,scoring='balanced_accuracy',cv=3,thresholds=30).fit(a,c)\n        result={'selected_threshold':model.best_threshold_,'training_cv_balanced_accuracy':model.best_score_,\n                'holdout_balanced_accuracy':balanced_accuracy_score(d,model.predict(b)),\n                'note':'holdout was not used for threshold selection'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Threshold tuning與資料使用警告](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/classification_threshold.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "tunedthresholdclassifiercv", "name": "決策門檻：成本、容量與TunedThresholdClassifierCV", "html": "決策門檻：成本、容量與TunedThresholdClassifierCV", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "預測機率不等於最後行動", "html": "預測機率不等於最後行動", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "手算成本曲線", "html": "手算成本曲線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "api", "name": "目前API的實作", "html": "目前API的實作", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "邊界與部署", "html": "邊界與部署", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "34-learning-curves", "group": "reliability", "title": "學習曲線與偏差變異：如何判斷下一步", "summary": "用訓練量、模型容量與誤差差距診斷，而非看到曲線就下單一結論。", "tags": ["learning curve", "bias", "variance", "underfit", "overfit"], "example": "23_learning_curve.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">學習曲線與偏差變異：如何判斷下一步</h1>\n<p>用訓練量、模型容量與誤差差距診斷，而非看到曲線就下單一結論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">三種軸不要混在一起</h2>\n<p>學習曲線常指訓練樣本量對score；validation curve常指超參數對score；深度學習的epoch曲線是更新時間對loss。它們可提供不同證據，不能把sklearn learning_curve的train_sizes當epoch數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">常見模式與可能原因</h2>\n<p>train與val都差且接近，可能模型限制、特徵訊號不足、標籤雜訊或最佳化問題；train好val差可能過擬合，也可能split／分布改變；增加資料val仍改善，可能值得蒐集更多同分布樣本。這些是診斷方向，不是只靠兩條線就證明原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">偏差與變異的直覺</h2>\n<p>簡單模型可能系統性錯過關係，複雜模型可能對抽樣變動敏感。平方誤差在特定假設下可分解bias²、variance與不可約雜訊；分類及真實資料不一定能從一次實驗直接估出三項。不要把訓練loss當bias、train-val差直接當數學variance。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">正確計算曲線</h2>\n<p>每個train_size只用對應fold train子集fit整條pipeline，validation保持獨立。資料太少可能某類不足，需調整size與split。若每次size用不同難度資料，曲線含抽樣效應；固定seed、看多fold與範圍，不追求每個點嚴格單調。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">本章例子與可行行動</h2>\n<p>第23例只在train部分計三種樣本量與3折AP，回報train／val平均；不碰final test。根據結果可以嘗試更多同分布資料、較簡單模型、較強特徵或修標籤，每次有明確假設。增加樹數、資料數與特徵數是不同操作，不統稱「加大模型」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>train AP=.99、val=.55，是否一定增加正則化？解答：先查洩漏反向效應、group split與資料分布，正則化只是可能方案。若val隨資料量波動，列fold變異與正例筆數，不因某個點下降就說更多資料有害。完整實驗保留原切分，避免只挑最好的一張圖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/23_learning_curve.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Learning curves are computed on training folds with preprocessing inside.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.model_selection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">learning_curve</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">split_indices</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">split_indices</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;train&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l1_ratio</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">sizes</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">train_scores</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">val_scores</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">learning_curve</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">train_sizes</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.75</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">cv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">StratifiedKFold</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">shuffle</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">scoring</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;average_precision&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">shuffle</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_jobs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;training_rows_per_fold&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">sizes</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;train_ap&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">train_scores</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;validation_ap&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">val_scores</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;diagnostic curve, not proof of a single cause or a final test result&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_9\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/learning_curve.html\">Learning與validation curves</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 學習曲線與偏差變異：如何判斷下一步\n\n用訓練量、模型容量與誤差差距診斷，而非看到曲線就下單一結論。\n\n## 三種軸不要混在一起\n\n學習曲線常指訓練樣本量對score；validation curve常指超參數對score；深度學習的epoch曲線是更新時間對loss。它們可提供不同證據，不能把sklearn learning_curve的train_sizes當epoch數。\n\n## 常見模式與可能原因\n\ntrain與val都差且接近，可能模型限制、特徵訊號不足、標籤雜訊或最佳化問題；train好val差可能過擬合，也可能split／分布改變；增加資料val仍改善，可能值得蒐集更多同分布樣本。這些是診斷方向，不是只靠兩條線就證明原因。\n\n## 偏差與變異的直覺\n\n簡單模型可能系統性錯過關係，複雜模型可能對抽樣變動敏感。平方誤差在特定假設下可分解bias²、variance與不可約雜訊；分類及真實資料不一定能從一次實驗直接估出三項。不要把訓練loss當bias、train-val差直接當數學variance。\n\n## 正確計算曲線\n\n每個train_size只用對應fold train子集fit整條pipeline，validation保持獨立。資料太少可能某類不足，需調整size與split。若每次size用不同難度資料，曲線含抽樣效應；固定seed、看多fold與範圍，不追求每個點嚴格單調。\n\n## 本章例子與可行行動\n\n第23例只在train部分計三種樣本量與3折AP，回報train／val平均；不碰final test。根據結果可以嘗試更多同分布資料、較簡單模型、較強特徵或修標籤，每次有明確假設。增加樹數、資料數與特徵數是不同操作，不統稱「加大模型」。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\ntrain AP=.99、val=.55，是否一定增加正則化？解答：先查洩漏反向效應、group split與資料分布，正則化只是可能方案。若val隨資料量波動，列fold變異與正例筆數，不因某個點下降就說更多資料有害。完整實驗保留原切分，避免只挑最好的一張圖。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/23_learning_curve.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Learning curves are computed on training folds with preprocessing inside.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import learning_curve,StratifiedKFold\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom course_core import binary_data,split_indices\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,y=binary_data()\n        train=split_indices(y)['train']\n        model=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),LogisticRegression(l1_ratio=0,max_iter=1000))\n        sizes,train_scores,val_scores=learning_curve(model,x[train],y[train],train_sizes=[.5,.75,1.],\n            cv=StratifiedKFold(3,shuffle=True,random_state=7),scoring='average_precision',shuffle=True,random_state=7,n_jobs=1)\n        result={'training_rows_per_fold':sizes,'train_ap':train_scores.mean(1),'validation_ap':val_scores.mean(1),\n                'note':'diagnostic curve, not proof of a single cause or a final test result'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Learning與validation curves](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/learning_curve.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "學習曲線與偏差變異：如何判斷下一步", "html": "學習曲線與偏差變異：如何判斷下一步", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "三種軸不要混在一起", "html": "三種軸不要混在一起", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "常見模式與可能原因", "html": "常見模式與可能原因", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "偏差與變異的直覺", "html": "偏差與變異的直覺", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "正確計算曲線", "html": "正確計算曲線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "本章例子與可行行動", "html": "本章例子與可行行動", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_9", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "35-uncertainty", "group": "reliability", "title": "不確定性與穩健比較：bootstrap、變異與區間", "summary": "分清分數估計的不確定性、模型信心與資料分布限制。", "tags": ["uncertainty", "bootstrap", "confidence interval", "robustness"], "html": "<h1 id=\"bootstrap\">不確定性與穩健比較：bootstrap、變異與區間</h1>\n<p>分清分數估計的不確定性、模型信心與資料分布限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">一個分數不代表精確真值</h2>\n<p>80筆test的accuracy=.8，與80000筆的同分數有不同抽樣不確定性。分類機率描述事件不確定性，評估分數區間描述估計的不確定性，兩者不能混用。對某人p=.8不代表你的整體模型有80%信賴度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bootstrap_1\">Bootstrap的基本方法</h2>\n<p>對已固定模型的保留樣本成對重抽(X,y／prediction)，每次計指標，觀察分布。比較兩個模型應使用同一組重抽索引，保留配對關係。若資料有群組／時間依賴，逐列bootstrap的獨立假設可能不合適，需考慮group或block策略。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">pred</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">random</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">default_rng</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">scores</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">200</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">index</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">integers</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">scores</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">append</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">index</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"n\">pred</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">index</span><span class=\"p\">]))</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">quantile</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">scores</span><span class=\"p\">,[</span><span class=\"mf\">.025</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.975</span><span class=\"p\">]))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>這是機制示範，小樣本、有限重抽次數與區間方法都有限制，不把輸出當普遍保證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">不確定性來源</h2>\n<p>固定模型重抽test只描述這組評估樣本的波動，不包含重新訓練、選模、資料蒐集偏差與未來drift。多seed重訓也不自動包含未知分布改變。報告你重抽的是什麼、固定了什麼，避免區間看起來精密卻回答錯問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"conformal\">預測區間與Conformal入口</h2>\n<p>回歸點估計之外，可研究quantile模型或conformal prediction；後者在適當exchangeability與校準流程下討論覆蓋，不是任意時間偏移都保證。這類方法需獨立的校準角色與任務測試，本課先提供概念邊界，完整理論由統計課承接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>兩模型只差1/80筆，是否一定有實質改善？解答：看配對錯誤與不確定性、成本和外部驗證。若你先看test挑兩模型，再對差異bootstrap，區間不會自動消除先前選擇偏差。誠實記錄選擇歷程，比只增加小數位更有用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html\">模型評估</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/cross_validation.html\">Cross-validation注意事項</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.stats.bootstrap.html\">Bootstrap API</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 不確定性與穩健比較：bootstrap、變異與區間\n\n分清分數估計的不確定性、模型信心與資料分布限制。\n\n## 一個分數不代表精確真值\n\n80筆test的accuracy=.8，與80000筆的同分數有不同抽樣不確定性。分類機率描述事件不確定性，評估分數區間描述估計的不確定性，兩者不能混用。對某人p=.8不代表你的整體模型有80%信賴度。\n\n## Bootstrap的基本方法\n\n對已固定模型的保留樣本成對重抽(X,y／prediction)，每次計指標，觀察分布。比較兩個模型應使用同一組重抽索引，保留配對關係。若資料有群組／時間依賴，逐列bootstrap的獨立假設可能不合適，需考慮group或block策略。\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\ny=np.array([0,1,0,1,1,0,1,0])\npred=np.array([0,1,0,0,1,0,1,1])\nrng=np.random.default_rng(7)\nscores=[]\nfor _ in range(200):\n    index=rng.integers(0,len(y),len(y))\n    scores.append(np.mean(y[index]==pred[index]))\nprint(np.quantile(scores,[.025,.975]))\n```\n\n這是機制示範，小樣本、有限重抽次數與區間方法都有限制，不把輸出當普遍保證。\n\n## 不確定性來源\n\n固定模型重抽test只描述這組評估樣本的波動，不包含重新訓練、選模、資料蒐集偏差與未來drift。多seed重訓也不自動包含未知分布改變。報告你重抽的是什麼、固定了什麼，避免區間看起來精密卻回答錯問題。\n\n## 預測區間與Conformal入口\n\n回歸點估計之外，可研究quantile模型或conformal prediction；後者在適當exchangeability與校準流程下討論覆蓋，不是任意時間偏移都保證。這類方法需獨立的校準角色與任務測試，本課先提供概念邊界，完整理論由統計課承接。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n兩模型只差1/80筆，是否一定有實質改善？解答：看配對錯誤與不確定性、成本和外部驗證。若你先看test挑兩模型，再對差異bootstrap，區間不會自動消除先前選擇偏差。誠實記錄選擇歷程，比只增加小數位更有用。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [模型評估](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html)\n- [Cross-validation注意事項](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/cross_validation.html)\n- [Bootstrap API](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.stats.bootstrap.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "bootstrap", "name": "不確定性與穩健比較：bootstrap、變異與區間", "html": "不確定性與穩健比較：bootstrap、變異與區間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "一個分數不代表精確真值", "html": "一個分數不代表精確真值", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "bootstrap_1", "name": "Bootstrap的基本方法", "html": "Bootstrap的基本方法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "不確定性來源", "html": "不確定性來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "conformal", "name": "預測區間與Conformal入口", "html": "預測區間與Conformal入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "36-error-analysis", "group": "reliability", "title": "錯誤分析與子群：找出平均分數掩蓋的問題", "summary": "將錯誤連回資料、標籤、時間與使用者群，而非只調超參數。", "tags": ["error analysis", "subgroup", "slice", "confusion", "drift"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">錯誤分析與子群：找出平均分數掩蓋的問題</h1>\n<p>將錯誤連回資料、標籤、時間與使用者群，而非只調超參數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">先保存可追蹤的預測表</h2>\n<p>每筆至少有樣本ID、split／時間、真值、分數、決策、模型版本；敏感特徵依權限處理。分類分FP／FN，回歸看signed residual與大誤差。只保留平均loss，事後很難知道哪類錯誤造成變化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">切片要有假設</h2>\n<p>依新／舊使用者、缺失率、來源、時間、金額範圍或其他合理群組，看support與指標。群組太小時分數波動大；大量亂切可能找到偶然的極差／極好子群。先定重要切片、列樣本量並追蹤後續資料，不把一次發現當永久規律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">如何判斷原因</h2>\n<p>FP可能是label漏標、特徵時間錯位或threshold過低；FN可能是少數模式沒學到、前處理不一致或資料分布不同。對照代表性案例及資料來源，再提出可測假設。解釋模型某欄重要，不會直接告訴你資料究竟正不正確。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"text\"><pre><span></span><code>觀察：新plan群recall下降\n證據：該群support、unknown編碼率、分數分布、label延遲\n假設：未知類別缺少可用訊號\n實驗：在train加入可泛化特徵，用未參與診斷的資料驗證\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">錯誤修正的資料邊界</h2>\n<p>可以用train／validation做診斷與改進；看test個案後調模型，test已參與開發。保留後續新資料或使用巢狀流程評估。人工修標籤也要有明確規則與版本，不只修模型剛好猜錯的幾筆來提高分數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">公平性與使用限制</h2>\n<p>不同群組錯誤負擔可能很不同，整體accuracy不能代表對所有群體合理。公平性定義與成本可能衝突，需要問題背景、代表性資料與適當治理；本課提供切片與驗證方法，不從合成資料宣稱符合任何現實公平標準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>A群1000筆recall.9，B群10筆recall.5，能否只報整體？解答：應列每群support與不確定性，優先查資料與業務影響。若B全部是部署後新增類別，先查schema與unknown政策，而不是只替整體模型加樹。將每個修正假設與驗證結果記錄，避免無目的調參。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html\">分類與回歸指標</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/permutation_importance.html\">Permutation inspection</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 錯誤分析與子群：找出平均分數掩蓋的問題\n\n將錯誤連回資料、標籤、時間與使用者群，而非只調超參數。\n\n## 先保存可追蹤的預測表\n\n每筆至少有樣本ID、split／時間、真值、分數、決策、模型版本；敏感特徵依權限處理。分類分FP／FN，回歸看signed residual與大誤差。只保留平均loss，事後很難知道哪類錯誤造成變化。\n\n## 切片要有假設\n\n依新／舊使用者、缺失率、來源、時間、金額範圍或其他合理群組，看support與指標。群組太小時分數波動大；大量亂切可能找到偶然的極差／極好子群。先定重要切片、列樣本量並追蹤後續資料，不把一次發現當永久規律。\n\n## 如何判斷原因\n\nFP可能是label漏標、特徵時間錯位或threshold過低；FN可能是少數模式沒學到、前處理不一致或資料分布不同。對照代表性案例及資料來源，再提出可測假設。解釋模型某欄重要，不會直接告訴你資料究竟正不正確。\n\n```text\n觀察：新plan群recall下降\n證據：該群support、unknown編碼率、分數分布、label延遲\n假設：未知類別缺少可用訊號\n實驗：在train加入可泛化特徵，用未參與診斷的資料驗證\n```\n\n## 錯誤修正的資料邊界\n\n可以用train／validation做診斷與改進；看test個案後調模型，test已參與開發。保留後續新資料或使用巢狀流程評估。人工修標籤也要有明確規則與版本，不只修模型剛好猜錯的幾筆來提高分數。\n\n## 公平性與使用限制\n\n不同群組錯誤負擔可能很不同，整體accuracy不能代表對所有群體合理。公平性定義與成本可能衝突，需要問題背景、代表性資料與適當治理；本課提供切片與驗證方法，不從合成資料宣稱符合任何現實公平標準。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nA群1000筆recall.9，B群10筆recall.5，能否只報整體？解答：應列每群support與不確定性，優先查資料與業務影響。若B全部是部署後新增類別，先查schema與unknown政策，而不是只替整體模型加樹。將每個修正假設與驗證結果記錄，避免無目的調參。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [分類與回歸指標](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html)\n- [Permutation inspection](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/permutation_importance.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "錯誤分析與子群：找出平均分數掩蓋的問題", "html": "錯誤分析與子群：找出平均分數掩蓋的問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "先保存可追蹤的預測表", "html": "先保存可追蹤的預測表", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "切片要有假設", "html": "切片要有假設", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "如何判斷原因", "html": "如何判斷原因", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "錯誤修正的資料邊界", "html": "錯誤修正的資料邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "公平性與使用限制", "html": "公平性與使用限制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "37-unsupervised", "group": "unsupervised", "title": "非監督學習全貌：結構、表示與密度", "summary": "沒有指定答案時，先定義探索目的與驗證方法。", "tags": ["unsupervised", "clustering", "density", "GMM", "EM"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">非監督學習全貌：結構、表示與密度</h1>\n<p>沒有指定答案時，先定義探索目的與驗證方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"y\">沒有y也有目標函數</h2>\n<p>KMeans最小化群內平方距離，PCA保留高變異方向，Gaussian Mixture以機率混合分布擬合資料，異常方法找偏離正常結構的點。它們並不是同一種「自動分類」，輸出要連回探索、壓縮、分群或警示用途。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">結構會受表示與尺度影響</h2>\n<p>同一資料用原始金額、log金額或標準化後分群，可能得到不同結果；這些是不同幾何假設。先確認特徵意義、缺失與尺度，再選距離。高維稀疏文字常用適合的表示與降維，不能把任何表格丟進預設L2就稱客觀群組。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">硬分群與軟分群</h2>\n<p>KMeans每點指派一個中心，GMM則假設多個高斯成分，以responsibility描述各成分相對責任。它是模型內的分配，不等於真實身份機率。EM交替估責任與更新參數，可能收斂到局部解，初始化與成分數需檢查。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\np(x)=\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\pi_k\\,\\mathcal N(x\\mid\\mu_k,\\Sigma_k),\\qquad \\sum_k\\pi_k=1\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">驗證從哪裡來</h2>\n<p>有合成真值可用ARI等；真實無標籤可看silhouette、穩定性、對不同seed／重抽的變化、群組大小與人工解讀。內部指標偏好某種形狀，不是單一最大值就等於最有業務意義。若最終用群組做決策，需另驗證下游效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">轉換與新資料</h2>\n<p>PCA與KMeans可對新資料transform／predict，但DBSCAN、階層分群、t-SNE等通常沒有同樣的標準predict介面。不要因為都屬非監督就假設能直接上線分類。先決定你只探索這一批，還是要固定規則服務未來樣本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>三群圖上漂亮，是否證明自然界真的有三類？答案：不是，可能是尺度、演算法或投影造成。KMeans中心與PCA方向都是從資料學出，若接監督模型評估，仍應在train／CV內fit。無監督不等於沒有資料使用邊界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/unsupervised_learning.html\">Unsupervised learning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/mixture.html\">Gaussian mixtures</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/clustering.html\">Clustering</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 非監督學習全貌：結構、表示與密度\n\n沒有指定答案時，先定義探索目的與驗證方法。\n\n## 沒有y也有目標函數\n\nKMeans最小化群內平方距離，PCA保留高變異方向，Gaussian Mixture以機率混合分布擬合資料，異常方法找偏離正常結構的點。它們並不是同一種「自動分類」，輸出要連回探索、壓縮、分群或警示用途。\n\n## 結構會受表示與尺度影響\n\n同一資料用原始金額、log金額或標準化後分群，可能得到不同結果；這些是不同幾何假設。先確認特徵意義、缺失與尺度，再選距離。高維稀疏文字常用適合的表示與降維，不能把任何表格丟進預設L2就稱客觀群組。\n\n## 硬分群與軟分群\n\nKMeans每點指派一個中心，GMM則假設多個高斯成分，以responsibility描述各成分相對責任。它是模型內的分配，不等於真實身份機率。EM交替估責任與更新參數，可能收斂到局部解，初始化與成分數需檢查。\n\n$$\np(x)=\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\pi_k\\,\\mathcal N(x\\mid\\mu_k,\\Sigma_k),\\qquad \\sum_k\\pi_k=1\n$$\n\n## 驗證從哪裡來\n\n有合成真值可用ARI等；真實無標籤可看silhouette、穩定性、對不同seed／重抽的變化、群組大小與人工解讀。內部指標偏好某種形狀，不是單一最大值就等於最有業務意義。若最終用群組做決策，需另驗證下游效果。\n\n## 轉換與新資料\n\nPCA與KMeans可對新資料transform／predict，但DBSCAN、階層分群、t-SNE等通常沒有同樣的標準predict介面。不要因為都屬非監督就假設能直接上線分類。先決定你只探索這一批，還是要固定規則服務未來樣本。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n三群圖上漂亮，是否證明自然界真的有三類？答案：不是，可能是尺度、演算法或投影造成。KMeans中心與PCA方向都是從資料學出，若接監督模型評估，仍應在train／CV內fit。無監督不等於沒有資料使用邊界。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Unsupervised learning](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/unsupervised_learning.html)\n- [Gaussian mixtures](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/mixture.html)\n- [Clustering](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/clustering.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "非監督學習全貌：結構、表示與密度", "html": "非監督學習全貌：結構、表示與密度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "y", "name": "沒有y也有目標函數", "html": "沒有y也有目標函數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "結構會受表示與尺度影響", "html": "結構會受表示與尺度影響", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "硬分群與軟分群", "html": "硬分群與軟分群", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "驗證從哪裡來", "html": "驗證從哪裡來", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "轉換與新資料", "html": "轉換與新資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "38-kmeans", "group": "unsupervised", "title": "KMeans：指派、更新、初始化與群數", "summary": "手動執行Lloyd迭代，理解inertia與局部解。", "tags": ["KMeans", "Lloyd", "inertia", "k-means++", "n_init"], "example": "24_kmeans.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"kmeans\">KMeans：指派、更新、初始化與群數</h1>\n<p>手動執行Lloyd迭代，理解inertia與局部解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">目標函數與兩步驟</h2>\n<p>先指定K個中心，將每點指派最近中心，再以各群平均更新中心，重複到穩定或預算上限。固定指派時平均最小化平方誤差，固定中心時最近指派最小化該項；每步不增加這個目標，但不保證全域最佳。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nJ=\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\lVert x_i-\\mu_{c_i}\\rVert_2^2\n$$</div>\n<p>inertia是這個群內平方距離和，資料量、尺度與K改變都影響它。K變大通常更容易降低inertia，所以不能單憑最小值選K=N。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">初始化與重複嘗試</h2>\n<p>k-means++較有策略選初始中心；n_init控制不同初始化嘗試。課程明確n_init=10、random_state=7，避免依不同版本預設造成差異。空群需處理，實作不能除以0；首頁數值實驗選擇保留空群中心並提示，正式sklearn有自己的重設邏輯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">群數與形狀假設</h2>\n<p>KMeans偏好以L2衡量、相對緊密且尺度相近的群。長條、彎月、密度差很大可能不適合。elbow可看改善變化，silhouette看群內／群間距離，但都不是確定K的機械規則。搭配穩定性與使用目的，必要時改模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">標籤編號沒有大小</h2>\n<p>群0與群1互換仍是同一分群；不能用逐點label相等來比較兩次結果。合成資料有真值可用adjusted_rand_score，對編號置換不敏感。範例會說明ARI只因生成時知道來源，不能在真實未標註資料憑空計accuracy。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>點[0,2,10,12]、中心0與10，指派[0,0,1,1]後中心變1與11，inertia=4。解答：下一次指派相同即穩定。若把所有值乘10，inertia乘100，不能把較大數字直接解釋為分群變差。新資料predict是最近中心規則，仍需監控是否遠離所有群。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/24_kmeans.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;KMeans minimizes within-cluster squared distance on synthetic blobs.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.cluster</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">KMeans</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.datasets</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_blobs</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.metrics</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">silhouette_score</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">adjusted_rand_score</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">truth</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_blobs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_samples</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">90</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">centers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]],</span><span class=\"n\">cluster_std</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">KMeans</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_clusters</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_init</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;centers&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cluster_centers_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;inertia&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inertia_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;silhouette&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">silhouette_score</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">labels_</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;synthetic_truth_ari&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">adjusted_rand_score</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">truth</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">labels_</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;cluster IDs are arbitrary; truth is available only because this is generated data&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/clustering.html#k-means\">K-means</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# KMeans：指派、更新、初始化與群數\n\n手動執行Lloyd迭代，理解inertia與局部解。\n\n## 目標函數與兩步驟\n\n先指定K個中心，將每點指派最近中心，再以各群平均更新中心，重複到穩定或預算上限。固定指派時平均最小化平方誤差，固定中心時最近指派最小化該項；每步不增加這個目標，但不保證全域最佳。\n\n$$\nJ=\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\lVert x_i-\\mu_{c_i}\\rVert_2^2\n$$\n\ninertia是這個群內平方距離和，資料量、尺度與K改變都影響它。K變大通常更容易降低inertia，所以不能單憑最小值選K=N。\n\n## 初始化與重複嘗試\n\nk-means++較有策略選初始中心；n_init控制不同初始化嘗試。課程明確n_init=10、random_state=7，避免依不同版本預設造成差異。空群需處理，實作不能除以0；首頁數值實驗選擇保留空群中心並提示，正式sklearn有自己的重設邏輯。\n\n## 群數與形狀假設\n\nKMeans偏好以L2衡量、相對緊密且尺度相近的群。長條、彎月、密度差很大可能不適合。elbow可看改善變化，silhouette看群內／群間距離，但都不是確定K的機械規則。搭配穩定性與使用目的，必要時改模型。\n\n## 標籤編號沒有大小\n\n群0與群1互換仍是同一分群；不能用逐點label相等來比較兩次結果。合成資料有真值可用adjusted_rand_score，對編號置換不敏感。範例會說明ARI只因生成時知道來源，不能在真實未標註資料憑空計accuracy。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n點[0,2,10,12]、中心0與10，指派[0,0,1,1]後中心變1與11，inertia=4。解答：下一次指派相同即穩定。若把所有值乘10，inertia乘100，不能把較大數字直接解釋為分群變差。新資料predict是最近中心規則，仍需監控是否遠離所有群。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/24_kmeans.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"KMeans minimizes within-cluster squared distance on synthetic blobs.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.cluster import KMeans\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_blobs\nfrom sklearn.metrics import silhouette_score,adjusted_rand_score\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,truth=make_blobs(n_samples=90,centers=[[-3,-2],[0,3],[3,-2]],cluster_std=.5,random_state=7)\n        model=KMeans(n_clusters=3,n_init=10,random_state=7).fit(x)\n        result={'centers':model.cluster_centers_,'inertia':model.inertia_,\n                'silhouette':silhouette_score(x,model.labels_),\n                'synthetic_truth_ari':adjusted_rand_score(truth,model.labels_),\n                'note':'cluster IDs are arbitrary; truth is available only because this is generated data'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [K-means](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/clustering.html#k-means)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "kmeans", "name": "KMeans：指派、更新、初始化與群數", "html": "KMeans：指派、更新、初始化與群數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "目標函數與兩步驟", "html": "目標函數與兩步驟", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "初始化與重複嘗試", "html": "初始化與重複嘗試", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "群數與形狀假設", "html": "群數與形狀假設", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "標籤編號沒有大小", "html": "標籤編號沒有大小", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "39-density-clustering", "group": "unsupervised", "title": "階層與密度分群：DBSCAN、HDBSCAN與噪音", "summary": "比較距離連結與局部密度假設，知道何時不需要先指定K。", "tags": ["DBSCAN", "HDBSCAN", "hierarchical", "eps", "min_samples"], "example": "25_density.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"dbscanhdbscan\">階層與密度分群：DBSCAN、HDBSCAN與噪音</h1>\n<p>比較距離連結與局部密度假設，知道何時不需要先指定K。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">階層式方法</h2>\n<p>Agglomerative由小群逐步合併，linkage決定群間距離；single、complete、average與ward偏好不同結構。Ward以變異相關準則，需要合適的Euclidean設定。樹狀圖提供不同切割層次，不證明資料有唯一自然階級，也不自動支援新樣本predict。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dbscan\">DBSCAN的三種點</h2>\n<p>eps鄰域內達min_samples為核心，接近核心的可為邊界，其餘標成noise -1。它可找到非球形結構且不先給K，但對尺度與密度參數敏感。scikit-learn的min_samples計數包含該點自身，手算時別少算一筆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"eps\">eps與密度差異</h2>\n<p>eps太小很多noise，太大會把不同群連在一起；一組參數可能難以同時處理稠密與稀疏群。HDBSCAN探索密度層次，提供不同穩定群選擇，但仍有min_cluster_size等假設。noise只表示不符合此密度群，不自動表示錯資料或應刪除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">完整例子</h2>\n<p>生成兩團各30點並加[10,10]，DBSCAN(eps=.6,min_samples=4)將孤立點標-1。輸出群數時扣除-1，不把noise當第三個真群。若計silhouette，要先決定如何處理noise與少於兩群情況，不能讓指標例外後默默填1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">資源與部署</h2>\n<p>階層與密度方法可能需要昂貴鄰域／距離結構，某些參數與資料可導致大量記憶體。大N先估距離成本、考慮sampling／稀疏鄰域。DBSCAN沒有標準predict，固定已fit結果服務新樣本需另外明確定義近鄰規則並驗證，不把fit_predict新資料當同一模型的推論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>只有一群且沒有noise，silhouette是否應報高分？答案：通常此指標不適用，因缺少對照群。若[10,10]被標noise，人工檢查後也可能是真實稀有事件，不應直接當錯誤刪除。比較方法要連回問題，不只看圖色塊是否漂亮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/25_density.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;DBSCAN discovers dense groups and marks isolated points as -1.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.cluster</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">DBSCAN</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.datasets</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_blobs</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_blobs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_samples</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">centers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]],</span><span class=\"n\">cluster_std</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">vstack</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,[[</span><span class=\"mf\">10.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">10.</span><span class=\"p\">]]])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">DBSCAN</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">eps</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">min_samples</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit_predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;clusters&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">set</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">}),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;noise_count&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">int</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"o\">==-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;isolated_point_label&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;noise is a density-based designation, not proof of a bad record&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/clustering.html\">DBSCAN與階層分群</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.cluster.HDBSCAN.html\">HDBSCAN</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 階層與密度分群：DBSCAN、HDBSCAN與噪音\n\n比較距離連結與局部密度假設，知道何時不需要先指定K。\n\n## 階層式方法\n\nAgglomerative由小群逐步合併，linkage決定群間距離；single、complete、average與ward偏好不同結構。Ward以變異相關準則，需要合適的Euclidean設定。樹狀圖提供不同切割層次，不證明資料有唯一自然階級，也不自動支援新樣本predict。\n\n## DBSCAN的三種點\n\neps鄰域內達min_samples為核心，接近核心的可為邊界，其餘標成noise -1。它可找到非球形結構且不先給K，但對尺度與密度參數敏感。scikit-learn的min_samples計數包含該點自身，手算時別少算一筆。\n\n## eps與密度差異\n\neps太小很多noise，太大會把不同群連在一起；一組參數可能難以同時處理稠密與稀疏群。HDBSCAN探索密度層次，提供不同穩定群選擇，但仍有min_cluster_size等假設。noise只表示不符合此密度群，不自動表示錯資料或應刪除。\n\n## 完整例子\n\n生成兩團各30點並加[10,10]，DBSCAN(eps=.6,min_samples=4)將孤立點標-1。輸出群數時扣除-1，不把noise當第三個真群。若計silhouette，要先決定如何處理noise與少於兩群情況，不能讓指標例外後默默填1。\n\n## 資源與部署\n\n階層與密度方法可能需要昂貴鄰域／距離結構，某些參數與資料可導致大量記憶體。大N先估距離成本、考慮sampling／稀疏鄰域。DBSCAN沒有標準predict，固定已fit結果服務新樣本需另外明確定義近鄰規則並驗證，不把fit_predict新資料當同一模型的推論。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n只有一群且沒有noise，silhouette是否應報高分？答案：通常此指標不適用，因缺少對照群。若[10,10]被標noise，人工檢查後也可能是真實稀有事件，不應直接當錯誤刪除。比較方法要連回問題，不只看圖色塊是否漂亮。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/25_density.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"DBSCAN discovers dense groups and marks isolated points as -1.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.cluster import DBSCAN\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_blobs\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        x,_=make_blobs(n_samples=60,centers=[[-2,0],[2,0]],cluster_std=.2,random_state=7)\n        x=np.vstack([x,[[10.,10.]]])\n        labels=DBSCAN(eps=.6,min_samples=4).fit_predict(x)\n        result={'clusters':len(set(labels)-{-1}),'noise_count':int((labels==-1).sum()),\n                'isolated_point_label':labels[-1],\n                'note':'noise is a density-based designation, not proof of a bad record'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [DBSCAN與階層分群](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/clustering.html)\n- [HDBSCAN](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.cluster.HDBSCAN.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "dbscanhdbscan", "name": "階層與密度分群：DBSCAN、HDBSCAN與噪音", "html": "階層與密度分群：DBSCAN、HDBSCAN與噪音", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "階層式方法", "html": "階層式方法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "dbscan", "name": "DBSCAN的三種點", "html": "DBSCAN的三種點", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "eps", "name": "eps與密度差異", "html": "eps與密度差異", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "完整例子", "html": "完整例子", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "資源與部署", "html": "資源與部署", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "40-pca", "group": "unsupervised", "title": "PCA：中心化、主方向與重建誤差", "summary": "從最大變異方向理解降維，連回線性代數的特徵分解。", "tags": ["PCA", "SVD", "eigenvector", "explained variance", "reconstruction"], "example": "26_pca.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"pca\">PCA：中心化、主方向與重建誤差</h1>\n<p>從最大變異方向理解降維，連回線性代數的特徵分解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pca_1\">PCA不是挑原始欄位</h2>\n<p>PCA尋找原特徵線性組合的正交方向，讓前幾個方向保留較多變異。它會中心化，是否先StandardScaler是你對尺度的選擇；高變異可能只是單位大，不一定是對預測有用訊號。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nX_c=X-\\bar X,\\quad \\Sigma=\\frac{X_c^TX_c}{N-1},\\quad\n\\Sigma v_k=\\lambda_k v_k,\\quad Z=X_cV_d\n$$</div>\n<p>實際實作可用SVD等數值方式，不建議為了理解公式就在大型資料手寫不穩定的矩陣反算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">解釋變異與重建</h2>\n<p>explained_variance_ratio描述每個成分占總變異比例；inverse_transform用保留方向重建，不能取回被丟掉的資訊。對中心化資料，保留前d個主方向也連回最小平方重建誤差。成分正負號可翻轉，結果幾何等價，不應以逐值符號判定版本錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">已知線性結構的實驗</h2>\n<p>範例生成接近[x,2x,0]的三維點，加少量noise，PCA(1)投影與重建，回報ratio及MSE。測試另用完全共線資料確認一維重建接近精確。這是幾何實驗，不是特徵壓縮後分類一定提升的證據。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">在學習流程中的位置</h2>\n<p>若PCA接分類器，放Pipeline且每fold只fit train；選n_components也用內層validation。whiten會重新縮放主方向，可能有益也可能放大小變異noise。稀疏矩陣可研究TruncatedSVD，其中心化語意不同，不把兩者當完全相同方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>資料變異最大方向是無關的測量noise，小變異方向才分label，PCA保留最多變異是否保證分類好？答案：不保證，PCA不看y。降維圖上兩群分離也需查投影與下游評估，不從2D畫面直接斷言原空間的真實可分性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/26_pca.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;PCA projects, reconstructs and reports explained variance.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.decomposition</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">PCA</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">random</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">default_rng</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">linspace</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">80</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">column_stack</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">normal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.05</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">normal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.02</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">))])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">PCA</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_components</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">svd_solver</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;full&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">projected</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">transform</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">reconstructed</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inverse_transform</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">projected</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;component&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">components_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;explained_variance_ratio&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">explained_variance_ratio_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;projected_shape&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">projected</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;reconstruction_mse&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">float</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">reconstructed</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;PCA maximizes variance, not class separation; component sign is arbitrary&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/decomposition.html#pca\">PCA與分解</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# PCA：中心化、主方向與重建誤差\n\n從最大變異方向理解降維，連回線性代數的特徵分解。\n\n## PCA不是挑原始欄位\n\nPCA尋找原特徵線性組合的正交方向，讓前幾個方向保留較多變異。它會中心化，是否先StandardScaler是你對尺度的選擇；高變異可能只是單位大，不一定是對預測有用訊號。\n\n$$\nX_c=X-\\bar X,\\quad \\Sigma=\\frac{X_c^TX_c}{N-1},\\quad\n\\Sigma v_k=\\lambda_k v_k,\\quad Z=X_cV_d\n$$\n\n實際實作可用SVD等數值方式，不建議為了理解公式就在大型資料手寫不穩定的矩陣反算。\n\n## 解釋變異與重建\n\nexplained_variance_ratio描述每個成分占總變異比例；inverse_transform用保留方向重建，不能取回被丟掉的資訊。對中心化資料，保留前d個主方向也連回最小平方重建誤差。成分正負號可翻轉，結果幾何等價，不應以逐值符號判定版本錯誤。\n\n## 已知線性結構的實驗\n\n範例生成接近[x,2x,0]的三維點，加少量noise，PCA(1)投影與重建，回報ratio及MSE。測試另用完全共線資料確認一維重建接近精確。這是幾何實驗，不是特徵壓縮後分類一定提升的證據。\n\n## 在學習流程中的位置\n\n若PCA接分類器，放Pipeline且每fold只fit train；選n_components也用內層validation。whiten會重新縮放主方向，可能有益也可能放大小變異noise。稀疏矩陣可研究TruncatedSVD，其中心化語意不同，不把兩者當完全相同方法。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n資料變異最大方向是無關的測量noise，小變異方向才分label，PCA保留最多變異是否保證分類好？答案：不保證，PCA不看y。降維圖上兩群分離也需查投影與下游評估，不從2D畫面直接斷言原空間的真實可分性。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/26_pca.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"PCA projects, reconstructs and reports explained variance.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.decomposition import PCA\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        rng=np.random.default_rng(7)\n        t=np.linspace(-2,2,80)\n        x=np.column_stack([t,2*t+rng.normal(0,.05,len(t)),rng.normal(0,.02,len(t))])\n        model=PCA(n_components=1,svd_solver='full').fit(x)\n        projected=model.transform(x)\n        reconstructed=model.inverse_transform(projected)\n        result={'component':model.components_,'explained_variance_ratio':model.explained_variance_ratio_,\n                'projected_shape':projected.shape,'reconstruction_mse':float(np.mean((x-reconstructed)**2)),\n                'note':'PCA maximizes variance, not class separation; component sign is arbitrary'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [PCA與分解](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/decomposition.html#pca)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "pca", "name": "PCA：中心化、主方向與重建誤差", "html": "PCA：中心化、主方向與重建誤差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "pca_1", "name": "PCA不是挑原始欄位", "html": "PCA不是挑原始欄位", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "解釋變異與重建", "html": "解釋變異與重建", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "已知線性結構的實驗", "html": "已知線性結構的實驗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "在學習流程中的位置", "html": "在學習流程中的位置", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "41-manifold", "group": "unsupervised", "title": "非線性降維與視覺化：t-SNE、Isomap與UMAP邊界", "summary": "把探索圖當作有假設的投影，避免從形狀讀出不存在的結論。", "tags": ["t-SNE", "Isomap", "manifold", "UMAP", "visualization"], "html": "<h1 id=\"t-sneisomapumap\">非線性降維與視覺化：t-SNE、Isomap與UMAP邊界</h1>\n<p>把探索圖當作有假設的投影，避免從形狀讀出不存在的結論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">線性不夠時想保留什麼</h2>\n<p>Isomap以鄰域圖近似測地距離，LLE以局部重建結構，t-SNE以鄰近機率分布匹配做低維視覺化。每種方法保留不同關係，不是都在保留所有距離。投影後資訊必然被壓縮，圖上空白、群大小與遠距離未必有原空間對應意義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"t-sne\">t-SNE的操作條件</h2>\n<p>perplexity與樣本量／鄰域尺度相關且需小於N；random_state、初始化、learning_rate與迭代預算會改變圖。使用目前max_iter命名，不沿用舊n_iter。先處理尺度，必要時PCA降低noise與成本，但要清楚兩段都在學表示。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.datasets</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_blobs</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.manifold</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">TSNE</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_blobs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_samples</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">80</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_features</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">TSNE</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_components</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">perplexity</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">15</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">500</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit_transform</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>這是選配探索片段，未列入30個預設入口的性能承諾；計算成本依樣本與設定而變。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">圖的穩定性與驗證</h2>\n<p>改幾個合理seed／參數，看局部近鄰是否持續；用原空間距離、trustworthiness等及已知資訊交叉檢查。不要先調到與預期label最分離，再稱這張圖是完全無監督的客觀發現。圖可以產生假設，後續仍需要獨立證據。</p>\n<h2 id=\"umap\">UMAP與新樣本</h2>\n<p>UMAP來自外部umap-learn生態，不包含在本課鎖定依賴與實測範例中。常見實作可提供transform，但也有其近鄰圖與優化假設。sklearn t-SNE則沒有一般transform介面，不能像PCA直接把任意新點投到固定模型。各方法的部署需求要分清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>t-SNE圖兩團相距很遠，能說原空間語意差10倍嗎？答案：不能，低維遠距離不應如此解讀。若需要固定可部署壓縮，先比較PCA或有明確transform的方法，再驗證新資料，而不是以最漂亮的圖決定整個資料管線。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/manifold.html\">Manifold learning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.manifold.TSNE.html\">TSNE目前API</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 非線性降維與視覺化：t-SNE、Isomap與UMAP邊界\n\n把探索圖當作有假設的投影，避免從形狀讀出不存在的結論。\n\n## 線性不夠時想保留什麼\n\nIsomap以鄰域圖近似測地距離，LLE以局部重建結構，t-SNE以鄰近機率分布匹配做低維視覺化。每種方法保留不同關係，不是都在保留所有距離。投影後資訊必然被壓縮，圖上空白、群大小與遠距離未必有原空間對應意義。\n\n## t-SNE的操作條件\n\nperplexity與樣本量／鄰域尺度相關且需小於N；random_state、初始化、learning_rate與迭代預算會改變圖。使用目前max_iter命名，不沿用舊n_iter。先處理尺度，必要時PCA降低noise與成本，但要清楚兩段都在學表示。\n\n```python\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_blobs\nfrom sklearn.manifold import TSNE\nx,_=make_blobs(n_samples=80,n_features=5,random_state=7)\nz=TSNE(n_components=2,perplexity=15,max_iter=500,random_state=7).fit_transform(x)\nprint(z.shape)\n```\n\n這是選配探索片段，未列入30個預設入口的性能承諾；計算成本依樣本與設定而變。\n\n## 圖的穩定性與驗證\n\n改幾個合理seed／參數，看局部近鄰是否持續；用原空間距離、trustworthiness等及已知資訊交叉檢查。不要先調到與預期label最分離，再稱這張圖是完全無監督的客觀發現。圖可以產生假設，後續仍需要獨立證據。\n\n## UMAP與新樣本\n\nUMAP來自外部umap-learn生態，不包含在本課鎖定依賴與實測範例中。常見實作可提供transform，但也有其近鄰圖與優化假設。sklearn t-SNE則沒有一般transform介面，不能像PCA直接把任意新點投到固定模型。各方法的部署需求要分清楚。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nt-SNE圖兩團相距很遠，能說原空間語意差10倍嗎？答案：不能，低維遠距離不應如此解讀。若需要固定可部署壓縮，先比較PCA或有明確transform的方法，再驗證新資料，而不是以最漂亮的圖決定整個資料管線。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Manifold learning](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/manifold.html)\n- [TSNE目前API](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.manifold.TSNE.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "t-sneisomapumap", "name": "非線性降維與視覺化：t-SNE、Isomap與UMAP邊界", "html": "非線性降維與視覺化：t-SNE、Isomap與UMAP邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "線性不夠時想保留什麼", "html": "線性不夠時想保留什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "t-sne", "name": "t-SNE的操作條件", "html": "t-SNE的操作條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "圖的穩定性與驗證", "html": "圖的穩定性與驗證", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "umap", "name": "UMAP與新樣本", "html": "UMAP與新樣本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "42-anomaly", "group": "unsupervised", "title": "異常偵測：Isolation Forest、LOF與novelty", "summary": "分清訓練資料中的離群點、未來新奇點與真實事件標籤。", "tags": ["IsolationForest", "LOF", "novelty", "outlier", "contamination"], "example": "27_anomaly.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"isolation-forestlofnovelty\">異常偵測：Isolation Forest、LOF與novelty</h1>\n<p>分清訓練資料中的離群點、未來新奇點與真實事件標籤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">異常是相對於什麼</h2>\n<p>點偏離多數不代表錯誤，可能稀有但重要；也不代表特定詐欺／故障事件。異常偵測在沒有完整事件label時提供候選與分數，後續要人工確認或獨立標註評估。若有可靠事件label，監督分類也可能更適合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"isolation-forest\">Isolation Forest的直覺</h2>\n<p>以隨機特徵與切點隔離樣本，較容易被隔離的點具有不同路徑統計。它不是計算離平均最遠的Euclidean距離。contamination控制分數轉決策的threshold設定，不是演算法驗證出真實世界恰有5%壞資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lofnovelty\">LOF與novelty</h2>\n<p>LocalOutlierFactor比較局部密度與鄰居，適合找局部異常。預設outlier detection與novelty=True的使用介面不同，後者才設計對未見資料做相應predict／score；不能把訓練與新資料分數混用。OneClassSVM也有kernel、尺度與ν等假設。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">分數方向要寫清楚</h2>\n<p>sklearn異常predict常以+1為inlier、-1為outlier，decision_function通常較低更異常。若轉成「風險分數」，記錄是否反號及門檻。混淆正負方向會造成看似合理但完全相反的排名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">真實範例</h2>\n<p>生成120筆正常點，另以[0,0]與[8,8]查詢IsolationForest，回報原始decision_function及labels。測試比較中心分數高於遠點。這只驗證合成幾何與API，不代表能偵測現實故障；沒有使用查詢點重新fit正常模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>模型每天都強制標5%異常，是否保證每日事件率5%？答案：不是，contamination是決策假設。部署資料分布改變時警示率變化應調查，不直接重設門檻把數量壓回固定比例。若人工只標高分警示，評估會有選擇偏差，需另設代表性抽樣。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/27_anomaly.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;IsolationForest uses a separate synthetic query set.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.ensemble</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">IsolationForest</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">random</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">default_rng</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">normal</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">normal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.4</span><span class=\"p\">,(</span><span class=\"mi\">120</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">query</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">8.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">8.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">IsolationForest</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_estimators</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">50</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">contamination</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.05</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_jobs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">normal</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;queries&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">query</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;predictions&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">query</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;decision_function&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">decision_function</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">query</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;+1=inlier, -1=outlier; contamination controls the decision threshold&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/outlier_detection.html\">Outlier與novelty detection</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 異常偵測：Isolation Forest、LOF與novelty\n\n分清訓練資料中的離群點、未來新奇點與真實事件標籤。\n\n## 異常是相對於什麼\n\n點偏離多數不代表錯誤，可能稀有但重要；也不代表特定詐欺／故障事件。異常偵測在沒有完整事件label時提供候選與分數，後續要人工確認或獨立標註評估。若有可靠事件label，監督分類也可能更適合。\n\n## Isolation Forest的直覺\n\n以隨機特徵與切點隔離樣本，較容易被隔離的點具有不同路徑統計。它不是計算離平均最遠的Euclidean距離。contamination控制分數轉決策的threshold設定，不是演算法驗證出真實世界恰有5%壞資料。\n\n## LOF與novelty\n\nLocalOutlierFactor比較局部密度與鄰居，適合找局部異常。預設outlier detection與novelty=True的使用介面不同，後者才設計對未見資料做相應predict／score；不能把訓練與新資料分數混用。OneClassSVM也有kernel、尺度與ν等假設。\n\n## 分數方向要寫清楚\n\nsklearn異常predict常以+1為inlier、-1為outlier，decision_function通常較低更異常。若轉成「風險分數」，記錄是否反號及門檻。混淆正負方向會造成看似合理但完全相反的排名。\n\n## 真實範例\n\n生成120筆正常點，另以[0,0]與[8,8]查詢IsolationForest，回報原始decision_function及labels。測試比較中心分數高於遠點。這只驗證合成幾何與API，不代表能偵測現實故障；沒有使用查詢點重新fit正常模型。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n模型每天都強制標5%異常，是否保證每日事件率5%？答案：不是，contamination是決策假設。部署資料分布改變時警示率變化應調查，不直接重設門檻把數量壓回固定比例。若人工只標高分警示，評估會有選擇偏差，需另設代表性抽樣。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/27_anomaly.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"IsolationForest uses a separate synthetic query set.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import IsolationForest\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        rng=np.random.default_rng(7)\n        normal=rng.normal(0,.4,(120,2))\n        query=np.array([[0.,0.],[8.,8.]])\n        model=IsolationForest(n_estimators=50,contamination=.05,random_state=7,n_jobs=1).fit(normal)\n        result={'queries':query,'predictions':model.predict(query),'decision_function':model.decision_function(query),\n                'note':'+1=inlier, -1=outlier; contamination controls the decision threshold'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Outlier與novelty detection](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/outlier_detection.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "isolation-forestlofnovelty", "name": "異常偵測：Isolation Forest、LOF與novelty", "html": "異常偵測：Isolation Forest、LOF與novelty", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "異常是相對於什麼", "html": "異常是相對於什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "isolation-forest", "name": "Isolation Forest的直覺", "html": "Isolation Forest的直覺", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "lofnovelty", "name": "LOF與novelty", "html": "LOF與novelty", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "分數方向要寫清楚", "html": "分數方向要寫清楚", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "真實範例", "html": "真實範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "43-text-features", "group": "applications", "title": "文字特徵工程：TF-IDF、n-gram與分類管線", "summary": "將文字向量化與模型包在同一訓練邊界，處理中英文差異。", "tags": ["TF-IDF", "TfidfVectorizer", "text", "tokenization", "sparse"], "html": "<h1 id=\"tf-idfn-gram\">文字特徵工程：TF-IDF、n-gram與分類管線</h1>\n<p>將文字向量化與模型包在同一訓練邊界，處理中英文差異。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">先把文字變成可運算表示</h2>\n<p>CountVectorizer以詞／字n-gram建立詞表與計數；TfidfVectorizer另依文件頻率調整。詞表與IDF是fit學到的狀態，必須只看train。預測新詞可能被忽略，維度沿用原詞表，不重新fit test語料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">中文與英文的基本差異</h2>\n<p>英文預設token規則常依空白／字元模式切詞；中文未斷詞時可能形成不合預期長片段。可以明確使用斷詞器並版本化，或char n-gram作離線基準。選擇n範圍、min_df、max_df與max_features影響成本與訊號，需驗證。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.feature_extraction.text</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">TfidfVectorizer</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">TfidfVectorizer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">analyzer</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;char&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">ngram_range</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n                    <span class=\"n\">LogisticRegression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">l1_ratio</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">max_iter</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"n\">texts</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;程式資料分析&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;模型程式工具&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;球隊比賽進球&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;足球球員比賽&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">texts</span><span class=\"p\">,[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;資料程式工具&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;足球比賽進球&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>這是四句自製示例，不是中文分類成績；第19章另有完整英文NB入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">稀疏矩陣與線性基準</h2>\n<p>詞表很大但每句只少數詞，sparse保存非零元素。不要隨手toarray把幾十萬欄展開；也避免會中心化的scaler。線性Logistic、LinearSVC、NB常是強且便宜的起點；kernel或森林未必適合這種高維稀疏表示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">文字資料的洩漏</h2>\n<p>同一文件切塊、轉貼、模板與重複文章跨split，會讓val過高；以來源／文件group或時間切分。主題label若出現在檔名或頁尾，也可能被模型當捷徑。文字清理規則先用train設計，不看到test錯例就一直增加特定詞規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>語意相近但用詞不同，TF-IDF可能失敗；解答：比較更適當字／詞特徵或Embedding，仍保持同樣切分與指標。使用預訓練Embedding時保存模型與前處理版本，不能因為向量維度相同就混用。RAG則還要處理檢索、引用與生成，與這裡的分類不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/feature_extraction.html#text-feature-extraction\">Text feature extraction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/auto_examples/text/plot_document_classification_20newsgroups.html\">文字分類官方範例</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 文字特徵工程：TF-IDF、n-gram與分類管線\n\n將文字向量化與模型包在同一訓練邊界，處理中英文差異。\n\n## 先把文字變成可運算表示\n\nCountVectorizer以詞／字n-gram建立詞表與計數；TfidfVectorizer另依文件頻率調整。詞表與IDF是fit學到的狀態，必須只看train。預測新詞可能被忽略，維度沿用原詞表，不重新fit test語料。\n\n## 中文與英文的基本差異\n\n英文預設token規則常依空白／字元模式切詞；中文未斷詞時可能形成不合預期長片段。可以明確使用斷詞器並版本化，或char n-gram作離線基準。選擇n範圍、min_df、max_df與max_features影響成本與訊號，需驗證。\n\n```python\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.feature_extraction.text import TfidfVectorizer\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nmodel=make_pipeline(TfidfVectorizer(analyzer='char',ngram_range=(2,4)),\n                    LogisticRegression(l1_ratio=0,max_iter=1000))\ntexts=['程式資料分析','模型程式工具','球隊比賽進球','足球球員比賽']\nmodel.fit(texts,[0,0,1,1])\nprint(model.predict(['資料程式工具','足球比賽進球']))\n```\n\n這是四句自製示例，不是中文分類成績；第19章另有完整英文NB入口。\n\n## 稀疏矩陣與線性基準\n\n詞表很大但每句只少數詞，sparse保存非零元素。不要隨手toarray把幾十萬欄展開；也避免會中心化的scaler。線性Logistic、LinearSVC、NB常是強且便宜的起點；kernel或森林未必適合這種高維稀疏表示。\n\n## 文字資料的洩漏\n\n同一文件切塊、轉貼、模板與重複文章跨split，會讓val過高；以來源／文件group或時間切分。主題label若出現在檔名或頁尾，也可能被模型當捷徑。文字清理規則先用train設計，不看到test錯例就一直增加特定詞規則。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n語意相近但用詞不同，TF-IDF可能失敗；解答：比較更適當字／詞特徵或Embedding，仍保持同樣切分與指標。使用預訓練Embedding時保存模型與前處理版本，不能因為向量維度相同就混用。RAG則還要處理檢索、引用與生成，與這裡的分類不同。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Text feature extraction](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/feature_extraction.html#text-feature-extraction)\n- [文字分類官方範例](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/auto_examples/text/plot_document_classification_20newsgroups.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "tf-idfn-gram", "name": "文字特徵工程：TF-IDF、n-gram與分類管線", "html": "文字特徵工程：TF-IDF、n-gram與分類管線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "先把文字變成可運算表示", "html": "先把文字變成可運算表示", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "中文與英文的基本差異", "html": "中文與英文的基本差異", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "稀疏矩陣與線性基準", "html": "稀疏矩陣與線性基準", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "文字資料的洩漏", "html": "文字資料的洩漏", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "44-tabular-design", "group": "applications", "title": "表格建模設計：類別、比例、計數與目標變換", "summary": "依資料生成與使用限制選擇特徵和模型，而不是統一套標準化。", "tags": ["tabular", "ColumnTransformer", "Poisson", "Tweedie", "target transform"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">表格建模設計：類別、比例、計數與目標變換</h1>\n<p>依資料生成與使用限制選擇特徵和模型，而不是統一套標準化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">欄位型態影響假設</h2>\n<p>年資是連續／計數，方案是類別，百分比有邊界，事件數常非負，金額可能右偏。將所有欄位轉float與StandardScaler並不保證合適。先問資料單位、零的意義、可否負值與可用時間，再選轉換與loss。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">混合前處理</h2>\n<p>ColumnTransformer讓數值median+scale，類別MISSING+one-hot。保存名稱與順序，remainder是drop或passthrough要明確。新增欄位不應無意間改變模型輸入；本課schema拒絕缺少／多出keys，避免API悄悄接受未知結構。</p>\n<h2 id=\"target\">回歸的target特性</h2>\n<p>對正偏金額可比較log1p target與原值模型，並在原單位評估；TransformedTargetRegressor管理fit與inverse變換。轉換後的條件平均，轉回不一定是原空間條件平均，不能直接忽略Jensen相關偏差。對計數可研究PoissonRegressor，需符合target非負與link的使用假設。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\log\\mu(x)=w^Tx+b\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mu(x)=\\exp(w^Tx+b)\n$$</div>\n<p>Poisson、Gamma、Tweedie等GLM提供不同均值／變異關係與支援域，不是看到非負就必然最適。以任務指標、殘差與baseline比較。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">樹系與線性系的比較</h2>\n<p>樹可學分段交互且通常少依賴數值縮放，線性模型較易外插某些結構且推論便宜；模型間的差異要在同一split與合理前處理比較。高基數類別、缺失與極端值仍要明確政策，不讓模型替你掩蓋資料含義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>predict銷售量出現負值，可直接clip成0嗎？解答：可以作事先定義的後處理候選，但需在validation評估並保存；也可用支援正均值的模型，仍查資料和loss。不能看test後只修幾筆負數，再稱原模型改善。若評估在log空間，另報原單位誤差才符合使用者需求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html\">ColumnTransformer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#generalized-linear-models\">Generalized Linear Models</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html#transforming-target-in-regression\">Target transformation</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 表格建模設計：類別、比例、計數與目標變換\n\n依資料生成與使用限制選擇特徵和模型，而不是統一套標準化。\n\n## 欄位型態影響假設\n\n年資是連續／計數，方案是類別，百分比有邊界，事件數常非負，金額可能右偏。將所有欄位轉float與StandardScaler並不保證合適。先問資料單位、零的意義、可否負值與可用時間，再選轉換與loss。\n\n## 混合前處理\n\nColumnTransformer讓數值median+scale，類別MISSING+one-hot。保存名稱與順序，remainder是drop或passthrough要明確。新增欄位不應無意間改變模型輸入；本課schema拒絕缺少／多出keys，避免API悄悄接受未知結構。\n\n## 回歸的target特性\n\n對正偏金額可比較log1p target與原值模型，並在原單位評估；TransformedTargetRegressor管理fit與inverse變換。轉換後的條件平均，轉回不一定是原空間條件平均，不能直接忽略Jensen相關偏差。對計數可研究PoissonRegressor，需符合target非負與link的使用假設。\n\n$$\n\\log\\mu(x)=w^Tx+b\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mu(x)=\\exp(w^Tx+b)\n$$\n\nPoisson、Gamma、Tweedie等GLM提供不同均值／變異關係與支援域，不是看到非負就必然最適。以任務指標、殘差與baseline比較。\n\n## 樹系與線性系的比較\n\n樹可學分段交互且通常少依賴數值縮放，線性模型較易外插某些結構且推論便宜；模型間的差異要在同一split與合理前處理比較。高基數類別、缺失與極端值仍要明確政策，不讓模型替你掩蓋資料含義。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\npredict銷售量出現負值，可直接clip成0嗎？解答：可以作事先定義的後處理候選，但需在validation評估並保存；也可用支援正均值的模型，仍查資料和loss。不能看test後只修幾筆負數，再稱原模型改善。若評估在log空間，另報原單位誤差才符合使用者需求。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [ColumnTransformer](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html)\n- [Generalized Linear Models](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#generalized-linear-models)\n- [Target transformation](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html#transforming-target-in-regression)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "表格建模設計：類別、比例、計數與目標變換", "html": "表格建模設計：類別、比例、計數與目標變換", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "欄位型態影響假設", "html": "欄位型態影響假設", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "混合前處理", "html": "混合前處理", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "target", "name": "回歸的target特性", "html": "回歸的target特性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "樹系與線性系的比較", "html": "樹系與線性系的比較", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "45-inspection", "group": "applications", "title": "模型解釋：係數、Permutation、PDP與局部說明", "summary": "解釋模型如何使用特徵，同時保留相關性與因果的邊界。", "tags": ["interpretability", "permutation importance", "PDP", "ICE", "SHAP"], "example": "28_inspection.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"permutationpdp\">模型解釋：係數、Permutation、PDP與局部說明</h1>\n<p>解釋模型如何使用特徵，同時保留相關性與因果的邊界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">先問解釋哪一件事</h2>\n<p>全域重要性描述整體預測依賴；局部說明描述某筆輸出；因果效果描述改變特徵會發生什麼。三者不是同一問題。某特徵有高重要性，可能因洩漏或代理訊號，不自動意味它值得干預。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">係數與樹重要性</h2>\n<p>線性coef需結合尺度、正則化與相關欄位；樹impurity重要性容易受可切點數與相關替代影響。不要單純按絕對值排序後宣稱已找到真實因果。先確認模型在獨立資料有用，否則解釋一個差模型的依賴也可能誤導。</p>\n<h2 id=\"permutation-importance\">Permutation importance</h2>\n<p>固定已fit模型，在heldout打亂一欄，觀察指定score下降。它依賴模型、資料與metric；相關特徵可互相補充，使單欄下降不大。若打亂破壞合理聯合分布，也需小心解讀。n_repeats提供此置換下變異，不含所有重新訓練不確定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pdpice\">PDP與ICE</h2>\n<p>PDP平均觀察把某特徵設成不同值時的模型輸出；ICE看個別曲線。若特徵強相關，人造組合可能不合理。它們解釋的是f的反應，不直接是現實干預效果。局部如SHAP來自額外生態與假設，本課提供概念比較，不聲稱已安裝或執行該套件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">本章實驗</h2>\n<p>合成y=4x0+noise，其他兩欄無訊號，Ridge固定訓練後對holdout做permutation，以neg_MAE為score。預期x0打亂造成最大score下降。此例因生成規則已知適合sanity check，不能推定真實資料也有這麼乾淨的唯一特徵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>A與B幾乎相同，打亂A卻沒有明顯降分，是否證明A無用？答案：B可能替代它；可比較群組置換、模型移除或重新訓練，明確區分實驗。重要性為負也可能是波動或模型利用了不利訊號，先看repeats與保留資料，而不是直接刪欄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/28_inspection.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Permutation importance on held-out rows; associations are not causes.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.inspection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">permutation_importance</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Ridge</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.model_selection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">train_test_split</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">random</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">default_rng</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">normal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">200</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">));</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[:,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"n\">rng</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">normal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">200</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">train_test_split</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">test_size</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">Ridge</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">alpha</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">importance</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">permutation_importance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_repeats</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">scoring</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;neg_mean_absolute_error&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_jobs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;mean_score_drop&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">importance</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">importances_mean</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;std_score_drop&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">importance</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">importances_std</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;importance is model/data/metric-specific; correlated features may share signal&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/permutation_importance.html\">Permutation importance</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/partial_dependence.html\">PDP與ICE</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 模型解釋：係數、Permutation、PDP與局部說明\n\n解釋模型如何使用特徵，同時保留相關性與因果的邊界。\n\n## 先問解釋哪一件事\n\n全域重要性描述整體預測依賴；局部說明描述某筆輸出；因果效果描述改變特徵會發生什麼。三者不是同一問題。某特徵有高重要性，可能因洩漏或代理訊號，不自動意味它值得干預。\n\n## 係數與樹重要性\n\n線性coef需結合尺度、正則化與相關欄位；樹impurity重要性容易受可切點數與相關替代影響。不要單純按絕對值排序後宣稱已找到真實因果。先確認模型在獨立資料有用，否則解釋一個差模型的依賴也可能誤導。\n\n## Permutation importance\n\n固定已fit模型，在heldout打亂一欄，觀察指定score下降。它依賴模型、資料與metric；相關特徵可互相補充，使單欄下降不大。若打亂破壞合理聯合分布，也需小心解讀。n_repeats提供此置換下變異，不含所有重新訓練不確定性。\n\n## PDP與ICE\n\nPDP平均觀察把某特徵設成不同值時的模型輸出；ICE看個別曲線。若特徵強相關，人造組合可能不合理。它們解釋的是f的反應，不直接是現實干預效果。局部如SHAP來自額外生態與假設，本課提供概念比較，不聲稱已安裝或執行該套件。\n\n## 本章實驗\n\n合成y=4x0+noise，其他兩欄無訊號，Ridge固定訓練後對holdout做permutation，以neg_MAE為score。預期x0打亂造成最大score下降。此例因生成規則已知適合sanity check，不能推定真實資料也有這麼乾淨的唯一特徵。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nA與B幾乎相同，打亂A卻沒有明顯降分，是否證明A無用？答案：B可能替代它；可比較群組置換、模型移除或重新訓練，明確區分實驗。重要性為負也可能是波動或模型利用了不利訊號，先看repeats與保留資料，而不是直接刪欄。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/28_inspection.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Permutation importance on held-out rows; associations are not causes.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom sklearn.inspection import permutation_importance\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        rng=np.random.default_rng(7)\n        x=rng.normal(size=(200,3));y=4*x[:,0]+rng.normal(0,.1,200)\n        a,b,c,d=train_test_split(x,y,test_size=.3,random_state=7)\n        model=Ridge(alpha=1.).fit(a,c)\n        importance=permutation_importance(model,b,d,n_repeats=5,random_state=7,scoring='neg_mean_absolute_error',n_jobs=1)\n        result={'mean_score_drop':importance.importances_mean,'std_score_drop':importance.importances_std,\n                'note':'importance is model/data/metric-specific; correlated features may share signal'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Permutation importance](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/permutation_importance.html)\n- [PDP與ICE](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/partial_dependence.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "permutationpdp", "name": "模型解釋：係數、Permutation、PDP與局部說明", "html": "模型解釋：係數、Permutation、PDP與局部說明", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "先問解釋哪一件事", "html": "先問解釋哪一件事", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "係數與樹重要性", "html": "係數與樹重要性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "permutation-importance", "name": "Permutation importance", "html": "Permutation importance", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "pdpice", "name": "PDP與ICE", "html": "PDP與ICE", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "本章實驗", "html": "本章實驗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "46-robustness", "group": "applications", "title": "資料品質與穩健性：離群值、雜訊與敏感性實驗", "summary": "用可控制擾動檢查模型，而不是只靠一份乾淨test。", "tags": ["robustness", "outliers", "noise", "sensitivity", "data validation"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">資料品質與穩健性：離群值、雜訊與敏感性實驗</h1>\n<p>用可控制擾動檢查模型，而不是只靠一份乾淨test。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">品質檢查與模型韌性</h2>\n<p>格式正確不代表內容合理：單位錯1000倍、時間錯位、欄位互換、缺失飆升都可能仍是finite數字。邊界驗證先保護schema與明確域值；穩健性實驗再看合理擾動下輸出是否可接受。兩者不能互相取代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">離群值不一定要刪</h2>\n<p>可能是輸入錯誤，也可能真實稀有案例。對所有高誤差點一律刪除，會讓報告偏好容易樣本。可比較RobustScaler、穩健回歸或clip政策，但每項規則需由train／validation決定並保存。依test錯誤特別刪資料會污染評估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">擾動矩陣</h2>\n<p>設幾種事先定義情境：缺失率5%→20%、特徵增加小量測noise、新category、某欄改單位、某來源比例改變。前三者可能是真實可接受輸入，單位／schema錯誤應直接拒絕。記錄效能、警示率、confidence與失敗模式，而不只看程式有沒有crash。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"text\"><pre><span></span><code>情境               期望行為\n少量數值null       沿用train imputer並回報缺失監控\n新plan字串         走unknown政策，記錄比例\n數值為Inf／字串    在邊界明確拒絕\n欄位名稱錯誤       拒絕，避免silent feature swap\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">標籤雜訊與分布偏差</h2>\n<p>少量錯標可讓某些高容量模型追逐noise。修標需要一致規則與獨立審查，不能只改模型錯的樣本。蒐集偏差與未來分布不同則不一定能靠更多同源資料解決，需要更符合部署的樣本及評估設計。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>將同一個raw record的dict鍵順序反轉，預測應相同，因為按schema取值；把數值改字串'5'，本課拒絕，避免含糊型態轉換。解答：明確介面比自動猜測更容易維護。加入一個額外key也拒絕，是否寬鬆接受應由服務契約決定，而不是任意忽略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/preprocessing.html\">Preprocessing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/outlier_detection.html\">Outlier detection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html\">常見資料問題</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 資料品質與穩健性：離群值、雜訊與敏感性實驗\n\n用可控制擾動檢查模型，而不是只靠一份乾淨test。\n\n## 品質檢查與模型韌性\n\n格式正確不代表內容合理：單位錯1000倍、時間錯位、欄位互換、缺失飆升都可能仍是finite數字。邊界驗證先保護schema與明確域值；穩健性實驗再看合理擾動下輸出是否可接受。兩者不能互相取代。\n\n## 離群值不一定要刪\n\n可能是輸入錯誤，也可能真實稀有案例。對所有高誤差點一律刪除，會讓報告偏好容易樣本。可比較RobustScaler、穩健回歸或clip政策，但每項規則需由train／validation決定並保存。依test錯誤特別刪資料會污染評估。\n\n## 擾動矩陣\n\n設幾種事先定義情境：缺失率5%→20%、特徵增加小量測noise、新category、某欄改單位、某來源比例改變。前三者可能是真實可接受輸入，單位／schema錯誤應直接拒絕。記錄效能、警示率、confidence與失敗模式，而不只看程式有沒有crash。\n\n```text\n情境               期望行為\n少量數值null       沿用train imputer並回報缺失監控\n新plan字串         走unknown政策，記錄比例\n數值為Inf／字串    在邊界明確拒絕\n欄位名稱錯誤       拒絕，避免silent feature swap\n```\n\n## 標籤雜訊與分布偏差\n\n少量錯標可讓某些高容量模型追逐noise。修標需要一致規則與獨立審查，不能只改模型錯的樣本。蒐集偏差與未來分布不同則不一定能靠更多同源資料解決，需要更符合部署的樣本及評估設計。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n將同一個raw record的dict鍵順序反轉，預測應相同，因為按schema取值；把數值改字串'5'，本課拒絕，避免含糊型態轉換。解答：明確介面比自動猜測更容易維護。加入一個額外key也拒絕，是否寬鬆接受應由服務契約決定，而不是任意忽略。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Preprocessing](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/preprocessing.html)\n- [Outlier detection](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/outlier_detection.html)\n- [常見資料問題](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "資料品質與穩健性：離群值、雜訊與敏感性實驗", "html": "資料品質與穩健性：離群值、雜訊與敏感性實驗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "品質檢查與模型韌性", "html": "品質檢查與模型韌性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "離群值不一定要刪", "html": "離群值不一定要刪", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "擾動矩陣", "html": "擾動矩陣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "標籤雜訊與分布偏差", "html": "標籤雜訊與分布偏差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "47-incremental", "group": "applications", "title": "增量與大型資料：partial_fit、MiniBatch與串流", "summary": "理解什麼狀態能逐步更新，並防止前處理座標隨資料漂移。", "tags": ["partial_fit", "SGDClassifier", "MiniBatchKMeans", "streaming"], "html": "<h1 id=\"partial_fitminibatch\">增量與大型資料：partial_fit、MiniBatch與串流</h1>\n<p>理解什麼狀態能逐步更新，並防止前處理座標隨資料漂移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fitfit\">批次fit與增量fit</h2>\n<p>大資料不一定能一次放RAM，可以逐批讀取並更新支援partial_fit的模型，如SGDClassifier、部分NB與MiniBatchKMeans。一般RandomForest不是每批partial_fit；warm_start也不等同任意增量學習。先讀指定estimator契約，不依函式名稱想像它會保留所有狀態。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">第一批需要知道類別</h2>\n<p>SGDClassifier第一次partial_fit通常傳完整classes，避免某批只有一類時模型誤以為只有該類。資料順序、learning rate、epoch次數與重複讀取都影響結果；一批一批跑一次不保證等同full fit。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">SGDClassifier</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_data</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">binary_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"n\">scaler</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[:</span><span class=\"mi\">200</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">SGDClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;log_loss&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">start</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">200</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">40</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">partial_fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">scaler</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">transform</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">40</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">40</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">classes</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]))</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">scaler</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">transform</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">200</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">205</span><span class=\"p\">])))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>此示例先固定train scaler；後面的樣本沒有參與它的fit。它是串流介面練習，不是完整時間評估與效能承諾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">前處理狀態不能隨意變座標</h2>\n<p>若每批scaler.partial_fit後改mean／scale，但模型coef仍在舊座標，更新含義會改變。可先做一遍train統計後固定，或設計一致的線上演算法與轉換策略。詞表動態增加也會改feature維度，hashing可維持維度但有碰撞與解釋限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">評估與監控</h2>\n<p>串流可先預測再取得label更新，稱prequential思路；需處理label延遲、時間順序與資料重複。不能更新後再在同一批上報「未見」成績。模型變動時記錄版本／時間點與可回復狀態，不讓自動更新覆蓋唯一可用模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>每批只有單一類，fit重新建模型能累積所有知識嗎？答案：普通fit通常重新估，應用支援的partial_fit並傳classes。若要找更大資料效能，先量I/O與記憶體，不把n_jobs=-1當分散式訓練。大型串流專案需更完整checkpoint與資料offset設計。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/computing/scaling_strategies.html\">Scaling strategies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/sgd.html\">SGD</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 增量與大型資料：partial_fit、MiniBatch與串流\n\n理解什麼狀態能逐步更新，並防止前處理座標隨資料漂移。\n\n## 批次fit與增量fit\n\n大資料不一定能一次放RAM，可以逐批讀取並更新支援partial_fit的模型，如SGDClassifier、部分NB與MiniBatchKMeans。一般RandomForest不是每批partial_fit；warm_start也不等同任意增量學習。先讀指定estimator契約，不依函式名稱想像它會保留所有狀態。\n\n## 第一批需要知道類別\n\nSGDClassifier第一次partial_fit通常傳完整classes，避免某批只有一類時模型誤以為只有該類。資料順序、learning rate、epoch次數與重複讀取都影響結果；一批一批跑一次不保證等同full fit。\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import SGDClassifier\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom course_core import binary_data\nx,y=binary_data()\nscaler=StandardScaler().fit(x[:200])\nmodel=SGDClassifier(loss='log_loss',random_state=7)\nfor start in range(0,200,40):\n    model.partial_fit(scaler.transform(x[start:start+40]),y[start:start+40],classes=np.array([0,1]))\nprint(model.predict(scaler.transform(x[200:205])))\n```\n\n此示例先固定train scaler；後面的樣本沒有參與它的fit。它是串流介面練習，不是完整時間評估與效能承諾。\n\n## 前處理狀態不能隨意變座標\n\n若每批scaler.partial_fit後改mean／scale，但模型coef仍在舊座標，更新含義會改變。可先做一遍train統計後固定，或設計一致的線上演算法與轉換策略。詞表動態增加也會改feature維度，hashing可維持維度但有碰撞與解釋限制。\n\n## 評估與監控\n\n串流可先預測再取得label更新，稱prequential思路；需處理label延遲、時間順序與資料重複。不能更新後再在同一批上報「未見」成績。模型變動時記錄版本／時間點與可回復狀態，不讓自動更新覆蓋唯一可用模型。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n每批只有單一類，fit重新建模型能累積所有知識嗎？答案：普通fit通常重新估，應用支援的partial_fit並傳classes。若要找更大資料效能，先量I/O與記憶體，不把n_jobs=-1當分散式訓練。大型串流專案需更完整checkpoint與資料offset設計。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Scaling strategies](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/computing/scaling_strategies.html)\n- [SGD](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/sgd.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "partial_fitminibatch", "name": "增量與大型資料：partial_fit、MiniBatch與串流", "html": "增量與大型資料：partial_fit、MiniBatch與串流", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "fitfit", "name": "批次fit與增量fit", "html": "批次fit與增量fit", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "第一批需要知道類別", "html": "第一批需要知道類別", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "前處理狀態不能隨意變座標", "html": "前處理狀態不能隨意變座標", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "評估與監控", "html": "評估與監控", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "48-responsible-use", "group": "applications", "title": "分布、隱私與公平：模型進入真實世界的限制", "summary": "將用途、資料權限與錯誤負擔納入評估，不讓分數取代完整決策。", "tags": ["distribution shift", "fairness", "privacy", "limitations"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">分布、隱私與公平：模型進入真實世界的限制</h1>\n<p>將用途、資料權限與錯誤負擔納入評估，不讓分數取代完整決策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">分布改變的不同層次</h2>\n<p>P(X)改變是輸入分布變化，P(Y)改變是類別比例變化，P(Y|X)改變則關係本身改變。這些可同時發生；只監控特徵均值不能證明模型仍準。沒有新label時通常只能發現部分輸入警訊，不能直接確認accuracy。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">資料代表性</h2>\n<p>蒐集到的用戶不一定代表部署人群，歷史決策可能造成label只在被選中的樣本可見。對這份資料做完美CV也不會修正所有抽樣偏差。模型卡應說明來源、排除條件、觀察時間與未驗證群體，避免將合成或方便樣本成績外推。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">隱私與產物</h2>\n<p>資料、預測log、模型檔與解釋輸出都可能含敏感資訊。開發樣本最小化、依權限保存與對外分享；不要將raw特徵或個資無條件放到公開GitHub。模型可能記住細節，壓成weights不代表不再含資料資訊。這裡是資料工程原則，不提供特定法律合規判定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">公平與錯誤成本</h2>\n<p>整體accuracy相同時，不同群體的FP／FN負擔仍可不同。不同公平指標可能衝突，選擇依用途、受影響人與資料限制。先列支持數、label品質與不確定性，再討論調整，不拿一個套件分數保證現實公平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">人工覆核與拒答空間</h2>\n<p>資料缺欄、模型超出適用範圍或confidence不足時，可設明確人工處理／不自動決策。拒絕政策要評估覆蓋率與漏處理成本，也可能集中影響特定群體。把它寫成可測流程，不只是報告最後加一句「謹慎使用」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">一張可以交付的模型卡</h2>\n<p>至少寫明用途、資料來源與時間、訓練／驗證分布、輸入與label定義、支持筆數、已知錯誤群體、人工處理政策，以及模型／schema版本。區分「尚未測試」與「已測試但表現不足」，兩者對使用決策的含義不同。本課產物應明確寫合成資料教學，而不是以客戶欄位名稱暗示已驗證現實用途。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>所有新樣本都屬過去未見群體，但特徵shape完全一致，是否直接沿用舊test分數？答案：不能，需要新分布驗證。若模型輸出拿來拒絕申請，除了分類指標，還需理由、覆核與錯誤修正流程。本課合成專題只教方法與介面，不聲稱適用任何真實高影響決策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_9\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html\">模型評估的前提</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html\">資料使用錯誤</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/model_persistence.html\">模型保存與風險</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 分布、隱私與公平：模型進入真實世界的限制\n\n將用途、資料權限與錯誤負擔納入評估，不讓分數取代完整決策。\n\n## 分布改變的不同層次\n\nP(X)改變是輸入分布變化，P(Y)改變是類別比例變化，P(Y|X)改變則關係本身改變。這些可同時發生；只監控特徵均值不能證明模型仍準。沒有新label時通常只能發現部分輸入警訊，不能直接確認accuracy。\n\n## 資料代表性\n\n蒐集到的用戶不一定代表部署人群，歷史決策可能造成label只在被選中的樣本可見。對這份資料做完美CV也不會修正所有抽樣偏差。模型卡應說明來源、排除條件、觀察時間與未驗證群體，避免將合成或方便樣本成績外推。\n\n## 隱私與產物\n\n資料、預測log、模型檔與解釋輸出都可能含敏感資訊。開發樣本最小化、依權限保存與對外分享；不要將raw特徵或個資無條件放到公開GitHub。模型可能記住細節，壓成weights不代表不再含資料資訊。這裡是資料工程原則，不提供特定法律合規判定。\n\n## 公平與錯誤成本\n\n整體accuracy相同時，不同群體的FP／FN負擔仍可不同。不同公平指標可能衝突，選擇依用途、受影響人與資料限制。先列支持數、label品質與不確定性，再討論調整，不拿一個套件分數保證現實公平。\n\n## 人工覆核與拒答空間\n\n資料缺欄、模型超出適用範圍或confidence不足時，可設明確人工處理／不自動決策。拒絕政策要評估覆蓋率與漏處理成本，也可能集中影響特定群體。把它寫成可測流程，不只是報告最後加一句「謹慎使用」。\n\n## 一張可以交付的模型卡\n\n至少寫明用途、資料來源與時間、訓練／驗證分布、輸入與label定義、支持筆數、已知錯誤群體、人工處理政策，以及模型／schema版本。區分「尚未測試」與「已測試但表現不足」，兩者對使用決策的含義不同。本課產物應明確寫合成資料教學，而不是以客戶欄位名稱暗示已驗證現實用途。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n所有新樣本都屬過去未見群體，但特徵shape完全一致，是否直接沿用舊test分數？答案：不能，需要新分布驗證。若模型輸出拿來拒絕申請，除了分類指標，還需理由、覆核與錯誤修正流程。本課合成專題只教方法與介面，不聲稱適用任何真實高影響決策。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [模型評估的前提](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html)\n- [資料使用錯誤](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html)\n- [模型保存與風險](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/model_persistence.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "分布、隱私與公平：模型進入真實世界的限制", "html": "分布、隱私與公平：模型進入真實世界的限制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "分布改變的不同層次", "html": "分布改變的不同層次", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "資料代表性", "html": "資料代表性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "隱私與產物", "html": "隱私與產物", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "公平與錯誤成本", "html": "公平與錯誤成本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "人工覆核與拒答空間", "html": "人工覆核與拒答空間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "一張可以交付的模型卡", "html": "一張可以交付的模型卡", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_9", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "49-persistence", "group": "engineering", "title": "模型保存與版本：交付完整Pipeline", "summary": "保存前處理、模型、門檻與schema，重啟後用相同原始資料核對。", "tags": ["joblib", "persistence", "version", "artifact", "Pipeline"], "example": "29_persistence.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"pipeline\">模型保存與版本：交付完整Pipeline</h1>\n<p>保存前處理、模型、門檻與schema，重啟後用相同原始資料核對。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">模型產物包含什麼</h2>\n<p>classifier係數不足以重現預測；還需imputer統計、scaler、category詞表、欄位schema、classes順序、threshold、訓練設定與套件版本。完整Pipeline把多項狀態放在一起，但任意外部清理函式與資料定義仍需記錄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">本課產物格式</h2>\n<p>payload有format_version、schema、model、threshold、positive_class、config、versions與selection。保存的是已fit、含前處理的pipeline；推論接受raw record，不讓呼叫者重做一套前處理。資料只用合成名稱與數值，沒有真實客戶資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"joblib\">Joblib與可信來源</h2>\n<p>範例以joblib實際dump／load，預設temporary directory，已有檔案則拒絕覆蓋。Joblib使用pickle相關機制，載入可執行程式，因此只讀自己建立或可信來源的產物。版本檢查在載入之後不能防止惡意unpickle；它只協助相容性，兩者需分清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">跨版本相容性</h2>\n<p>sklearn不保證舊模型在任意新版本可靠載入；保存環境、資料版本與可重訓程式。要升版時在新環境重訓／比對golden records，而非只忽略InconsistentVersionWarning。完整產物包含Python、sklearn、NumPy與SciPy版本；本課推論明確拒絕sklearn版本不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">其他交付形式</h2>\n<p>skops可提供不同的檢查／信任控制，ONNX可對支援模型做跨runtime推論，各需相容套件與目標測試。本課不安裝它們或宣稱已完成runtime驗證。選格式要看是否需要Python物件、自訂轉換與實際服務條件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>保存後換一個Python程序，用相同raw records比predict_proba與labels，不能只檢查檔案存在。解答：第29例會核對scores最大差0，包含新類別與missing樣本。若只保存coef，對新plan或null就無法沿用train規則，這不是重新拼一個StandardScaler就能修復。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/29_persistence.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Round-trip a trusted local full-pipeline artifact, not just coefficients.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">tempfile</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">load_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">predict_records</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">sample_records</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">predict_records</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;artifact&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">sample_records</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">tempfile</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TemporaryDirectory</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">folder</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">folder</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;model.joblib&#39;</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">save_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;artifact&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">predict_records</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">sample_records</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;before&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;after&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;maximum_score_difference&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"nb\">float</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;scores&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">np</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">after</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;scores&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">])))),</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;note&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;joblib can execute code when loading; load only artifacts you trust&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/model_persistence.html\">Model persistence與相容性</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 模型保存與版本：交付完整Pipeline\n\n保存前處理、模型、門檻與schema，重啟後用相同原始資料核對。\n\n## 模型產物包含什麼\n\nclassifier係數不足以重現預測；還需imputer統計、scaler、category詞表、欄位schema、classes順序、threshold、訓練設定與套件版本。完整Pipeline把多項狀態放在一起，但任意外部清理函式與資料定義仍需記錄。\n\n## 本課產物格式\n\npayload有format_version、schema、model、threshold、positive_class、config、versions與selection。保存的是已fit、含前處理的pipeline；推論接受raw record，不讓呼叫者重做一套前處理。資料只用合成名稱與數值，沒有真實客戶資料。\n\n## Joblib與可信來源\n\n範例以joblib實際dump／load，預設temporary directory，已有檔案則拒絕覆蓋。Joblib使用pickle相關機制，載入可執行程式，因此只讀自己建立或可信來源的產物。版本檢查在載入之後不能防止惡意unpickle；它只協助相容性，兩者需分清楚。\n\n## 跨版本相容性\n\nsklearn不保證舊模型在任意新版本可靠載入；保存環境、資料版本與可重訓程式。要升版時在新環境重訓／比對golden records，而非只忽略InconsistentVersionWarning。完整產物包含Python、sklearn、NumPy與SciPy版本；本課推論明確拒絕sklearn版本不同。\n\n## 其他交付形式\n\nskops可提供不同的檢查／信任控制，ONNX可對支援模型做跨runtime推論，各需相容套件與目標測試。本課不安裝它們或宣稱已完成runtime驗證。選格式要看是否需要Python物件、自訂轉換與實際服務條件。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n保存後換一個Python程序，用相同raw records比predict_proba與labels，不能只檢查檔案存在。解答：第29例會核對scores最大差0，包含新類別與missing樣本。若只保存coef，對新plan或null就無法沿用train規則，這不是重新拼一個StandardScaler就能修復。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/29_persistence.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Round-trip a trusted local full-pipeline artifact, not just coefficients.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport tempfile\nfrom course_core import experiment,save_artifact,load_artifact,predict_records,sample_records\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        run=experiment()\n        before=predict_records(run['artifact'],sample_records())\n        with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as folder:\n            path=Path(folder)/'model.joblib'\n            save_artifact(path,run['artifact'])\n            restored=load_artifact(path)\n            after=predict_records(restored,sample_records())\n        result={'before':before,'after':after,'maximum_score_difference':\n                float(np.max(np.abs(np.array(before['scores'])-np.array(after['scores'])))),\n                'note':'joblib can execute code when loading; load only artifacts you trust'}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Model persistence與相容性](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/model_persistence.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "pipeline", "name": "模型保存與版本：交付完整Pipeline", "html": "模型保存與版本：交付完整Pipeline", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "模型產物包含什麼", "html": "模型產物包含什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "本課產物格式", "html": "本課產物格式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "joblib", "name": "Joblib與可信來源", "html": "Joblib與可信來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "跨版本相容性", "html": "跨版本相容性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "其他交付形式", "html": "其他交付形式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "50-inference-contract", "group": "engineering", "title": "推論介面：欄位名稱、機率與決策的一致性", "summary": "把raw資料轉成固定契約，讓相同模型在不同入口有相同行為。", "tags": ["inference", "schema", "classes", "predict_proba", "validation"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">推論介面：欄位名稱、機率與決策的一致性</h1>\n<p>把raw資料轉成固定契約，讓相同模型在不同入口有相同行為。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">先定義輸入</h2>\n<p>完整專題接受records list，每筆恰含tenure_months、weekly_usage、support_tickets、plan。numeric允許有限數字或null，category允許非空字串或null；不接受Inf、數字字串與bool混作數值。這是教學的明確型態契約，真實服務可另定轉換政策並測試。</p>\n<h2 id=\"shape\">欄位順序與shape</h2>\n<p>dict送入的鍵順序可能不同，records_to_array依SCHEMA固定取值，因此反轉鍵插入順序仍相同。若直接list(record.values())，就可能silent feature swap。即使shape都是[N,4]，模型也不知道第一欄其實換成usage。保存名稱並在邊界驗證，才可避免。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">缺失與新類別</h2>\n<p>null→NaN後，沿用train imputer與encoder；new_plan走handle_unknown政策。能產生預測不代表此群已有良好評估，需要監控未知比例與score。若欄位本身有域值限制，例如年資非負，真實schema還應補驗證，本課基本函式沒有聲稱涵蓋所有業務規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">輸出包含什麼</h2>\n<p>scores是positive_class=1對應欄的機率，labels由保存threshold決定。回傳threshold便於追蹤，正式服務另附model_version、schema_version、錯誤狀態與label名稱。不能假設predict_proba[:,1]永遠是你想要的正例；先看classes_。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">predict_records</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">sample_records</span>\n<span class=\"n\">artifact</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">()[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;artifact&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">predict_records</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">artifact</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">sample_records</span><span class=\"p\">()))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>在examples資料夾執行。它是本機推論，不是公開API服務；HTTP認證、流量、觀測與發布屬交付層，要在之後工程課整合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>給同樣值但不同dict鍵順序，預測應相同；新增未知key，本課拒絕。若想允許extra metadata，需明確分欄並測試，不能直接把它塞進features。空list的政策也要明確，本課拒絕以避免含糊空推論。介面品質不只是程式沒有Exception，也包括輸出含義一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html\">Pipeline推論</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LogisticRegression.html\">分類機率與classes</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 推論介面：欄位名稱、機率與決策的一致性\n\n把raw資料轉成固定契約，讓相同模型在不同入口有相同行為。\n\n## 先定義輸入\n\n完整專題接受records list，每筆恰含tenure_months、weekly_usage、support_tickets、plan。numeric允許有限數字或null，category允許非空字串或null；不接受Inf、數字字串與bool混作數值。這是教學的明確型態契約，真實服務可另定轉換政策並測試。\n\n## 欄位順序與shape\n\ndict送入的鍵順序可能不同，records_to_array依SCHEMA固定取值，因此反轉鍵插入順序仍相同。若直接list(record.values())，就可能silent feature swap。即使shape都是[N,4]，模型也不知道第一欄其實換成usage。保存名稱並在邊界驗證，才可避免。\n\n## 缺失與新類別\n\nnull→NaN後，沿用train imputer與encoder；new_plan走handle_unknown政策。能產生預測不代表此群已有良好評估，需要監控未知比例與score。若欄位本身有域值限制，例如年資非負，真實schema還應補驗證，本課基本函式沒有聲稱涵蓋所有業務規則。\n\n## 輸出包含什麼\n\nscores是positive_class=1對應欄的機率，labels由保存threshold決定。回傳threshold便於追蹤，正式服務另附model_version、schema_version、錯誤狀態與label名稱。不能假設predict_proba[:,1]永遠是你想要的正例；先看classes_。\n\n```python\nfrom course_core import experiment,predict_records,sample_records\nartifact=experiment()['artifact']\nprint(predict_records(artifact,sample_records()))\n```\n\n在examples資料夾執行。它是本機推論，不是公開API服務；HTTP認證、流量、觀測與發布屬交付層，要在之後工程課整合。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n給同樣值但不同dict鍵順序，預測應相同；新增未知key，本課拒絕。若想允許extra metadata，需明確分欄並測試，不能直接把它塞進features。空list的政策也要明確，本課拒絕以避免含糊空推論。介面品質不只是程式沒有Exception，也包括輸出含義一致。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Pipeline推論](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html)\n- [分類機率與classes](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LogisticRegression.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "推論介面：欄位名稱、機率與決策的一致性", "html": "推論介面：欄位名稱、機率與決策的一致性", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "先定義輸入", "html": "先定義輸入", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "shape", "name": "欄位順序與shape", "html": "欄位順序與shape", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "缺失與新類別", "html": "缺失與新類別", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "輸出包含什麼", "html": "輸出包含什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "51-performance", "group": "engineering", "title": "效能與資源：稀疏、batch、平行與量測", "summary": "用相同工作量比較延遲與吞吐，避免把資源開關當加速保證。", "tags": ["performance", "sparse", "batch", "n_jobs", "threadpoolctl"], "html": "<h1 id=\"batch\">效能與資源：稀疏、batch、平行與量測</h1>\n<p>用相同工作量比較延遲與吞吐，避免把資源開關當加速保證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">先分解時間</h2>\n<p>解析raw record、前處理、模型運算、序列化與網路各有成本。小模型可能前處理比predict慢；高維文字可能稀疏矩陣轉換佔主體。先量分段與全流程，再決定改模型、批次或資料管線，不只看fit時間。</p>\n<h2 id=\"batch_1\">單筆延遲與batch吞吐</h2>\n<p>一次predict一筆容易重複Python／轉換成本，batch可分攤，但需等待湊批且記憶體增加。比較時同樣筆數、schema、dtype與前處理，記錄暖機、重複分布與p50／p95等。CPU小例可以用perf_counter，避免把第一次import時間當模型推論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dense\">稀疏表示與dense膨脹</h2>\n<p>one-hot或TF-IDF可能百萬欄但每列少量非零。toarray後N×F全部配置可能OOM，with_mean中心化也常不適合。估記憶體需包含indices／indptr等結構與轉換中間量。小課程設sparse_output=False只為容易觀察，不能無條件照搬大型資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">平行的兩層</h2>\n<p>GridSearchCV的n_jobs與森林n_jobs，再加NumPy／BLAS內部threads，可能產生巢狀過量平行。先選外層或內層主要平行，控制threadpool，量實際CPU與RAM。n_jobs=-1使用可用資源，不等於分散式叢集，也不保證小模型比較快。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\"># 在此比較固定小型CPU工作，避免BLAS執行緒噪音。</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">pass</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>本課入口對小工作限制threads，這是測試條件，不是所有生產模型最佳設定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>方案B速度快一倍但只處理半筆數，不能稱相同工作加速。解答：固定資料、feature、預測介面與結果一致性，再記吞吐及資源。若要模型壓縮或ONNX，先在目標runtime驗證數值與任務品質，再量速度；本課沒有憑套件名稱報未測倍數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/computing/computational_performance.html\">Computational performance</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/computing/parallelism.html\">Parallelism</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 效能與資源：稀疏、batch、平行與量測\n\n用相同工作量比較延遲與吞吐，避免把資源開關當加速保證。\n\n## 先分解時間\n\n解析raw record、前處理、模型運算、序列化與網路各有成本。小模型可能前處理比predict慢；高維文字可能稀疏矩陣轉換佔主體。先量分段與全流程，再決定改模型、批次或資料管線，不只看fit時間。\n\n## 單筆延遲與batch吞吐\n\n一次predict一筆容易重複Python／轉換成本，batch可分攤，但需等待湊批且記憶體增加。比較時同樣筆數、schema、dtype與前處理，記錄暖機、重複分布與p50／p95等。CPU小例可以用perf_counter，避免把第一次import時間當模型推論。\n\n## 稀疏表示與dense膨脹\n\none-hot或TF-IDF可能百萬欄但每列少量非零。toarray後N×F全部配置可能OOM，with_mean中心化也常不適合。估記憶體需包含indices／indptr等結構與轉換中間量。小課程設sparse_output=False只為容易觀察，不能無條件照搬大型資料。\n\n## 平行的兩層\n\nGridSearchCV的n_jobs與森林n_jobs，再加NumPy／BLAS內部threads，可能產生巢狀過量平行。先選外層或內層主要平行，控制threadpool，量實際CPU與RAM。n_jobs=-1使用可用資源，不等於分散式叢集，也不保證小模型比較快。\n\n```python\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nwith threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n    # 在此比較固定小型CPU工作，避免BLAS執行緒噪音。\n    pass\n```\n\n本課入口對小工作限制threads，這是測試條件，不是所有生產模型最佳設定。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n方案B速度快一倍但只處理半筆數，不能稱相同工作加速。解答：固定資料、feature、預測介面與結果一致性，再記吞吐及資源。若要模型壓縮或ONNX，先在目標runtime驗證數值與任務品質，再量速度；本課沒有憑套件名稱報未測倍數。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Computational performance](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/computing/computational_performance.html)\n- [Parallelism](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/computing/parallelism.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "batch", "name": "效能與資源：稀疏、batch、平行與量測", "html": "效能與資源：稀疏、batch、平行與量測", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "先分解時間", "html": "先分解時間", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "batch_1", "name": "單筆延遲與batch吞吐", "html": "單筆延遲與batch吞吐", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "dense", "name": "稀疏表示與dense膨脹", "html": "稀疏表示與dense膨脹", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "平行的兩層", "html": "平行的兩層", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "52-monitoring", "group": "engineering", "title": "實驗、監控與重訓：讓結果有完整脈絡", "summary": "記錄選擇歷程，監控資料與任務品質，設計可回復的更新流程。", "tags": ["experiment tracking", "monitoring", "drift", "retraining"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">實驗、監控與重訓：讓結果有完整脈絡</h1>\n<p>記錄選擇歷程，監控資料與任務品質，設計可回復的更新流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"run\">每個run保留什麼</h2>\n<p>問題與label定義、資料版本、split／group／time、特徵規則、候選與預算、seed、環境、CV結果、threshold來源、最終test及失敗例。只存best_score會隱藏試驗數與偏差。資料與模型hash可識別產物，但hash不能替代可重建的來源與規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">監控輸入與輸出</h2>\n<p>schema錯誤、missing／unknown率、特徵分位數、score分布、接受率、延遲與錯誤。與訓練／已驗證基線比較，設有意義視窗與樣本下限；不是任何小差異就自動重訓。人口組成、業務活動與資料管線都可能造成變化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"label\">有label後才看得到的品質</h2>\n<p>accuracy、recall、校準等需真值，可能延遲數週。監控需按預測時間與標籤到齊窗計算，避免未成熟負例讓recall／event rate失真。若只有被人工選中樣本得到label，也有選擇偏差，不能當整體真實表現。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">重訓不是自動修復</h2>\n<p>先判斷是資料壞、schema改、樣本比例變還是關係改；若資料壞，重訓可能學錯。準備新資料版本，以時間／群組一致的驗證比較challenger，重新校準與選threshold，再保存完整artifact與回復路徑。不直接覆蓋唯一模型。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"text\"><pre><span></span><code>發現警訊 → 查資料與label時效 → 固定新資料版本\n→ 重跑完整選模／決策流程 → 獨立驗收\n→ 保存新模型與舊版 → 有條件發布與監控\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">讓警訊附帶樣本量與下一步</h2>\n<p>若視窗只有5筆，其中1筆未知類別就是20%；與10000筆中的2000筆同為20%，證據強度不同。報告比例時一起列分子、分母、視窗時間與基線，避免因小視窗波動頻繁啟動昂貴重訓。資料遲到也可能讓某天視窗尚未完整，先確認蒐集狀態。</p>\n<p>警訊應連到可執行處置，例如schema失效先檢查資料管線，unknown上升先查新來源，label成熟後的品質下降才進一步比較模型。每次處理留下原因與結果，使監控成為可追蹤決策，而不只是多一張圖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>unknown plan從1%變30%，但predict全成功，是否不用處理？答案：需要查來源與新群體品質。某週正例率下降，可能是label尚未到齊，不立即認定模型變好。把監控數字連回時間、支持數與資料契約，才知道警訊意味什麼。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/model_persistence.html\">模型產物與重建metadata</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html\">資料常見錯誤</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 實驗、監控與重訓：讓結果有完整脈絡\n\n記錄選擇歷程，監控資料與任務品質，設計可回復的更新流程。\n\n## 每個run保留什麼\n\n問題與label定義、資料版本、split／group／time、特徵規則、候選與預算、seed、環境、CV結果、threshold來源、最終test及失敗例。只存best_score會隱藏試驗數與偏差。資料與模型hash可識別產物，但hash不能替代可重建的來源與規則。\n\n## 監控輸入與輸出\n\nschema錯誤、missing／unknown率、特徵分位數、score分布、接受率、延遲與錯誤。與訓練／已驗證基線比較，設有意義視窗與樣本下限；不是任何小差異就自動重訓。人口組成、業務活動與資料管線都可能造成變化。\n\n## 有label後才看得到的品質\n\naccuracy、recall、校準等需真值，可能延遲數週。監控需按預測時間與標籤到齊窗計算，避免未成熟負例讓recall／event rate失真。若只有被人工選中樣本得到label，也有選擇偏差，不能當整體真實表現。\n\n## 重訓不是自動修復\n\n先判斷是資料壞、schema改、樣本比例變還是關係改；若資料壞，重訓可能學錯。準備新資料版本，以時間／群組一致的驗證比較challenger，重新校準與選threshold，再保存完整artifact與回復路徑。不直接覆蓋唯一模型。\n\n```text\n發現警訊 → 查資料與label時效 → 固定新資料版本\n→ 重跑完整選模／決策流程 → 獨立驗收\n→ 保存新模型與舊版 → 有條件發布與監控\n```\n\n## 讓警訊附帶樣本量與下一步\n\n若視窗只有5筆，其中1筆未知類別就是20%；與10000筆中的2000筆同為20%，證據強度不同。報告比例時一起列分子、分母、視窗時間與基線，避免因小視窗波動頻繁啟動昂貴重訓。資料遲到也可能讓某天視窗尚未完整，先確認蒐集狀態。\n\n警訊應連到可執行處置，例如schema失效先檢查資料管線，unknown上升先查新來源，label成熟後的品質下降才進一步比較模型。每次處理留下原因與結果，使監控成為可追蹤決策，而不只是多一張圖。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nunknown plan從1%變30%，但predict全成功，是否不用處理？答案：需要查來源與新群體品質。某週正例率下降，可能是label尚未到齊，不立即認定模型變好。把監控數字連回時間、支持數與資料契約，才知道警訊意味什麼。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [模型產物與重建metadata](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/model_persistence.html)\n- [資料常見錯誤](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "實驗、監控與重訓：讓結果有完整脈絡", "html": "實驗、監控與重訓：讓結果有完整脈絡", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "run", "name": "每個run保留什麼", "html": "每個run保留什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "監控輸入與輸出", "html": "監控輸入與輸出", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "label", "name": "有label後才看得到的品質", "html": "有label後才看得到的品質", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "重訓不是自動修復", "html": "重訓不是自動修復", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "讓警訊附帶樣本量與下一步", "html": "讓警訊附帶樣本量與下一步", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "53-classification-project", "group": "engineering", "title": "完整分類專題：混合欄位、CV、門檻與最終測試", "summary": "沿著一條真實執行的離線流程，核對每個資料角色與產物。", "tags": ["capstone", "classification", "GridSearchCV", "threshold", "artifact"], "example": "30_capstone.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"cv\">完整分類專題：混合欄位、CV、門檻與最終測試</h1>\n<p>沿著一條真實執行的離線流程，核對每個資料角色與產物。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">專題驗收條件</h2>\n<p>400筆合成資料，3個數值欄與1個類別欄，含missing。固定240train、80val、80test。所有前處理只fit train；train內3折搜尋C；用獨立val分數選5FN+FP成本門檻；模型與門檻固定後才評估test。最後實際保存、載入，對raw records推論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">如何執行</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">machine-learning</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">30_capstone</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span>\n<span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">machine-learning</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">30_capstone</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-output</span> <span class=\"n\">runs</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">ml</span><span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">001</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">joblib</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>未指定output使用temporary directory並清除；指定新檔名才永久保存。已有檔案會拒絕覆蓋。此課程沒有連外服務、模型下載或真實客戶資料，不需API Key。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">從入口追進核心</h2>\n<p>Config.validate→make_mixed_data→split_indices→mixed_pipeline→GridSearchCV；接著probability查classes→select_threshold→binary_metrics；之後save_artifact／load_artifact→predict_records。共用模組完整附在下載包，不藏在外部API。讀者可追到每個fit究竟看哪些索引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">輸出怎麼讀</h2>\n<p>training_selection含train CV AP與C，以及validation成本／threshold；final_test是固定方案一次評估。這兩份score來自不同資料與用途，不要求小數相同。data明確標示synthetic；即使test較高，也不能外推到真實事件。程式沒有在test挑threshold。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">轉成自己的資料</h2>\n<p>替換資料載入，先定raw schema、label時間、group／time切分與缺失政策；保留原數值測試作對照。C搜尋空間與成本依任務重設，在開test前固定。若重fit train+val，原validation已參與模型weights，threshold與校準也需重新設計，不直接沿用舊分數而宣稱同樣保證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>改變FN成本，應只在val重新選決策並記錄；不要拿同一test反覆評比後挑最好。把record欄位順序反轉應不變，數值改Inf應拒絕，new_plan應依unknown政策可推論。解答：這些是可測工程契約，讓「跑出模型」進一步成為可重現流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python machine-learning/examples/30_capstone.py</code>。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Full mixed-table project: training CV, validation threshold, one final test.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">numpy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">np</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">threadpoolctl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">argparse</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"nn\">tempfile</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">save_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">load_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">predict_records</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">sample_records</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">threadpool_limits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">limits</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">argparse</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ArgumentParser</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">description</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"vm\">__doc__</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_argument</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;--output&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parse_args</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span> <span class=\"ow\">and</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exists</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;Choose a new output filename&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">save_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;artifact&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">saved</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">tempfile</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TemporaryDirectory</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">folder</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">folder</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;model.joblib&#39;</span>\n                <span class=\"n\">save_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;artifact&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n                <span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_artifact</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">saved</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;temporary directory, removed after demonstration&#39;</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;versions&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;versions&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;splits&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;split_sizes&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;training_selection&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;selection&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;final_test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;test&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;new_records&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">predict_records</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">sample_records</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;saved_to&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">saved</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"s1\">&#39;data&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;data&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">emit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_8\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html\">Pipeline</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/classification_threshold.html\">Threshold tuning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/model_persistence.html\">Model persistence</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 完整分類專題：混合欄位、CV、門檻與最終測試\n\n沿著一條真實執行的離線流程，核對每個資料角色與產物。\n\n## 專題驗收條件\n\n400筆合成資料，3個數值欄與1個類別欄，含missing。固定240train、80val、80test。所有前處理只fit train；train內3折搜尋C；用獨立val分數選5FN+FP成本門檻；模型與門檻固定後才評估test。最後實際保存、載入，對raw records推論。\n\n## 如何執行\n\n```powershell\npython machine-learning/examples/30_capstone.py\npython machine-learning/examples/30_capstone.py --output runs/ml-001/model.joblib\n```\n\n未指定output使用temporary directory並清除；指定新檔名才永久保存。已有檔案會拒絕覆蓋。此課程沒有連外服務、模型下載或真實客戶資料，不需API Key。\n\n## 從入口追進核心\n\nConfig.validate→make_mixed_data→split_indices→mixed_pipeline→GridSearchCV；接著probability查classes→select_threshold→binary_metrics；之後save_artifact／load_artifact→predict_records。共用模組完整附在下載包，不藏在外部API。讀者可追到每個fit究竟看哪些索引。\n\n## 輸出怎麼讀\n\ntraining_selection含train CV AP與C，以及validation成本／threshold；final_test是固定方案一次評估。這兩份score來自不同資料與用途，不要求小數相同。data明確標示synthetic；即使test較高，也不能外推到真實事件。程式沒有在test挑threshold。\n\n## 轉成自己的資料\n\n替換資料載入，先定raw schema、label時間、group／time切分與缺失政策；保留原數值測試作對照。C搜尋空間與成本依任務重設，在開test前固定。若重fit train+val，原validation已參與模型weights，threshold與校準也需重新設計，不直接沿用舊分數而宣稱同樣保證。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n改變FN成本，應只在val重新選決策並記錄；不要拿同一test反覆評比後挑最好。把record欄位順序反轉應不變，數值改Inf應拒絕，new_plan應依unknown政策可推論。解答：這些是可測工程契約，讓「跑出模型」進一步成為可重現流程。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python machine-learning/examples/30_capstone.py`。保留完整範例包，內含共用實作、固定資料、需求檔與測試。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Full mixed-table project: training CV, validation threshold, one final test.\"\"\"\nimport numpy as np\nfrom threadpoolctl import threadpool_limits\nfrom course_core import emit\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport argparse,tempfile\nfrom course_core import Config,experiment,save_artifact,load_artifact,predict_records,sample_records\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    with threadpool_limits(limits=1):\n        parser=argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__)\n        parser.add_argument('--output',type=Path)\n        args=parser.parse_args(argv)\n        if args.output and args.output.exists():\n            parser.error('Choose a new output filename')\n        run=experiment(Config())\n        if args.output:\n            save_artifact(args.output,run['artifact'])\n            restored=load_artifact(args.output)\n            saved=str(args.output)\n        else:\n            with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as folder:\n                path=Path(folder)/'model.joblib'\n                save_artifact(path,run['artifact'])\n                restored=load_artifact(path)\n            saved='temporary directory, removed after demonstration'\n        result={'versions':restored['versions'],'splits':run['split_sizes'],\n                'training_selection':restored['selection'],'final_test':run['test'],\n                'new_records':predict_records(restored,sample_records()),'saved_to':saved,\n                'data':restored['data']}\n    return emit(result)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Pipeline](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html)\n- [Threshold tuning](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/classification_threshold.html)\n- [Model persistence](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/model_persistence.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "cv", "name": "完整分類專題：混合欄位、CV、門檻與最終測試", "html": "完整分類專題：混合欄位、CV、門檻與最終測試", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "專題驗收條件", "html": "專題驗收條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "如何執行", "html": "如何執行", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "從入口追進核心", "html": "從入口追進核心", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "輸出怎麼讀", "html": "輸出怎麼讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "轉成自己的資料", "html": "轉成自己的資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "54-regression-project", "group": "engineering", "title": "完整回歸專題：基準、搜尋與原單位評估", "summary": "將分類流程的資料邊界延伸到連續目標，核對負scoring與殘差。", "tags": ["regression project", "Ridge", "DummyRegressor", "MAE", "RMSE"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">完整回歸專題：基準、搜尋與原單位評估</h1>\n<p>將分類流程的資料邊界延伸到連續目標，核對負scoring與殘差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">任務與基準</h2>\n<p>使用make_regression產生5特徵、3個有訊號的連續target，加固定noise。先切train/test，train內CV選Ridge alpha；dummy以train mean預測。這是資料生成已知的完整示範，不模擬特定金額／醫療結果，誤差單位就是合成target單位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">可執行流程</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.datasets</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_regression</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.model_selection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">train_test_split</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">GridSearchCV</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">KFold</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.linear_model</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Ridge</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.dummy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">DummyRegressor</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.metrics</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">mean_absolute_error</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">root_mean_squared_error</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_regression</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_samples</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">240</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_features</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_informative</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">noise</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">train_test_split</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">test_size</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.25</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">search</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">GridSearchCV</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">Ridge</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;ridge__alpha&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">10.</span><span class=\"p\">]},</span><span class=\"n\">scoring</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;neg_mean_absolute_error&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">cv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">KFold</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">shuffle</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">n_jobs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">baseline</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">DummyRegressor</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">strategy</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;mean&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">search</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">search</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">best_params_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">search</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">best_score_</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mean_absolute_error</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">root_mean_squared_error</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;dummy MAE&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">mean_absolute_error</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">baseline</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">對照分類與回歸</h2>\n<p>回歸不使用stratify=y的每個連續值，也不以classification confusion計分。MAE scoring在搜尋時取負號；報告轉回正誤差。若有時間／group仍使用相符split，不能因目標連續就忽略依賴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">殘差與產物</h2>\n<p>列signed residual、誤差分位數、特徵／子群切片與極端值。若target有轉換，在原單位評估並保存inverse規則。模型保存整條scaler+Ridge，加schema、版本與選參流程，沿用第49章的信任與相容性原則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>把noise由8改40，RMSE通常變大，但不同seed有限樣本不必完全單調；它描述問題難度變化，不是Ridge版本退步。解答：比較時固定同一資料，若要研究noise影響，設多seed與明確實驗。若val出現y=0，不直接使用MAPE而不解釋，改合適單位誤差與域值策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#regression-metrics\">Regression metrics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#ridge-regression-and-classification\">Ridge</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 完整回歸專題：基準、搜尋與原單位評估\n\n將分類流程的資料邊界延伸到連續目標，核對負scoring與殘差。\n\n## 任務與基準\n\n使用make_regression產生5特徵、3個有訊號的連續target，加固定noise。先切train/test，train內CV選Ridge alpha；dummy以train mean預測。這是資料生成已知的完整示範，不模擬特定金額／醫療結果，誤差單位就是合成target單位。\n\n## 可執行流程\n\n```python\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_regression\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split,GridSearchCV,KFold\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge\nfrom sklearn.dummy import DummyRegressor\nfrom sklearn.metrics import mean_absolute_error,root_mean_squared_error\nx,y=make_regression(n_samples=240,n_features=5,n_informative=3,noise=8,random_state=7)\na,b,c,d=train_test_split(x,y,test_size=.25,random_state=7)\nsearch=GridSearchCV(make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),Ridge()),\n    {'ridge__alpha':[.1,1.,10.]},scoring='neg_mean_absolute_error',\n    cv=KFold(3,shuffle=True,random_state=7),n_jobs=1).fit(a,c)\nbaseline=DummyRegressor(strategy='mean').fit(a,c)\nprediction=search.predict(b)\nprint(search.best_params_,-search.best_score_)\nprint(mean_absolute_error(d,prediction),root_mean_squared_error(d,prediction))\nprint('dummy MAE',mean_absolute_error(d,baseline.predict(b)))\n```\n\n## 對照分類與回歸\n\n回歸不使用stratify=y的每個連續值，也不以classification confusion計分。MAE scoring在搜尋時取負號；報告轉回正誤差。若有時間／group仍使用相符split，不能因目標連續就忽略依賴。\n\n## 殘差與產物\n\n列signed residual、誤差分位數、特徵／子群切片與極端值。若target有轉換，在原單位評估並保存inverse規則。模型保存整條scaler+Ridge，加schema、版本與選參流程，沿用第49章的信任與相容性原則。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n把noise由8改40，RMSE通常變大，但不同seed有限樣本不必完全單調；它描述問題難度變化，不是Ridge版本退步。解答：比較時固定同一資料，若要研究noise影響，設多seed與明確實驗。若val出現y=0，不直接使用MAPE而不解釋，改合適單位誤差與域值策略。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Regression metrics](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/model_evaluation.html#regression-metrics)\n- [Ridge](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/linear_model.html#ridge-regression-and-classification)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "完整回歸專題：基準、搜尋與原單位評估", "html": "完整回歸專題：基準、搜尋與原單位評估", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "任務與基準", "html": "任務與基準", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "可執行流程", "html": "可執行流程", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "對照分類與回歸", "html": "對照分類與回歸", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "殘差與產物", "html": "殘差與產物", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "55-clustering-project", "group": "next", "title": "完整分群專題：表示、穩定性與新樣本指派", "summary": "在無label使用情境下，定義可以驗收的結構與解讀。", "tags": ["clustering project", "KMeans", "silhouette", "stability"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">完整分群專題：表示、穩定性與新樣本指派</h1>\n<p>在無label使用情境下，定義可以驗收的結構與解讀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">探索任務先有目的</h2>\n<p>若想整理使用模式，先決定特徵窗、尺度與群組用途；若只是把資料切成固定數目管理，K的選擇可能包含業務容量。分群不是自動發現真實身份。用合成三團點作可知答案驗證，再學如何對真實無標籤資料保持謹慎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">可執行專題骨架</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.datasets</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_blobs</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.pipeline</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.preprocessing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.cluster</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">KMeans</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sklearn.metrics</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">silhouette_score</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">adjusted_rand_score</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">truth</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_blobs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n_samples</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">120</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">centers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_features</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">cluster_std</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">make_pipeline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">StandardScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">KMeans</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">n_init</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">random_state</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fit_predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">transform</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;silhouette&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">silhouette_score</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;synthetic truth ARI&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">adjusted_rand_score</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">truth</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;new-point groups&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">],[</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">]]))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>silhouette必須使用與模型同一轉換空間。ARI只因合成資料有生成真值，真實資料不能憑空取得。新點group ID不等於可讀名稱，解讀需要另看中心與原單位統計。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kseed\">K與seed的比較</h2>\n<p>固定資料表示，試合理K與多初始化，看inertia、silhouette、群大小、seed／重抽穩定性和用途。不要只挑視覺上最分離的一張；PCA／t-SNE投影也可能改變近鄰。若需要兩次結果逐群比較，用能處理label置換的方法或明確對齊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">保存與推論</h2>\n<p>保存scaler與centers整條pipeline，對新點最近中心指派；另看距離是否遠離已見區域。新資料大量離中心很遠時，不應只因predict仍回0..K-1就當正常。監控分布與群占比，重新fit會使群ID重新排列，需要版本與對齊策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>模型A與B只是label0/1交換，直接accuracy可能0，但ARI為1。解答：分群編號任意。若某群很小且silhouette高，也可能是孤立點被獨立出來，不等於有用群體。最後寫一份群組卡：特徵、尺度、K、限制、可否新樣本predict及尚未驗證的用途。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/clustering.html#clustering-performance-evaluation\">Clustering evaluation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html\">Pipeline</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 完整分群專題：表示、穩定性與新樣本指派\n\n在無label使用情境下，定義可以驗收的結構與解讀。\n\n## 探索任務先有目的\n\n若想整理使用模式，先決定特徵窗、尺度與群組用途；若只是把資料切成固定數目管理，K的選擇可能包含業務容量。分群不是自動發現真實身份。用合成三團點作可知答案驗證，再學如何對真實無標籤資料保持謹慎。\n\n## 可執行專題骨架\n\n```python\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_blobs\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\nfrom sklearn.cluster import KMeans\nfrom sklearn.metrics import silhouette_score,adjusted_rand_score\nx,truth=make_blobs(n_samples=120,centers=3,n_features=2,cluster_std=.5,random_state=7)\nmodel=make_pipeline(StandardScaler(),KMeans(3,n_init=10,random_state=7))\nlabels=model.fit_predict(x)\nz=model[0].transform(x)\nprint('silhouette',silhouette_score(z,labels))\nprint('synthetic truth ARI',adjusted_rand_score(truth,labels))\nprint('new-point groups',model.predict([[0.,0.],[3.,3.]]))\n```\n\nsilhouette必須使用與模型同一轉換空間。ARI只因合成資料有生成真值，真實資料不能憑空取得。新點group ID不等於可讀名稱，解讀需要另看中心與原單位統計。\n\n## K與seed的比較\n\n固定資料表示，試合理K與多初始化，看inertia、silhouette、群大小、seed／重抽穩定性和用途。不要只挑視覺上最分離的一張；PCA／t-SNE投影也可能改變近鄰。若需要兩次結果逐群比較，用能處理label置換的方法或明確對齊。\n\n## 保存與推論\n\n保存scaler與centers整條pipeline，對新點最近中心指派；另看距離是否遠離已見區域。新資料大量離中心很遠時，不應只因predict仍回0..K-1就當正常。監控分布與群占比，重新fit會使群ID重新排列，需要版本與對齊策略。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n模型A與B只是label0/1交換，直接accuracy可能0，但ARI為1。解答：分群編號任意。若某群很小且silhouette高，也可能是孤立點被獨立出來，不等於有用群體。最後寫一份群組卡：特徵、尺度、K、限制、可否新樣本predict及尚未驗證的用途。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Clustering evaluation](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/clustering.html#clustering-performance-evaluation)\n- [Pipeline](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "完整分群專題：表示、穩定性與新樣本指派", "html": "完整分群專題：表示、穩定性與新樣本指派", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "探索任務先有目的", "html": "探索任務先有目的", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "可執行專題骨架", "html": "可執行專題骨架", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "kseed", "name": "K與seed的比較", "html": "K與seed的比較", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "保存與推論", "html": "保存與推論", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "56-model-choice", "group": "next", "title": "如何選模型：從問題、資料與限制走向候選", "summary": "用可解釋的選擇順序縮小範圍，再由驗證而非流行度決定。", "tags": ["estimator selection", "model comparison", "model map"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">如何選模型：從問題、資料與限制走向候選</h1>\n<p>用可解釋的選擇順序縮小範圍，再由驗證而非流行度決定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">第一個選擇是資料與任務</h2>\n<p>分類／回歸／分群／表示／異常要先確定；小表格、高維文字、時間依賴與稀有事件也有不同起點。資料量、標籤品質、推論延遲、缺失與新類別、可解釋與維護限制，一起決定候選。不要因模型名字新就跳過dummy與簡單基準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">一份可用的候選表</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情境</th>\n<th>起點</th>\n<th>檢查重點</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>一般表格分類</td>\n<td>Logistic、森林、HistGB</td>\n<td>split、類別、校準、成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>連續回歸</td>\n<td>Dummy、Ridge、樹系</td>\n<td>單位、殘差、target域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高維稀疏文字</td>\n<td>NB、線性SVM／Logistic</td>\n<td>詞表、群組洩漏、記憶體</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小中型非線性</td>\n<td>RBF SVM、樹集成</td>\n<td>尺度、C/gamma、成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>緊密群結構</td>\n<td>KMeans</td>\n<td>K、尺度、初始化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非球形／密度</td>\n<td>DBSCAN／HDBSCAN</td>\n<td>參數、noise、新樣本策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>壓縮／探索</td>\n<td>PCA與適當流形方法</td>\n<td>變異、投影失真、transform</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>無完整事件label</td>\n<td>IsolationForest等</td>\n<td>正常定義、分數方向、驗證</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">其他方法的延伸位置</h2>\n<p>Gaussian Process在小資料與適當kernel下提供機率式建模，但計算與假設需專門研究；LDA／QDA依類別條件分布做判別；semi-supervised如label propagation利用未標註結構，需類別鄰域假設。它們是延伸候選，不因本課沒有逐API展開就可以忽略驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">篩選流程</h2>\n<p>先用少量合理候選、相同train CV與適合metric，記錄資源；對明顯無效者查資料與假設，對有希望者做有限搜尋；固定方案、校準與threshold，再final test。若需要重試，記錄新的資料使用角色與後續驗證，而非無止境盯同一test。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>高維TF-IDF有20萬欄，先試大型RBF SVM未必合理；解答：線性或NB便宜基準，避免dense化。每筆只40個表格欄位且資料量中等，深度模型不一定優於強樹系；比較以相同流程為準。模型選擇是實驗與限制的結果，不是排行榜名稱記憶題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/machine_learning_map.html\">Estimator選擇圖</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/supervised_learning.html\">Supervised learning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/semi_supervised.html\">Semi-supervised</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 如何選模型：從問題、資料與限制走向候選\n\n用可解釋的選擇順序縮小範圍，再由驗證而非流行度決定。\n\n## 第一個選擇是資料與任務\n\n分類／回歸／分群／表示／異常要先確定；小表格、高維文字、時間依賴與稀有事件也有不同起點。資料量、標籤品質、推論延遲、缺失與新類別、可解釋與維護限制，一起決定候選。不要因模型名字新就跳過dummy與簡單基準。\n\n## 一份可用的候選表\n\n| 情境 | 起點 | 檢查重點 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 一般表格分類 | Logistic、森林、HistGB | split、類別、校準、成本 |\n| 連續回歸 | Dummy、Ridge、樹系 | 單位、殘差、target域 |\n| 高維稀疏文字 | NB、線性SVM／Logistic | 詞表、群組洩漏、記憶體 |\n| 小中型非線性 | RBF SVM、樹集成 | 尺度、C/gamma、成本 |\n| 緊密群結構 | KMeans | K、尺度、初始化 |\n| 非球形／密度 | DBSCAN／HDBSCAN | 參數、noise、新樣本策略 |\n| 壓縮／探索 | PCA與適當流形方法 | 變異、投影失真、transform |\n| 無完整事件label | IsolationForest等 | 正常定義、分數方向、驗證 |\n\n## 其他方法的延伸位置\n\nGaussian Process在小資料與適當kernel下提供機率式建模，但計算與假設需專門研究；LDA／QDA依類別條件分布做判別；semi-supervised如label propagation利用未標註結構，需類別鄰域假設。它們是延伸候選，不因本課沒有逐API展開就可以忽略驗證。\n\n## 篩選流程\n\n先用少量合理候選、相同train CV與適合metric，記錄資源；對明顯無效者查資料與假設，對有希望者做有限搜尋；固定方案、校準與threshold，再final test。若需要重試，記錄新的資料使用角色與後續驗證，而非無止境盯同一test。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n高維TF-IDF有20萬欄，先試大型RBF SVM未必合理；解答：線性或NB便宜基準，避免dense化。每筆只40個表格欄位且資料量中等，深度模型不一定優於強樹系；比較以相同流程為準。模型選擇是實驗與限制的結果，不是排行榜名稱記憶題。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Estimator選擇圖](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/machine_learning_map.html)\n- [Supervised learning](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/supervised_learning.html)\n- [Semi-supervised](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/semi_supervised.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "如何選模型：從問題、資料與限制走向候選", "html": "如何選模型：從問題、資料與限制走向候選", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "第一個選擇是資料與任務", "html": "第一個選擇是資料與任務", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "一份可用的候選表", "html": "一份可用的候選表", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "其他方法的延伸位置", "html": "其他方法的延伸位置", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "篩選流程", "html": "篩選流程", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "57-modern-api", "group": "next", "title": "1.9版API與遷移：新教材如何避免舊寫法落差", "summary": "整理本課實際使用的現行介面，以及更新時需要重新驗證的邊界。", "tags": ["1.9.1", "migration", "l1_ratio", "FrozenEstimator", "metadata routing"], "html": "<h1 id=\"19api\">1.9版API與遷移：新教材如何避免舊寫法落差</h1>\n<p>整理本課實際使用的現行介面，以及更新時需要重新驗證的邊界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">本課版本基準</h2>\n<p>2026-10-30交叉查核官方release、PyPI與1.9文件，以scikit-learn1.9.1製作。固定版本是為了讓你重現「撰寫當天的最新版」，不是讓內容永久停留而不更新；下一次修訂重新查核破壞性變更、依賴、範例與模型產物。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">幾個容易照舊文章寫錯的地方</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求</th>\n<th>本課目前主線</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>OneHot輸出稀疏與否</td>\n<td>sparse_output</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RMSE</td>\n<td>root_mean_squared_error</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Logistic正則化</td>\n<td>C與l1_ratio，solver相容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>t-SNE迭代預算</td>\n<td>max_iter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已fit模型校準</td>\n<td>依FrozenEstimator與獨立資料契約</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Threshold選擇</td>\n<td>TunedThresholdClassifierCV或獨立val搜尋</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>新名稱不是只要搜尋取代；例如正則化的solver支援、prefit模型資料角色與門檻調整，都需要重新檢查語意。30個入口已在1.9.1實際執行，不是僅改標題的版本號。</p>\n<h2 id=\"metadata-routingsample-weight\">Metadata routing與sample weight</h2>\n<p>groups、sample_weight等metadata不是一般X欄位。若啟用routing，依目前meta-estimator／pipeline的request傳遞到正確步驟；有些參數要透過params路徑送入CV，不能照舊介面硬塞。1.9.1包含相關修正，升版時尤其要測加權流程是否真的抵達子模型，而非只看fit沒報錯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"callbacks\">Callbacks與實驗功能</h2>\n<p>1.9文件有callback系統與相關修正，能支援訓練觀察等用途，但不是所有estimator、後端與用法都相同。主線用最基本穩定fit／CV，進階功能在讀官方API、確認支援後加入；Array API等標示實驗狀態的能力也需明確分別標示，不當作全部硬體已驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">更新檢查順序</h2>\n<p>先新venv安裝、跑指標手算、前處理隔離、全部入口與完整專題；再比已fit產物／重訓方案的golden records，檢查校準與threshold；同步原稿、requirements、README、下載ZIP與日期。舊模型檔不保證能直接在新環境載入，保留重訓材料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>把舊Logistic的penalty='l1'直接換l1_ratio=1，卻仍用不支援solver是否足夠？答案：不足，需配相容solver並測收斂。只有更名不代表完整遷移。若新版預設改變，明確指定本課有意採用的參數，並區分保留舊行為與採用新策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/whats_new/v1.9.html\">1.9更新紀錄</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LogisticRegression.html\">Logistic API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/metadata_routing.html\">Metadata routing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.frozen.FrozenEstimator.html\">FrozenEstimator</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 1.9版API與遷移：新教材如何避免舊寫法落差\n\n整理本課實際使用的現行介面，以及更新時需要重新驗證的邊界。\n\n## 本課版本基準\n\n2026-10-30交叉查核官方release、PyPI與1.9文件，以scikit-learn1.9.1製作。固定版本是為了讓你重現「撰寫當天的最新版」，不是讓內容永久停留而不更新；下一次修訂重新查核破壞性變更、依賴、範例與模型產物。\n\n## 幾個容易照舊文章寫錯的地方\n\n| 需求 | 本課目前主線 |\n| --- | --- |\n| OneHot輸出稀疏與否 | sparse_output |\n| RMSE | root_mean_squared_error |\n| Logistic正則化 | C與l1_ratio，solver相容 |\n| t-SNE迭代預算 | max_iter |\n| 已fit模型校準 | 依FrozenEstimator與獨立資料契約 |\n| Threshold選擇 | TunedThresholdClassifierCV或獨立val搜尋 |\n\n新名稱不是只要搜尋取代；例如正則化的solver支援、prefit模型資料角色與門檻調整，都需要重新檢查語意。30個入口已在1.9.1實際執行，不是僅改標題的版本號。\n\n## Metadata routing與sample weight\n\ngroups、sample_weight等metadata不是一般X欄位。若啟用routing，依目前meta-estimator／pipeline的request傳遞到正確步驟；有些參數要透過params路徑送入CV，不能照舊介面硬塞。1.9.1包含相關修正，升版時尤其要測加權流程是否真的抵達子模型，而非只看fit沒報錯。\n\n## Callbacks與實驗功能\n\n1.9文件有callback系統與相關修正，能支援訓練觀察等用途，但不是所有estimator、後端與用法都相同。主線用最基本穩定fit／CV，進階功能在讀官方API、確認支援後加入；Array API等標示實驗狀態的能力也需明確分別標示，不當作全部硬體已驗證。\n\n## 更新檢查順序\n\n先新venv安裝、跑指標手算、前處理隔離、全部入口與完整專題；再比已fit產物／重訓方案的golden records，檢查校準與threshold；同步原稿、requirements、README、下載ZIP與日期。舊模型檔不保證能直接在新環境載入，保留重訓材料。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n把舊Logistic的penalty='l1'直接換l1_ratio=1，卻仍用不支援solver是否足夠？答案：不足，需配相容solver並測收斂。只有更名不代表完整遷移。若新版預設改變，明確指定本課有意採用的參數，並區分保留舊行為與採用新策略。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [1.9更新紀錄](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/whats_new/v1.9.html)\n- [Logistic API](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.LogisticRegression.html)\n- [Metadata routing](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/metadata_routing.html)\n- [FrozenEstimator](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/generated/sklearn.frozen.FrozenEstimator.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "19api", "name": "1.9版API與遷移：新教材如何避免舊寫法落差", "html": "1.9版API與遷移：新教材如何避免舊寫法落差", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "本課版本基準", "html": "本課版本基準", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "幾個容易照舊文章寫錯的地方", "html": "幾個容易照舊文章寫錯的地方", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "metadata-routingsample-weight", "name": "Metadata routing與sample weight", "html": "Metadata routing與sample weight", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "callbacks", "name": "Callbacks與實驗功能", "html": "Callbacks與實驗功能", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "更新檢查順序", "html": "更新檢查順序", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "58-bridges", "group": "next", "title": "與PyTorch、Embedding及RAG銜接", "summary": "將同一套資料與評估思維帶到神經網路、表示與檢索應用。", "tags": ["PyTorch", "Embedding", "RAG", "deep learning", "connections"], "html": "<h1 id=\"pytorchembeddingrag\">與PyTorch、Embedding及RAG銜接</h1>\n<p>將同一套資料與評估思維帶到神經網路、表示與檢索應用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">機器學習是共同流程</h2>\n<p>定義目標、切分、前處理、fit、驗證、選擇與交付，對線性、樹與神經網路都重要。PyTorch讓你直接寫Tensor、loss與訓練迴圈，sklearn提供較高層estimator介面；切換工具不會消除資料洩漏或評估偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pytorch\">進入PyTorch時保持的契約</h2>\n<p>X與y的shape／dtype、train-only前處理、eval模式、loss與metric區分、保存完整狀態。本課Logistic的機率模型可與單層神經分類器連結，但optimizer、正則化縮放與數值實作不同，不能因公式相似就期待所有超參數相同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"embedding\">Embedding作為特徵</h2>\n<p>以預訓練表示取代TF-IDF後，可接Logistic、kNN、分群或異常方法。保存embedding模型、維度、任務前綴與normalization；同維度不代表同空間。若微調Embedding，也需將資料切分與評估納入，不用test配對調模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rag\">RAG的不同評估層</h2>\n<p>向量檢索有Recall@k、排序、reranking與引用，再接生成答案的正確與依據。不是訓練一個分類器就完成RAG；但本課的threshold、校準、切片與資料分布觀念仍有用。人評與自動指標各有限制，分層診斷比只報一個答案分數更可追蹤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">何時值得升級模型</h2>\n<p>若強表格基準已符合需求，可能先完善資料與交付；若影像、語序、多模態或大規模表示需要不同結構，再學深度學習。選擇以資料、任務與限制為準，不把工具複雜度當學習進度唯一指標。理論、實作工程與應用課各自保留完整主線。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">接續閱讀與練習</h2>\n<p>可讀<a href=\"../pytorch/index.html\">PyTorch實作工程</a>、<a href=\"../embedding/index.html\">Embedding與表示學習</a>、<a href=\"../rag/index.html\">RAG檢索增強生成</a>。練習：同一文字split比較TF-IDF+Logistic與固定Embedding+Logistic，保持評估資料、指標與搜尋預算一致。解答：若Embedding需下載或API，另明確設定與記錄，不把外部條件混進離線範例成績。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html\">Pipeline組合思路</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/neural_networks_supervised.html\">神經網路estimator背景</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 與PyTorch、Embedding及RAG銜接\n\n將同一套資料與評估思維帶到神經網路、表示與檢索應用。\n\n## 機器學習是共同流程\n\n定義目標、切分、前處理、fit、驗證、選擇與交付，對線性、樹與神經網路都重要。PyTorch讓你直接寫Tensor、loss與訓練迴圈，sklearn提供較高層estimator介面；切換工具不會消除資料洩漏或評估偏差。\n\n## 進入PyTorch時保持的契約\n\nX與y的shape／dtype、train-only前處理、eval模式、loss與metric區分、保存完整狀態。本課Logistic的機率模型可與單層神經分類器連結，但optimizer、正則化縮放與數值實作不同，不能因公式相似就期待所有超參數相同。\n\n## Embedding作為特徵\n\n以預訓練表示取代TF-IDF後，可接Logistic、kNN、分群或異常方法。保存embedding模型、維度、任務前綴與normalization；同維度不代表同空間。若微調Embedding，也需將資料切分與評估納入，不用test配對調模型。\n\n## RAG的不同評估層\n\n向量檢索有Recall@k、排序、reranking與引用，再接生成答案的正確與依據。不是訓練一個分類器就完成RAG；但本課的threshold、校準、切片與資料分布觀念仍有用。人評與自動指標各有限制，分層診斷比只報一個答案分數更可追蹤。\n\n## 何時值得升級模型\n\n若強表格基準已符合需求，可能先完善資料與交付；若影像、語序、多模態或大規模表示需要不同結構，再學深度學習。選擇以資料、任務與限制為準，不把工具複雜度當學習進度唯一指標。理論、實作工程與應用課各自保留完整主線。\n\n## 接續閱讀與練習\n\n可讀[PyTorch實作工程](../pytorch/index.html)、[Embedding與表示學習](../embedding/index.html)、[RAG檢索增強生成](../rag/index.html)。練習：同一文字split比較TF-IDF+Logistic與固定Embedding+Logistic，保持評估資料、指標與搜尋預算一致。解答：若Embedding需下載或API，另明確設定與記錄，不把外部條件混進離線範例成績。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Pipeline組合思路](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/compose.html)\n- [神經網路estimator背景](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/modules/neural_networks_supervised.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "pytorchembeddingrag", "name": "與PyTorch、Embedding及RAG銜接", "html": "與PyTorch、Embedding及RAG銜接", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "機器學習是共同流程", "html": "機器學習是共同流程", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "pytorch", "name": "進入PyTorch時保持的契約", "html": "進入PyTorch時保持的契約", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "embedding", "name": "Embedding作為特徵", "html": "Embedding作為特徵", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "rag", "name": "RAG的不同評估層", "html": "RAG的不同評估層", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "何時值得升級模型", "html": "何時值得升級模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "接續閱讀與練習", "html": "接續閱讀與練習", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "59-exercises", "group": "next", "title": "整合練習與解答：自己完成一次可靠學習流程", "summary": "從手算到資料隔離與交付，用具體驗收檢查是否能獨立完成。", "tags": ["exercises", "answers", "practice", "validation"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">整合練習與解答：自己完成一次可靠學習流程</h1>\n<p>從手算到資料隔離與交付，用具體驗收檢查是否能獨立完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">第一組：資料與前處理</h2>\n<p>題1：先全X標準化再CV為何有問題？解答：每折val已參與mean／scale，應把scaler放Pipeline。題2：同文件切20塊後隨機切分？解答：依文件group切，否則相似內容跨集合。題3：新plan未見，是否重新fit encoder？解答：沿用train詞表與unknown政策，記錄新類別率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">第二組：模型與公式</h2>\n<p>題4：x=[0,1,2]、y=[1,3,5]，OLS斜率2、intercept1。題5：Ridge alpha增加與Logistic C增加的限制方向？解答：前者更強、後者更弱。題6：二元4筆各半，父Gini=.5，若兩子純，改善.5；若只一小側純，必須以樣本數加權，不能簡單平均左右。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">第三組：評估與決策</h2>\n<p>題7：y=[1,1,0,0]、p=[.9,.4,.8,.1]，t=.5時TP=FP=FN=TN=1。題8：FN成本5、FP1，t=.4成本1，t=.5成本6；這個選擇只可用validation或適當OOF資料。題9：MAE scoring=-5與-3，哪個好？答案：-3，表示原MAE3較小。</p>\n<p>題10：校準改善是否保證AUC更高？答案：不保證，它處理機率品質；排序可能不變。題11：CV最佳分數直接當最終成績？答案：有選擇樂觀，使用外部holdout或nested CV評估程序。題12：只有一類test可算ROC AUC嗎？答案：通常不適用，回明確狀態並檢查支持數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">第四組：非監督與解釋</h2>\n<p>題13：分群label0與1交換算不同結果嗎？答案：結構可相同，使用ARI等置換不變指標。題14：PCA最大變異保證最好的分類嗎？答案：不保證，PCA不看y。題15：Permutation某欄分數下降很大能說因果？答案：只能描述此模型／資料／metric的依賴，還有相關與人造分布限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">第五組：工程驗收</h2>\n<p>寫自己的專題，要求train/val/test角色清楚、所有fit有邊界、指標可手算、保存整條pipeline與schema、重啟後raw record預測一致、未知與缺失有政策。刻意植入一次欄位順序錯誤或test fit，再寫能抓到的測試。只測函式回傳dict不夠，需驗證行為。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">建議實作答案</h2>\n<p>從第30例複製到新run，先換資料生成而保持介面，再換真實Dataset。列baseline、選參預算、threshold準則與一次final test，附模型卡。不要照抄合成資料的成本與門檻，先依你的使用目的重定義。做完再到第60章核對名詞與實測限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html\">常見錯誤總整理</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/model_selection.html\">評估與選模</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 整合練習與解答：自己完成一次可靠學習流程\n\n從手算到資料隔離與交付，用具體驗收檢查是否能獨立完成。\n\n## 第一組：資料與前處理\n\n題1：先全X標準化再CV為何有問題？解答：每折val已參與mean／scale，應把scaler放Pipeline。題2：同文件切20塊後隨機切分？解答：依文件group切，否則相似內容跨集合。題3：新plan未見，是否重新fit encoder？解答：沿用train詞表與unknown政策，記錄新類別率。\n\n## 第二組：模型與公式\n\n題4：x=[0,1,2]、y=[1,3,5]，OLS斜率2、intercept1。題5：Ridge alpha增加與Logistic C增加的限制方向？解答：前者更強、後者更弱。題6：二元4筆各半，父Gini=.5，若兩子純，改善.5；若只一小側純，必須以樣本數加權，不能簡單平均左右。\n\n## 第三組：評估與決策\n\n題7：y=[1,1,0,0]、p=[.9,.4,.8,.1]，t=.5時TP=FP=FN=TN=1。題8：FN成本5、FP1，t=.4成本1，t=.5成本6；這個選擇只可用validation或適當OOF資料。題9：MAE scoring=-5與-3，哪個好？答案：-3，表示原MAE3較小。\n\n題10：校準改善是否保證AUC更高？答案：不保證，它處理機率品質；排序可能不變。題11：CV最佳分數直接當最終成績？答案：有選擇樂觀，使用外部holdout或nested CV評估程序。題12：只有一類test可算ROC AUC嗎？答案：通常不適用，回明確狀態並檢查支持數。\n\n## 第四組：非監督與解釋\n\n題13：分群label0與1交換算不同結果嗎？答案：結構可相同，使用ARI等置換不變指標。題14：PCA最大變異保證最好的分類嗎？答案：不保證，PCA不看y。題15：Permutation某欄分數下降很大能說因果？答案：只能描述此模型／資料／metric的依賴，還有相關與人造分布限制。\n\n## 第五組：工程驗收\n\n寫自己的專題，要求train/val/test角色清楚、所有fit有邊界、指標可手算、保存整條pipeline與schema、重啟後raw record預測一致、未知與缺失有政策。刻意植入一次欄位順序錯誤或test fit，再寫能抓到的測試。只測函式回傳dict不夠，需驗證行為。\n\n## 建議實作答案\n\n從第30例複製到新run，先換資料生成而保持介面，再換真實Dataset。列baseline、選參預算、threshold準則與一次final test，附模型卡。不要照抄合成資料的成本與門檻，先依你的使用目的重定義。做完再到第60章核對名詞與實測限制。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [常見錯誤總整理](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/common_pitfalls.html)\n- [評估與選模](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/model_selection.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "整合練習與解答：自己完成一次可靠學習流程", "html": "整合練習與解答：自己完成一次可靠學習流程", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "第一組：資料與前處理", "html": "第一組：資料與前處理", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "第二組：模型與公式", "html": "第二組：模型與公式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "第三組：評估與決策", "html": "第三組：評估與決策", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "第四組：非監督與解釋", "html": "第四組：非監督與解釋", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "第五組：工程驗收", "html": "第五組：工程驗收", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "建議實作答案", "html": "建議實作答案", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "60-reference", "group": "next", "title": "速查、名詞與版本：回來查找你的下一步", "summary": "整理本課資料契約、演算法與驗證範圍，讓教材可以持續使用。", "tags": ["reference", "glossary", "1.9.1", "checklist"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">速查、名詞與版本：回來查找你的下一步</h1>\n<p>整理本課資料契約、演算法與驗證範圍，讓教材可以持續使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">版本與實測基準</h2>\n<p>2026-10-30查核最新穩定框架scikit-learn1.9.1；Python3.11.6、NumPy2.4.6、SciPy1.17.1及鎖定依賴實測。數值依賴是Python3.11相容組合；較新的NumPy／SciPy需要Python3.12以上，未冒稱本環境使用所有套件的全球最新版。每次更新重新查官方release與套件索引，再安裝測試。</p>\n<p>本課60章、30個真實sklearn離線入口、45項數值與整合測試。測試包含不同cwd、阻擋socket連線、前處理隔離、group/time邊界、校準、threshold CV、PCA／分群／異常與保存後一致性。資料全部合成或自寫短句，分數不代表真實任務性能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"api\">API與資料契約速查</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>名詞</th>\n<th>本課含義</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>fit</td>\n<td>只在允許的train資料學狀態</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>transform</td>\n<td>用已學規則轉換，不重新fit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>predict</td>\n<td>類別／數值／指定模型的輸出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>predict_proba</td>\n<td>依classes_排列機率欄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>decision_function</td>\n<td>分數，不普遍等於機率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pipeline</td>\n<td>前處理與模型一起clone／fit／保存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CV test_score</td>\n<td>該折驗證分數，不自動是final test</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>threshold</td>\n<td>分數到決策的規則，也需選擇邊界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>calibration</td>\n<td>機率與觀察頻率的一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>leakage</td>\n<td>未見資訊滲入訓練／選擇</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">演算法參數方向</h2>\n<p>Ridge／Lasso alpha大通常限制強；Logistic／SVM C大通常限制弱；kNN k大更平滑；tree depth大更有容量、leaf最小樣本大更受限；forest樹數增加降低某些集成波動；boost learning_rate與步數共同決定預算；KMeans群數不能只靠inertia最小化選。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">已執行與延伸</h2>\n<p>30個編號入口與測試在CPU執行，另外16個內嵌Python片段也已離線執行，包括t-SNE、增量與回歸／分群專題。額外模型／runtime仍需各自驗證。未安裝外部Boosting、UMAP、SHAP、ONNX服務；沒有聲稱GPU或大規模分散式性能。網頁互動是JavaScript數值演示，Python才使用scikit-learn。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">每次開新專案先問</h2>\n<p>答案如何定義與何時可得？部署時能取得哪些特徵？樣本是否獨立？哪個split符合未來？baseline與成本是什麼？所有fit是否在train內？選模／校準／threshold看過哪些資料？模型產物與schema能否重現？分數不確定性與未驗證分布有哪些？</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與下一步</h2>\n<p>不看原稿，向自己解釋fit與transform、AP與accuracy、校準與threshold、模型預測與因果的差異。再以一個小專題實作全部資料邊界並保存產物。數學、統計、深度學習與工程各有獨立課程；以你下一個問題選擇深化方向，保留這裡的驗證習慣。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/user_guide.html\">1.9正式文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/releases/tag/1.9.1\">1.9.1正式發布</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/api/index.html\">完整API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/whats_new/v1.9.html\">更新規範背景</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 速查、名詞與版本：回來查找你的下一步\n\n整理本課資料契約、演算法與驗證範圍，讓教材可以持續使用。\n\n## 版本與實測基準\n\n2026-10-30查核最新穩定框架scikit-learn1.9.1；Python3.11.6、NumPy2.4.6、SciPy1.17.1及鎖定依賴實測。數值依賴是Python3.11相容組合；較新的NumPy／SciPy需要Python3.12以上，未冒稱本環境使用所有套件的全球最新版。每次更新重新查官方release與套件索引，再安裝測試。\n\n本課60章、30個真實sklearn離線入口、45項數值與整合測試。測試包含不同cwd、阻擋socket連線、前處理隔離、group/time邊界、校準、threshold CV、PCA／分群／異常與保存後一致性。資料全部合成或自寫短句，分數不代表真實任務性能。\n\n## API與資料契約速查\n\n| 名詞 | 本課含義 |\n| --- | --- |\n| fit | 只在允許的train資料學狀態 |\n| transform | 用已學規則轉換，不重新fit |\n| predict | 類別／數值／指定模型的輸出 |\n| predict_proba | 依classes_排列機率欄 |\n| decision_function | 分數，不普遍等於機率 |\n| Pipeline | 前處理與模型一起clone／fit／保存 |\n| CV test_score | 該折驗證分數，不自動是final test |\n| threshold | 分數到決策的規則，也需選擇邊界 |\n| calibration | 機率與觀察頻率的一致性 |\n| leakage | 未見資訊滲入訓練／選擇 |\n\n## 演算法參數方向\n\nRidge／Lasso alpha大通常限制強；Logistic／SVM C大通常限制弱；kNN k大更平滑；tree depth大更有容量、leaf最小樣本大更受限；forest樹數增加降低某些集成波動；boost learning_rate與步數共同決定預算；KMeans群數不能只靠inertia最小化選。\n\n## 已執行與延伸\n\n30個編號入口與測試在CPU執行，另外16個內嵌Python片段也已離線執行，包括t-SNE、增量與回歸／分群專題。額外模型／runtime仍需各自驗證。未安裝外部Boosting、UMAP、SHAP、ONNX服務；沒有聲稱GPU或大規模分散式性能。網頁互動是JavaScript數值演示，Python才使用scikit-learn。\n\n## 每次開新專案先問\n\n答案如何定義與何時可得？部署時能取得哪些特徵？樣本是否獨立？哪個split符合未來？baseline與成本是什麼？所有fit是否在train內？選模／校準／threshold看過哪些資料？模型產物與schema能否重現？分數不確定性與未驗證分布有哪些？\n\n## 練習與下一步\n\n不看原稿，向自己解釋fit與transform、AP與accuracy、校準與threshold、模型預測與因果的差異。再以一個小專題實作全部資料邊界並保存產物。數學、統計、深度學習與工程各有獨立課程；以你下一個問題選擇深化方向，保留這裡的驗證習慣。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [1.9正式文件](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/user_guide.html)\n- [1.9.1正式發布](https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/releases/tag/1.9.1)\n- [完整API](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/api/index.html)\n- [更新規範背景](https://scikit-learn.org/1.9/whats_new/v1.9.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "速查、名詞與版本：回來查找你的下一步", "html": "速查、名詞與版本：回來查找你的下一步", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "版本與實測基準", "html": "版本與實測基準", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "api", "name": "API與資料契約速查", "html": "API與資料契約速查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "演算法參數方向", "html": "演算法參數方向", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "已執行與延伸", "html": "已執行與延伸", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "每次開新專案先問", "html": "每次開新專案先問", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與下一步", "html": "練習與下一步", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}]};
